(46, 1, 0, '', '', '<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif\">The Intra-Departmental Box-Cricket Tournament held on 10 September 2025 for Premium students</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif\">.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n', '', '2025-09-10', 1, 0, '2025-11-08 09:15:21', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', NULL, NULL),
(47, 11, 0, '', '', '<p>Gyanmanjari Innovative University proudly organized the cultural event &#39;<strong>Kala Manjari 2025</strong>&#39;, celebrating the spirit of art, talent, and creativity. Here are some memorable moments from the event.</p>\r\n', '', '2025-08-08', 1, 0, '2025-09-12 12:47:32', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', NULL, NULL),
(48, 1, 0, '', '', '<p><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\',serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">The </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\',serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Badminton Tournament activity</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\',serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> was conducted as part of the institution&rsquo;s sports and co-curricular programs to promote physical fitness and teamwork among students. The activity involved singles matches for both boys and girls, allowing wide participation and enthusiasm. Students were divided into groups, and matches were played in a knockout format, creating an exciting and competitive atmosphere.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\',serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Throughout the activity, players displayed excellent skills, coordination, and sportsmanship. Faculty members and sports coordinators supervised the matches and ensured fair play. The audience encouraged participants with great enthusiasm, making the event lively and engaging. The activity not only helped students showcase their athletic abilities but also taught them valuable lessons in discipline, patience, and teamwork. Overall, the badminton activity was a great success, fulfilling its aim of promoting a healthy balance between academics and sports.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\',serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">In the final round, </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\',serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Naitri Andharia</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\',serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> emerged as the </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\',serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>winner in the Girls&rsquo; category</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\',serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, while </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\',serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Krish Joshi</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\',serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> secured the </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\',serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>first position in the Boys&rsquo; category</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\',serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, both displaying outstanding performance and sportsmanship throughout the tournament.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n', '', '2025-10-01', 1, 0, '2025-10-07 10:15:08', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', NULL, NULL),
(49, 1, 0, '', '', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif\">The Chess and Carrom Tournament at Gyanmanjari Institute of Law, Bhavnagar (Venue: FF16)</span></span></p>\r\n', '', '2025-10-16', 1, 0, '2025-11-08 09:17:32', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', NULL, NULL),
(50, 1, 0, '', '', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">The Chess and Carrom Tournament, organized for the Electrical and Electronics &amp; Communication Departments 2025.</span></span></p>\r\n', '', '2025-10-13', 1, 0, '2025-11-08 10:15:14', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', NULL, NULL),
(51, 1, 0, '', '', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">The Inter Department Sports Tournament recently featured exciting competitions in chess and carrom, with enthusiastic participation from students of both B.Tech and Diploma programs.</span></span></p>\r\n', '', '2025-10-15', 1, 0, '2025-11-08 10:17:56', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', NULL, NULL),
(52, 1, 0, '', '', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\">The Department of Mechanical Engineering organized indoor sports competitions in Carrom and Chess for students of the Mechanical and Aeronautical Engineering programs.</p>\r\n', '', '2025-10-13', 1, 0, '2025-11-08 10:49:36', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', NULL, NULL),
(53, 1, 0, '', '', '<p>The Department of Civil Engineering organized an Intra-Department Carrom, chess and basketball Tournament on 14th October 2025.</p>\r\n', '', '2025-10-14', 1, 0, '2025-11-08 10:52:34', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', NULL, NULL),
(54, 11, 0, '', '', '', '', '2025-08-06', 1, 0, '2025-12-12 10:30:02', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', NULL, NULL),
(55, 1, 0, '', '', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\">The Vocational Course on Fitness and Wellness was successfully conducted by the Sports Department from 18th to 20th December 2025 with the objective of equipping students with essential knowledge and practical skills related to fitness training and holistic wellness. The program was led by expert Mr. Rahul Baraiya, who possesses extensive experience in the field of fitness education and professional training.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\">During the three-day course, students were introduced to fundamental concepts of physical fitness, functional training, flexibility exercises, strength conditioning, and injury prevention. The expert emphasized the importance of correct posture, scientific exercise techniques, and consistency in maintaining physical health. Practical demonstrations and hands-on sessions enabled students to understand real-life applications of fitness principles.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\">The course also highlighted the significance of mental well-being, lifestyle management, and balanced nutrition as integral components of wellness. Interactive discussions encouraged students to ask questions and gain clarity on career opportunities in the fitness and wellness industry, including roles such as fitness trainer, wellness coach, and health instructor.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\">Overall, the vocational course proved to be highly informative and engaging. It motivated students to adopt fitness as a lifelong habit while also considering it as a viable professional pathway. The event successfully fulfilled its objective of promoting health awareness and skill development among students.</span></p>\r\n', '', '2025-12-18', 1, 0, '2025-12-22 11:56:23', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', NULL, NULL);
