(25, 1, '1', '6', 'Fundamental of OS', '2023-09-30', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\">Operating Systems (OS) are the backbone of computers, abstracting hardware complexities to provide a user-friendly interface. Essential for degree students, OS fundamentals encompass multitasking, memory management, and security. Mastery of these principles is crucial for software development, system administration, and understanding the core dynamics of modern computing environments.</p>\r\n', NULL, 1, 0, '2024-01-12 12:24:46', '2024-01-12 12:24:46', NULL, NULL),
(26, 1, '1', '6', 'Node JS', '2023-09-30', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\">Node.js revolutionizes web development by enabling server-side JavaScript execution. Asynchronous, event-driven, and scalable, Node.js enhances real-time applications. Vital for degree students, it merges JavaScript proficiency with backend capabilities, fostering a comprehensive understanding of full-stack development and empowering the creation of efficient, responsive web applications.</p>\r\n', NULL, 1, 0, '2024-01-12 12:27:15', '2024-01-12 12:27:15', NULL, NULL),
(27, 8, '1', '133', 'Resume Building', '2023-09-21', '<p>Resume is the most important part of student life. In this session students<br />\r\nimprove their knowledge of the importance of resume building.<br />\r\n● Resume contains a summary of what you do for a living. Whether any executive<br />\r\nassistant or the executive manager of a large corporation, students must be able<br />\r\nto explain what you do.<br />\r\n● The ability to explain your responsibilities and the purpose of your duties is what<br />\r\nenables you to move from one position to another. A well-written resume is<br />\r\nproof that you understand how your tasks and responsibilities fit into the overall<br />\r\ngoals of the organization for which you work.</p>\r\n', NULL, 1, 0, '2024-01-13 06:39:39', '2024-01-13 06:39:39', NULL, NULL),
(28, 8, '1', '133', 'LinkedIn profile', '2023-09-18', '<p>In this Session Students can know the impotence of the profile and<br />\r\nwhat the use of LinkedIn Profile, also students learn how to use<br />\r\nLinkedIn profile.<br />\r\nA complete LinkedIn profile can help you connect with opportunities<br />\r\nby showcasing your unique professional story through experience,<br />\r\nskills, and education.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>LinkedIn is the world&#39;s largest professional network on the internet.<br />\r\nYou can use LinkedIn to find the right job or internship, connect and<br />\r\nstrengthen professional relationships, and learn the skills you need to<br />\r\nsucceed in your career.<br />\r\nUser can access LinkedIn from a desktop, LinkedIn mobile app, or<br />\r\nmobile web experience.</p>\r\n', NULL, 1, 0, '2024-01-13 06:48:44', '2024-01-13 06:48:44', NULL, NULL),
(29, 8, '1', '133', 'Career Advising', '2023-09-15', '<p>Embark on a journey of career wisdom with our expert speaker! In this insightful talk, BCA students will gain valuable guidance on navigating the dynamic world of technology. Discover key strategies for success, explore emerging trends, and receive practical advice for shaping a rewarding career. Don&#39;t miss this opportunity to set a course for your professional future!</p>\r\n', NULL, 1, 0, '2024-01-13 08:12:24', '2024-01-13 08:12:24', NULL, NULL),
(30, 8, '1', '133', 'Communication Skill Enhancements', '2023-10-31', '<p>Communication Skill Enhancement gives students the opportunity to learn more about effective communication. It helps and guide students and makes their interactions easy with others. It helps to improve communication skills for the betterment in future.<br />\r\nExpert person Prof. Hema Goswami ma&rsquo;am provided best guidance to students, for improving their communication skills.<br />\r\nShe taught students How to Develop Better Communication Skills and other skills as well.<br />\r\nAlso teaches Tips to improve Communication Skills.</p>\r\n', NULL, 1, 0, '2024-01-13 08:16:00', '2024-01-13 08:16:00', NULL, NULL),
