(51, 1, '5', '25', 'Skill Development Program', '2023-09-23', '<p>Skill Development Program is a technical activity in which the students are taught some extra technical activities apart from their regular academic subjects</p>\r\n', '2024-01-13-84-SDP for 3rd diploma.docx', 0, 1, '2024-01-13 09:31:20', '2024-01-13 09:31:20', NULL, NULL),
(52, 1, '5', '25', 'Domain Selection and Awareness', '2023-10-10', '<p>The Department of Computer Science and Engineering had organized the Expert Talk on Domain Selection and Awareness Date : 10th October,2024&nbsp;for&nbsp; engineering students.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n', '2024-12-19-100-domain.pdf', 1, 0, '2024-01-13 10:07:59', '2024-01-13 10:07:59', NULL, NULL),
(53, 1, '5', '24', 'FEMM TOOL', '2019-05-02', '<ul>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\"><span style=\"color:black\">The main objective of this workshop was to make students understand importance of Finite Element Method in recent times. Also, the session was planned with intention of filling the bridge gap between industry &amp; academics through training of FEMM 4.2 simulation environment.</span></span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n', NULL, 1, 0, '2024-01-13 10:31:00', '2024-01-13 10:31:00', NULL, NULL),
(54, 1, '5', '24', 'SIMULATION WITH PROTEUS', '2020-02-01', '<ul>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\"><span style=\"color:black\">Prof. Nitin Adroja &amp; Prof. Dhaval Raval from AITS, Rajkot for conducting the workshop along with hands on practice based on &ldquo;Simulation with Proteus and Interfacing with Arduino&rdquo;.</span></span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n', NULL, 1, 0, '2024-01-13 10:31:52', '2024-01-13 10:31:52', NULL, NULL),
(55, 1, '5', '24', 'SOLAR ENERGY SCOPE', '2020-09-05', '<ul>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\"><span style=\"color:black\">Mr. Pratik Bhuva, MD,BNB Solar, BNB Group for the seminar conducted based on Solar Energy Scope: Future of Renewable Energy.</span></span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n', NULL, 1, 0, '2024-01-13 10:32:31', '2024-01-13 10:32:31', NULL, NULL),
(56, 1, '5', '24', 'POWER PLANT THEORY', '2020-10-23', '<ul>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\"><span style=\"color:black\">Mr. Keyur S. Dhagia, Engineer, Hindalco Captive Power Plant (CPP), Renukoot, Uttar Pradesh for the seminar conducted based on Power Plant Engineering and management.</span></span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n', NULL, 1, 0, '2024-01-13 10:33:07', '2024-01-13 10:33:07', NULL, NULL),
(57, 1, '5', '24', 'GLOBAL WARMING AND ELECTRICAL ENGINEER', '2020-05-30', '<p><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\"><span style=\"color:black\">The main purpose of this lecture was to explain the importance of Global warming to the students and make them aware about various outcomes if the issue is not taken with serious consideration.</span></span></p>\r\n', NULL, 1, 0, '2024-01-13 10:33:47', '2024-01-13 10:33:47', NULL, NULL),
(58, 1, '5', '24', 'FINITE ELEMENT METHOD', '2019-01-25', '<ul>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\"><span style=\"color:black\">The main objective of this workshop was to make students understand importance of Finite Element Method in recent times. Also, the session was planned with intention of filling the bridge gap between industry &amp; academics through training of FEMM 4.2 simulation environment.</span></span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n', NULL, 1, 0, '2024-01-13 10:34:22', '2024-01-13 10:34:22', NULL, NULL),
(59, 1, '5', '24', 'ROLE OF ELECTRICAL ENGINEER IN ONGC', '2018-12-05', '<ul>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\"><span style=\"color:black\">Since we had an expert from ONGC, the main objective of this expert lecture was to introduce students with working as part of ONGC and required skills for making one compatible with requirements of such PSUs.</span></span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n', NULL, 1, 0, '2024-01-13 10:35:24', '2024-01-13 10:35:24', NULL, NULL),
(60, 1, '5', '24', 'AMIYA THAKOR (ENLIGHTED ELECTRODES)', '2019-02-05', '<ul>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\"><span style=\"color:black\">The felicitator invited was Mr. Amiya Thakor from Apikore Corporation Ahmedabad, operating multiple businesses like Architectural Planning and Engineering Consultancy services and Turn-key Project execution for sixteen years.The field of Electrical Engineering and role of Electrical Engineers was briefly explained. Electrical engineers conduct research, and design, develop, test, and oversee the development of electrical systems.</span></span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n', NULL, 1, 0, '2024-01-13 10:36:12', '2024-01-13 10:36:12', NULL, NULL),
(61, 1, '5', '24', 'MAHENDRA NATHAVAT (GLOBAL WARMING &amp; ROLE OF ELECTRICAL ENGINEER)', '2019-06-25', '<ul>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\"><span style=\"color:black\">An expert talk was organized for the 1st and 3rd semester students of Electrical Engineering based on Global Warming &amp; Role of Electrical Engineer. Mr. Mahendra Nathavat was the expert invited to deliver the talk. He is retired Dy. Commissioner of Industries, Government of Gujarat.</span></span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n', NULL, 1, 0, '2024-01-13 10:37:15', '2024-01-13 10:37:15', NULL, NULL),
(62, 1, '5', '24', 'ADVANCE WELDING TECHNOLOGY', '2017-10-31', '<ul>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\"><span style=\"color:black\">An expert talk was organized for the 1st semester students of Electrical Engineering based on Global Warming &amp; Role of Electrical Engineer.Expert Dr. Jignesh Makwana was key well know entrepreneur of Bhavnagar. Dr Jignesh makwana is founder and CEO of rhymak electronics limited. Company is involving in the online business of the electronics starter and electrical vehicles manufacture.</span></span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n', NULL, 1, 0, '2024-01-13 10:38:12', '2024-01-13 10:38:12', NULL, NULL),
(63, 1, '5', '23', 'Hum Main Hai HERO', '2023-07-25', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\">&quot;Hum Main Hai HERO&quot; means that you have the strength, courage, and resilience to overcome any challenge. It is a reminder that you are capable of great things, and that you should never give up on yourself.&nbsp;Bharat Vaghela sir shares his insights on how to overcome upcoming problems using inner strength.</p>\r\n', NULL, 1, 0, '2024-01-14 08:24:53', '2024-01-14 08:24:53', NULL, NULL),
(64, 1, '5', '25', 'Navigating Your Career: Insights from a Carrier Guidance', '2023-09-15', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\">Embark on a journey of career wisdom with our expert speaker! In this insightful talk, IT diploma students will gain valuable guidance on navigating the dynamic world of technology. Discover key strategies for success, explore emerging trends, and receive practical advice for shaping a rewarding IT career. Don&#39;t miss this opportunity to set a course for your professional future!</p>\r\n', NULL, 0, 1, '2024-01-14 08:32:52', '2024-01-14 08:32:52', NULL, NULL),
(65, 1, '1', '6', 'MOTIVATIONAL &amp; CAREER TALK', '2015-09-12', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\">On September 12, 2015, Shri M. M. Nakrani (Chairman of GMIT) successfully carried out the motivational and career talk for the 1st semester students of Gyanmanjari Institute of Technology, Bhavnagar.</p>\r\n', NULL, 1, 0, '2024-01-14 08:52:20', '2024-01-14 08:52:20', NULL, NULL),
(66, 1, '1', '6', 'EFFECTIVE COMMUNICATION SKILLS', '2015-05-12', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\">On the 12th of September 2015, an expert talk on &ldquo;Effective Communication Skills&rdquo; was conducted inside the seminar hall at Gyanmanjari Institute of Technology, Bhavnagar. The expert talk was exclusively arranged for the first year students of Mechanical, Civil,Computer, IT &amp; Electrical branches.Mr. RajuAndharia of PASS academy, Bhavnagar was our expert speaker on this occasion.</p>\r\n', NULL, 1, 0, '2024-01-14 08:53:39', '2024-01-14 08:53:39', NULL, NULL),
(67, 1, '1', '6', 'CAREER GUIDANCE &amp; DEVELOPMENT', '2015-10-17', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\">We organize an expert talk on Career guidance and development from Mr. Sachin Sahegal (Training and Placement Officer, Pundit Dindayal Petroleum University, Gandhinagar)Mr.Sachin Sahegal having vast knowledge and experience in Training and Placement sector, formerly he was used to be work with Nirma University and had placed over 14,000 engineering students in their desired field.</p>\r\n', '2024-01-14-97-Career Guidance & Development.pdf', 1, 0, '2024-01-14 08:57:43', '2024-01-14 08:57:43', NULL, NULL),
(68, 1, '1', '6', 'HTML &amp; PHP EXPERT LECTURE', '2016-03-02', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\">A One Day Workshop on HTML and PHP was organized by Computer Engineering Department of Gyanmanjari Institute of Technology on 02, March, 2016. The primary goal of this One Day Workshop is to enhance the technical knowledge of students about HTML and PHP. Our Expert Dr. Milan Vachhani (Owner and Director of Virtue Point Infotech. Rajkot) shres knowledge about HTML &amp; PHP.</p>\r\n', '2024-01-14-33-HTML & PHP Expert Lecture.pdf', 1, 0, '2024-01-14 09:00:36', '2024-01-14 09:00:36', NULL, NULL),
(69, 1, '1', '6', 'UNLEARN YOUR ENGINEERING', '2017-12-26', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\">Mr. Kunjan Dalal from FuzzyCloud.in, Pune had discussed 1.Programming language student know, 2.Programming language student should know, 3.How to decrease size of code through F#, 4.Few core concept of any functional Programming language, 5.Discussion on Web and Mobile Platform, 6.Concept of Distributed System, 7.Data Science, 8.Devops &amp; 9.Live Mock Interview.</p>\r\n', '2024-01-14-59-Unlearn Your Engineering.pdf', 1, 0, '2024-01-14 09:02:54', '2024-01-14 09:02:54', NULL, NULL),
(70, 1, '1', '6', 'EMPOWERING WOMEN FOR BLOOD DONATION', '2017-03-11', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\">Mahesh C. Trivedi (Advisor, Indian Red Cross Society, Ahmadabad) as an Expert Came to give his idea about women empowerment &amp; blood donation. He is a member of Indian Red Cross Society since 1967. He has been working as an Honorary Secretary from 2001 to 2012. He was an Honorary Advisor of Indian Red Cross Society, Ahmadabad from 2012.</p>\r\n', '2024-01-14-36-Empowering Women For Blood Donation.pdf', 1, 0, '2024-01-14 09:06:11', '2024-01-14 09:06:11', NULL, NULL),
(71, 1, '1', '6', 'INTERNET OF THINGS', '2017-03-06', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\">Internet of Things is no longer a theoretical concept but is rapidly becoming reality. IoT is a scenario where machines communicate with other machines and devices through embedded sensors. The idea behind IoT is to create a well-connected world. Statistics show that by the year 2020 we will have close to 13.5 billion connected devices across the globe. Mr. Hardik Waghela and Paresh Sir from Tops Technology, Bhavnagar had given expert lecture about IoT.</p>\r\n', '2024-01-14-42-Internet of Things.pdf', 1, 0, '2024-01-14 09:08:40', '2024-01-14 09:08:40', NULL, NULL),
(72, 1, '1', '6', 'CURRENT MARKET TRENDS IN SOFTWARE INDUSTRY', '2019-01-07', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\">An Expert Talk on Leading Technologies was organized by Information Technology Engineering Department of Gyanmanjari Institute of Technology on 7th of January, 2019. The primary goal of this Expert Talk was to enhance the technical knowledge of students about the Leading Technologies in IT field.</p>\r\n', '2024-01-14-25-Current Market Trends in Software Industry.pdf', 1, 0, '2024-01-14 09:12:52', '2024-01-14 09:12:52', NULL, NULL),
(73, 1, '1', '6', 'NATION WEBINAR ON CYBER SECURITY BY DR. VARUN KAPOOR', '2020-06-08', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\">Dr. Varun Kapoor is Additional Director General of Police, Madhya Pradesh. He give webinar on cyber security as today this is the era of internet of things, He guides student to be aware of todays technology.</p>\r\n', NULL, 1, 0, '2024-01-14 09:14:32', '2024-01-14 09:14:32', NULL, NULL),
(74, 1, '1', '6', 'INTRODUCTION TO DIGITAL MARKETING AND SEO BY MR. BHAVESH VALAND', '2020-06-20', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\">Digital marketing refers to advertising delivered through digital channels such as search engines, websites, social media, email, and mobile apps. Using these online media channels, digital marketing is the method by which companies endorse goods, services, and brands.</p>\r\n', NULL, 1, 0, '2024-01-14 09:16:09', '2024-01-14 09:16:09', NULL, NULL),
(75, 1, '5', '3', 'Power generation and distribution', '2023-10-31', '<p>The Department of Electrical Engineering had organized the expert lecture on Electrical Power<br />\r\ngeneration and distribution by Piyusha Joshi ma&rsquo;am who is presently working as junior engineer<br />\r\nPGVCL- Bhavnagar. It was organized on October 31st 2023 (Tuesday). This lecture proved to be<br />\r\nvery helpful students to gain the knowledge about how the power generation and distribution is<br />\r\nactually carried out in the DISCOM . The students have actively participated in the activity.<br />\r\nStudents were also made aware about the future opportunities in the technical field . The expert<br />\r\nhas also shared her valuable feedback as a junior engineer in DISCOM. She, being our alumni too,<br />\r\nan alumni talk is also arranged as per the college protocol. Such events brings about a positive<br />\r\nchange in their thinking and practical behavior regarding education and specializing their<br />\r\ntechnical skills. Under the guidance of Head of department Prof. Niti Gupta ma&rsquo;am, students<br />\r\ngained much knowledge and were inspired.</p>\r\n', NULL, 0, 1, '2024-01-15 07:44:41', '2024-01-15 07:44:41', NULL, NULL),
(76, 1, '1', '2', 'Start up, Innovation &amp; Career opportunities in HVAC Industries', '2022-08-06', '<p style=\"margin-right:28px\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:black\">An Expert talk about &quot;Career opportunity in HVAC field and opportunity in startup &amp; &nbsp;innovation in HVAC field&quot; was successfully organized&nbsp; in GMIU. This talk was Jointly Organized with the GMIU and the Student Chapter ISHRAE-India. Two experts chaired&nbsp; the event viz. Mr. Prashant Pathak, who is the Director OFM/s. Phalange Industries Pvt. Ltd. and Mr. Rohit Dave( Ex. Manager at GSFC Ltd.-Vadodara), were the &nbsp;International Motivational Speaker and soft skill Trainer.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n', NULL, 1, 0, '2024-01-15 07:52:57', '2024-01-15 07:52:57', NULL, NULL),
(77, 1, '5', '22', 'Start up, Innovation &amp; Career opportunities in HVAC industires', '2022-08-06', '<p>An Expert talk about &quot;Career opportunity in HVAC field and opportunity in startup &amp; &nbsp;innovation in HVAC field&quot; was successfully organized&nbsp; in GMIU. This talk was Jointly Organized with the GMIU and the Student Chapter ISHRAE-India. Two experts chaired&nbsp; the event viz. Mr. Prashant Pathak, who is the Director OFM/s. Phalange Industries Pvt. Ltd. and Mr. Rohit Dave( Ex. Manager at GSFC Ltd.-Vadodara), were the &nbsp;International Motivational Speaker and soft skill Trainer.&nbsp;</p>\r\n', NULL, 1, 0, '2024-01-15 07:53:50', '2024-01-15 07:53:50', NULL, NULL);
