(85, 1, '1', '3', 'FEMM TOOL', '2019-05-02', '<p>The main objective of this workshop was to make students understand importance of Finite Element Method in recent times. Also, the session was planned with intention of filling the bridge gap between industry &amp; academics through training of FEMM 4.2 simulation environment.</p>\r\n', NULL, 1, 0, '2024-01-17 02:10:21', '2024-01-17 02:10:21', NULL, NULL),
(86, 1, '1', '3', 'SIMULATION WITH PROTEUS', '2020-02-01', '<p>Prof. Nitin Adroja &amp; Prof. Dhaval Raval from AITS, Rajkot for conducting the workshop along with hands on practice based on &ldquo;Simulation with Proteus and Interfacing with Arduino&rdquo;.</p>\r\n', NULL, 1, 0, '2024-01-17 02:11:13', '2024-01-17 02:11:13', NULL, NULL),
(87, 1, '1', '3', 'SOLAR ENERGY SCOPE', '2020-09-05', '<p>Mr. Pratik Bhuva, MD,BNB Solar, BNB Group for the seminar conducted based on Solar Energy Scope: Future of Renewable Energy.</p>\r\n', NULL, 1, 0, '2024-01-17 02:11:56', '2024-01-17 02:11:56', NULL, NULL),
(88, 1, '1', '3', 'POWER PLANT THEORY', '2020-10-23', '<p>Mr. Keyur S. Dhagia, Engineer, Hindalco Captive Power Plant (CPP), Renukoot, Uttar Pradesh for the seminar conducted based on Power Plant Engineering and management.</p>\r\n', NULL, 1, 0, '2024-01-17 02:12:36', '2024-01-17 02:12:36', NULL, NULL),
(89, 1, '1', '3', 'GLOBAL WARMING AND ELECTRICAL ENGINEER', '2020-05-30', '', NULL, 1, 0, '2024-01-17 02:13:08', '2024-01-17 02:13:08', NULL, NULL),
(90, 1, '1', '3', 'FINITE ELEMENT METHOD', '2019-01-25', '<p>The main objective of this workshop was to make students understand importance of Finite Element Method in recent times. Also, the session was planned with intention of filling the bridge gap between industry &amp; academics through training of FEMM 4.2 simulation environment.</p>\r\n', NULL, 1, 0, '2024-01-17 02:13:42', '2024-01-17 02:13:42', NULL, NULL),
(91, 1, '1', '3', 'ROLE OF ELECTRICAL ENGINEER IN ONGC', '2018-12-05', '<p>Since we had an expert from ONGC, the main objective of this expert lecture was to introduce students with working as part of ONGC and required skills for making one compatible with requirements of such PSUs.</p>\r\n', NULL, 1, 0, '2024-01-17 02:14:27', '2024-01-17 02:14:27', NULL, NULL),
(92, 1, '1', '3', 'AMIYA THAKOR (ENLIGHTED ELECTRODES)', '2019-02-05', '<p>The felicitator invited was Mr. Amiya Thakor from Apikore Corporation Ahmedabad, operating multiple businesses like Architectural Planning and Engineering Consultancy services and Turn-key Project execution for sixteen years.The field of Electrical Engineering and role of Electrical Engineers was briefly explained. Electrical engineers conduct research, and design, develop, test, and oversee the development of electrical systems.</p>\r\n', NULL, 1, 0, '2024-01-17 02:15:22', '2024-01-17 02:15:22', NULL, NULL),
(93, 1, '1', '3', 'MAHENDRA NATHAVAT (GLOBAL WARMING &amp; ROLE OF ELECTRICAL ENGINEER)', '2019-06-25', '<p>An expert talk was organized for the 1st and 3rd semester students of Electrical Engineering based on Global Warming &amp; Role of Electrical Engineer. Mr. Mahendra Nathavat was the expert invited to deliver the talk. He is retired Dy. Commissioner of Industries, Government of Gujarat.</p>\r\n', NULL, 1, 0, '2024-01-17 02:16:20', '2024-01-17 02:16:20', NULL, NULL),
(94, 1, '1', '3', 'ADVANCE WELDING TECHNOLOGY', '2017-10-31', '<p>An expert talk was organized for the 1st semester students of Electrical Engineering based on Global Warming &amp; Role of Electrical Engineer.Expert Dr. Jignesh Makwana was key well know entrepreneur of Bhavnagar. Dr Jignesh makwana is founder and CEO of rhymak electronics limited. Company is involving in the online business of the electronics starter and electrical vehicles manufacture.</p>\r\n', NULL, 1, 0, '2024-01-17 02:16:57', '2024-01-17 02:16:57', NULL, NULL),
(95, 1, '1', '2', 'BASICS OF PSYCHOMETRY (28-01-2022)', '2022-01-28', '<ul>\r\n	<li>This technical talk is intended to update and upgrade the Technical Skills and Fundamental Knowledge of HVAC Also In this expert talk, we focused on motivate the students to built their career in HVAC field.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n', '2024-01-17-91-psy28122.pdf', 1, 0, '2024-01-17 07:01:47', '2024-01-17 07:01:47', NULL, NULL),
(96, 1, '5', '22', 'BASICS OF PSYCHOMETRY', '2022-01-28', '<ul>\r\n	<li>This technical talk is intended to update and upgrade the Technical Skills and Fundamental Knowledge of HVAC Also In this expert talk, we focused on motivate the students to built their career in HVAC field.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n', '2024-01-17-62-psy28122.pdf', 1, 0, '2024-01-17 07:02:45', '2024-01-17 07:02:45', NULL, NULL),
(97, 1, '1', '2', 'ISRO A GLORIOUS JOURNEY TO SPACE', '2021-09-20', '<ul>\r\n	<li>Mr. Jayan sir stared his session and he talked about history of ISRO and about how&nbsp;India decided to go to space when Indian National Committee for Space Research (INCOSPAR) which was set up by the Government of India in 1962. With the visionary Dr Vikram Sarabhai at its helm, INCOSPAR set up the Thumba Equatorial Rocket Launching Station (TERLS) in Thiruvananthapuram for upper atmospheric research.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n', '2024-01-17-30-ISRO.pdf', 1, 0, '2024-01-17 07:05:04', '2024-01-17 07:05:04', NULL, NULL),
(98, 1, '5', '22', 'ISRO A GLORIOUS JOURNEY TO SPACE', '2021-09-20', '<ul>\r\n	<li>Then Jayan sir stared his session and he talked about history of ISRO. He said that India decided to go to space when Indian National Committee for Space Research (INCOSPAR) was set up by the Government of India in 1962. With the visionary Dr Vikram Sarabhai at its helm, INCOSPAR set up the Thumba Equatorial Rocket Launching Station (TERLS) in Thiruvananthapuram for upper atmospheric research.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n', '2024-01-17-22-ISRO.pdf', 1, 0, '2024-01-17 07:05:54', '2024-01-17 07:05:54', NULL, NULL),
(99, 1, '1', '2', 'EFFECTIVE CV WRITING (ONLINE)', '2021-07-05', '<ul>\r\n	<li>Professor encourage the students of Gyanmanjari Institute of Technology for actively participation in the session. Then Mr. Ashutosh Sali started the webinar on Effective CV Writing.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n', '2024-01-17-27-Effective CV.pdf', 1, 0, '2024-01-17 07:06:58', '2024-01-17 07:06:58', NULL, NULL),
(100, 1, '5', '22', 'EFFECTIVE CV WRITING (ONLINE)', '2021-07-05', '<ul>\r\n	<li>Professor encourage the students of Gyanmanjari Institute of Technology for actively participation in the session. Then Mr. Ashutosh Sali started the webinar on Effective CV Writing.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n', '2024-01-17-36-Effective CV.pdf', 1, 0, '2024-01-17 07:07:47', '2024-01-17 07:07:47', NULL, NULL),
(101, 1, '1', '2', 'IPR &amp; ITS ROLE IN RESEARCH AND INNOVATION', '2021-09-15', '<ul>\r\n	<li>A Workshop on intellectual Property Rights was conducted at GMIT campus. The workshop was jointly organized by SSIP. The venue was the seminar hall of the college. 132 participants were attended the Workshop. The workshop was inaugurated by our principal sir and HOD of mechanical at 10 am.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n', '2024-01-17-74-Engineers Day.pdf', 1, 0, '2024-01-17 07:09:50', '2024-01-17 07:09:50', NULL, NULL),
