(168, 8, '1', '226', 'Career Advising', '2023-09-15', '<p>Embark on a journey of career wisdom with our expert speaker! In this insightful talk, BCA students will gain valuable guidance on navigating the dynamic world of technology. Discover key strategies for success, explore emerging trends, and receive practical advice for shaping a rewarding career. Don&#39;t miss this opportunity to set a course for your professional future!</p>\r\n', NULL, 1, 0, '2024-02-22 16:46:39', '2024-02-22 16:46:39', NULL, NULL),
(169, 8, '1', '226', 'Resume Building', '2023-09-21', '<p>Resume is the most important part of student life. In this session students<br />\r\nimprove their knowledge of the importance of resume building.<br />\r\n● Resume contains a summary of what you do for a living. Whether any executive<br />\r\nassistant or the executive manager of a large corporation, students must be able<br />\r\nto explain what you do.<br />\r\n● The ability to explain your responsibilities and the purpose of your duties is what<br />\r\nenables you to move from one position to another. A well-written resume is<br />\r\nproof that you understand how your tasks and responsibilities fit into the overall<br />\r\ngoals of the organization for which you work.</p>\r\n', NULL, 1, 0, '2024-02-22 16:52:23', '2024-02-22 16:52:23', NULL, NULL),
(170, 8, '1', '89', 'Artificial Intelligence', '2024-02-27', '<p>Session Talk organized for the students of BCA and MCA on topic&nbsp; Artificial Intelligence&nbsp;by Computer Application Department.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Students of Computer Application has enjoy and Learn from this session and gain knowledge of impact of AI in industries and current and upcoming job opportunities in AI.</p>\r\n', NULL, 1, 0, '2024-03-01 08:41:36', '2024-03-01 08:41:36', NULL, NULL),
