(176, 3, '1', '38', 'Innovation in Seaweed Farming: Towards Sustainable Tomorrow', '2024-02-03', '<p>An informative and thoughts provoking lecture as Guest Speaker on &ldquo;Innovation in Seaweed Farming: Towards Sustainable Tomorrow&rdquo; held at Gyanmanjari Science College, Bhavnagar. It was really a splendid presentation which exposed students to the field practices. All the students appreciated and got benefited from your views on the subjects. &nbsp;<br />\r\nExpert talk was delivered by Dr. Vaibhav Mantri, scientist at Central Salt &amp; Marine Chemicals Research Institute (Council of Scientific &amp; Industrial Research), G. B. Marg Bhavnagar 364002, Gujarat, India. 80 students attended the expert talk.&nbsp;</p>\r\n', '2024-03-05-61-Report-Expert Talk- Dr. Vaibhav Mantry.pdf', 1, 0, '2024-03-05 11:47:17', '2024-03-05 11:47:17', NULL, NULL),
