(242, 8, '2', '90', 'Artificial Intelligence', '2024-02-27', '<p>Session Talk organized for the students of BCA and MCA on topic&nbsp; Artificial Intelligence&nbsp;by Computer Application Department.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Students of Computer Application has enjoy and Learn from this session and gain knowledge of impact of AI in industries and current and upcoming job opportunities in AI.</p>\r\n', NULL, 1, 0, '2024-03-13 09:48:25', '2024-03-13 09:48:25', NULL, NULL),
