(266, 8, '1', '89', 'Skill enhancement', '2024-08-14', '<p>Skill enhancement for students is a crucial aspect of modern education, designed to prepare them for the complexities of the professional world. It involves developing a blend of technical, cognitive, and interpersonal skills that are essential for success in both academic and career pursuits. Through targeted training and practical experiences, students can sharpen their problem-solving abilities, enhance their communication and collaboration skills, and adapt to new technologies and methodologies.&nbsp;</p>\r\n', '2024-09-17-47-Skill  enhancement.pdf', 1, 0, '2024-09-17 07:06:29', '2024-09-17 07:06:29', NULL, NULL),
