(272, 1, '1', '3', 'Workshop on  “Modern Trends in Electrical Engineering”', '2024-08-08', '<p>A workshop on &quot;Modern Trends in Electrical Engineering&quot; was held on 8-08-2024, bringing together professionals, academics, and students to discuss the latest advancements and innovations in the field of electrical engineering. The event aimed to provide a platform for knowledge exchange, networking, and collaboration among participants.&nbsp;</p>\r\n', '2024-11-30-75-workshop.pdf', 1, 0, '2024-11-30 06:45:32', '2024-11-30 06:45:32', NULL, NULL),
(273, 1, '5', '25', 'Web Designing &amp;amp; Advance CSS and  Figma', '2024-08-01', '<p>The objective of this Expert Talk was to enhance students&amp;#39; knowledge in Website Designing,&nbsp;Advanced CSS, and the Figma tool, providing insights from industry leaders Himanshu sir<br />\r\nVaghela and Bhargav sir of Code Decorator. The session aimed to bridge the gap between&nbsp;academic learning and industry practices, empowering students with practical skills and<br />\r\nexpertise in cutting-edge web development technologies.</p>\r\n', '2024-12-03-90-01-Aug-2024-Expert Talk-Code Decorator-SEM-3.docx', 0, 1, '2024-12-03 08:25:28', '2024-12-03 08:25:28', NULL, NULL),
(274, 1, '5', '25', 'Web Designing &amp;amp; Advance CSS and  Figma', '2024-08-01', '<p>The Department of Computer Science and Engineering had organized the Expert Talk on&nbsp; Web Designing &amp;amp; Advance CSS and Figma Date : 1st&nbsp; August,2024&nbsp;for Diploma&nbsp; engineering students.</p>\r\n', NULL, 1, 0, '2024-12-03 08:29:46', '2024-12-03 08:29:46', NULL, NULL),
(275, 1, '5', '25', 'Cyber Security', '2024-09-27', '<p>The Department of Computer Science and Engineering had organized the Expert Talk on Cyber Security date : 27th September,2024&nbsp;for Diploma and Degree engineering students.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n', NULL, 1, 0, '2024-12-19 07:12:49', '2024-12-19 07:12:49', NULL, NULL),
(276, 1, '1', '4', 'Cyber Security', '2024-09-27', '<p>The Department of Computer Science and Engineering had organized the Expert Talk on Cyber Security date : 27th September,2024&nbsp;for Diploma and Degree engineering students.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n', NULL, 1, 0, '2024-12-19 07:23:14', '2024-12-19 07:23:14', NULL, NULL),
(277, 1, '5', '213', 'Emerging trends in electrical engineering Innovations in renewable energy and smart technologies (santosh jani)', '2024-10-11', '<p>The event successfully facilitated knowledge exchange and networking, significantly benefiting the electrical engineering students. Future sessions are planned to continue this engagement, enhancing students&#39; readiness for their professional journeys.&nbsp;<br />\r\n&nbsp;<br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n', '2024-12-24-48-2023-11-29-39-66.pdf', 1, 0, '2024-12-24 05:33:07', '2024-12-24 05:33:07', NULL, NULL),
(278, 1, '5', '24', 'Emerging trends in electrical engineering Innovations in renewable energy and smart technologies (santosh jani)', '2024-10-11', '<p>The event successfully facilitated knowledge exchange and networking, significantly benefiting the electrical engineering students. Future sessions are planned to continue this engagement, enhancing students&#39; readiness for their professional journeys.&nbsp;</p>\r\n', '2024-12-24-68-expert talk & alumni.pdf', 1, 0, '2024-12-24 07:12:15', '2024-12-24 07:12:15', NULL, NULL),
(279, 1, '5', '22', 'Exper Talk on 3D Printers', '2024-10-14', '<p>Prof. Jignesh delivered an insightful session on 3D printing, introducing engineering students to its principles and transformative potential in modern manufacturing. He explained additive manufacturing, detailing how 3D printers build objects layer by layer from digital blueprints, and explored the diverse materials used, such as plastics, resins, and metals, highlighting their impact on product properties. Through a live demonstration, students gained hands-on experience with model preparation, calibration, material handling, and machine operation, learning how adjustments influence output quality. Prof. Jignesh illustrated real-world applications across industries like automotive, aerospace, and healthcare, showcasing its use in rapid prototyping and customized medical solutions. Encouraging creativity, he guided students to design and print their models, fostering problem-solving and innovation. The session concluded with a discussion on future advancements, including multi-material printing and sustainable practices, inspiring students to leverage 3D printing in their careers and contribute to industry innovation.</p>\r\n', '2024-12-24-98-Expert Talk Report.pdf', 1, 0, '2024-12-24 07:28:28', '2024-12-24 07:28:28', NULL, NULL),
(280, 1, '1', '2', 'Exper Talk on 3D Printers', '2024-10-14', '<p>Prof. Jignesh delivered an insightful session on 3D printing, introducing engineering students to its principles and transformative potential in modern manufacturing. He explained additive manufacturing, detailing how 3D printers build objects layer by layer from digital blueprints, and explored the diverse materials used, such as plastics, resins, and metals, highlighting their impact on product properties. Through a live demonstration, students gained hands-on experience with model preparation, calibration, material handling, and machine operation, learning how adjustments influence output quality. Prof. Jignesh illustrated real-world applications across industries like automotive, aerospace, and healthcare, showcasing its use in rapid prototyping and customized medical solutions. Encouraging creativity, he guided students to design and print their models, fostering problem-solving and innovation. The session concluded with a discussion on future advancements, including multi-material printing and sustainable practices, inspiring students to leverage 3D printing in their careers and contribute to industry innovation.</p>\r\n', '2024-12-24-78-Expert Talk Report.pdf', 1, 0, '2024-12-24 07:33:54', '2024-12-24 07:33:54', NULL, NULL),
(281, 1, '1', '290', 'Exper Talk on 3D Printers', '2024-10-14', '<p>Prof. Jignesh delivered an insightful session on 3D printing, introducing engineering students to its principles and transformative potential in modern manufacturing. He explained additive manufacturing, detailing how 3D printers build objects layer by layer from digital blueprints, and explored the diverse materials used, such as plastics, resins, and metals, highlighting their impact on product properties. Through a live demonstration, students gained hands-on experience with model preparation, calibration, material handling, and machine operation, learning how adjustments influence output quality. Prof. Jignesh illustrated real-world applications across industries like automotive, aerospace, and healthcare, showcasing its use in rapid prototyping and customized medical solutions. Encouraging creativity, he guided students to design and print their models, fostering problem-solving and innovation. The session concluded with a discussion on future advancements, including multi-material printing and sustainable practices, inspiring students to leverage 3D printing in their careers and contribute to industry innovation.</p>\r\n', '2024-12-24-81-Expert Talk Report.pdf', 1, 0, '2024-12-24 07:34:41', '2024-12-24 07:34:41', NULL, NULL),
(282, 1, '1', '3', 'Emerging trends in electrical engineering Innovations in renewable energy and smart technologies Career opportunities and skills in demand.', '2024-10-11', '<p>The recent expert talk and alumni interaction session for the Electrical Engineering department aimed to bridge the gap between current students and industry professionals. The event featured a guest speaker from a leading tech company and alumni who shared their insights and experiences.&nbsp;</p>\r\n', '2024-12-24-98-expert talk & alumni.pdf', 1, 0, '2024-12-24 12:10:08', '2024-12-24 12:10:08', NULL, NULL),
(283, 1, '1', '8', 'Industrial visit At Lion Chem Dyes', '2024-08-28', '<p>Lion Dyes Chem is a private chemical industry manufacturing Orange dye used in Pharmaceutical industry. It is a small unit producing about 600 kg /batch. A single batch takes almost 2.5 days to complete. The plant was having many types of equipments used in chemical industries along with a boiler, chiller, RO plant, a drying unit, cooling tower and distillation column.</p>\r\n', '2024-12-31-24-INDUSTRIAL VISIT report.docx', 1, 0, '2024-12-31 07:38:45', '2024-12-31 07:38:45', NULL, NULL),
(284, 2, '1', '119', 'Expert Talk on Contribution of CSMCRI in Service to the Society -Opportunity for Students', '2024-12-21', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><strong><span dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">Gyanmanjari Pharmacy College (GMPC) </span></span></strong><span dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">has organized an &ldquo;<strong>Expert Talk on </strong><em>Contribution of <strong>CSMCRI </strong>in Service to the Society<strong> </strong></em>by <strong>Dr. Kamalesh Prasad, </strong>Chief Scientist, Divisional Chair, Marine Natural Products &amp; Bio- Polymers Division Head, Business Development and Information Management Professor, Academy of Scientific and Innovation Research (AcSIR), Ghaziabad, UP, CSIR- Central Salt Marine Chemicals Research Institute, Bhavnagar. </span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">Under the Student Start-up Innovation Policy (SSIP 2.0) of Government of Gujarat GMPC hosted an expert talk event on 21 December 2024 (Saturday). It was a day (3 hours) session conducted and delivered a talk on seaweed farming and various innovation practices.</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n', '2025-01-01-88-Sem 1, 6, 8 ExperTalk_Report.docx', 1, 0, '2025-01-01 05:56:13', '2025-01-01 05:56:13', NULL, NULL),
(285, 1, '5', '23', 'Figma and UI/UX', '2024-08-01', '<p>UI/UX design is the process of creating user interfaces and experiences that are both visually appealing and highly functional. This field combines creativity and technical skills to design user-friendly applications and websites that provide intuitive and seamless interactions. The importance of UI/UX design cannot be overstated, as it directly influences user satisfaction, engagement, and overall success of digital products.&nbsp;</p>\r\n', '2025-01-24-36-expert talk(diploma_IT-D,E,F,G).pdf', 1, 0, '2025-01-24 06:39:28', '2025-01-24 06:39:28', NULL, NULL),
(286, 8, '1', '89', 'Programming and design guides &amp; SEO  Unlocked for business Growth', '2025-01-21', '<p>The objective of this Expert Talk was to enhance students&#39; knowledge in Website Designing, Advanced CSS, and the Figma tool, providing insights from industry leader Bhargav sir of Code Decorator. The session aimed to bridge the gap between academic learning and industry practices, empowering students with practical skills and expertise in cutting-edge web development technologies. The objective of the talk, &quot;SEO Unlocked for Business Growth,&quot; was to empower businesses with actionable insights and strategies to leverage the latest advancements in search engine optimization (SEO).</p>\r\n', '2025-01-31-38-21-Jan-2025-Expert Talk-Code Decorator-BCA4_MCA2.pdf', 1, 0, '2025-01-27 12:04:28', '2025-01-27 12:04:28', NULL, NULL),
(287, 8, '2', '90', 'Programming and design guides &amp; SEO  Unlocked for business Growth', '2025-01-21', '<p>The objective of this Expert Talk was to enhance students&#39; knowledge in Website Designing, Advanced CSS, and the Figma tool, providing insights from industry leader Bhargav sir of Code Decorator. The session aimed to bridge the gap between academic learning and industry practices, empowering students with practical skills and expertise in cutting-edge web development technologies. The objective of the talk, &quot;SEO Unlocked for Business Growth,&quot; was to empower businesses with actionable insights and strategies to leverage the latest advancements in search engine optimization (SEO)</p>\r\n', '2025-01-27-97-21-Jan-2025-Expert Talk-Code Decorator-BCA4_MCA2.pdf', 1, 0, '2025-01-27 12:09:53', '2025-01-27 12:09:53', NULL, NULL),
(288, 1, '5', '25', 'Pathway to Becoming a Digital Marketing Pro', '2025-01-26', '<p>Mr. Ramesh G. Samatiya, the Founder and CEO of Triovate Pvt. Ltd., Ahmedabad, is a distinguished expert with over a decade of experience in SEO and digital marketing. Renowned for his innovative approach and leadership, he has successfully guided businesses in achieving their digital goals. His extensive knowledge and practical insights make him a valuable resource for aspiring professionals looking to thrive in the dynamic field of digital marketing.</p>\r\n', '2025-02-07-60-29-Jan-2025-Expert Talk-Triovate Pvt Ltd-SEM-4_SEM-6.pdf', 1, 0, '2025-02-07 03:03:13', '2025-02-07 03:03:13', NULL, NULL),
(289, 1, '5', '23', 'Expert Talk : - Search Engine Optimization', '2025-02-01', '<p>Search Engine Optimization (SEO) is the process of improving a website&rsquo;s visibility on search engines like Google, Bing, and Yahoo. By optimizing content, structure, and technical elements, SEO helps websites rank higher in search results, driving more organic traffic. It plays a crucial role in digital marketing by increasing brand awareness, improving credibility, and enhancing user experience.</p>\r\n', '2025-02-08-43-Expert_Talk_SEO_merged.pdf', 0, 1, '2025-02-08 09:04:18', '2025-02-08 09:04:18', NULL, NULL),
(290, 1, '5', '23', 'Alumni Interaction', '2025-02-01', '<p>The alumni shared insights on the job application process, emphasizing the importance of a well-structured resume and cover letter. They advised students to highlight technical skills, projects, and internships. Job search platforms like LinkedIn, Naukri, Indeed, and company career portals were recommended for finding opportunities. Additionally, networking through alumni and professional connections plays a crucial role in securing interviews.</p>\r\n', '2025-02-08-76-Alumni_interaction_merged.pdf', 1, 0, '2025-02-08 09:16:17', '2025-02-08 09:16:17', NULL, NULL),
(291, 1, '5', '23', 'Resume Building and  Importance of Linkedin Profile', '2025-02-01', '<p>A resume is the first impression a candidate makes on a recruiter. A well-structured resume should be clear, concise, and highlight key skills, education, and experience. It should be tailored to the job role, using relevant keywords to pass Applicant Tracking Systems (ATS). Keeping the resume one page for freshers ensures readability, while formatting it professionally helps grab the employer&#39;s attention.</p>\r\n', '2025-02-08-67-Resume_building_merge.pdf', 1, 0, '2025-02-08 09:19:22', '2025-02-08 09:19:22', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `tbl_expert_talk` (`id`, `faculty_id`, `level_id`, `program_id`, `title`, `date`, `description`, `report_file`, `is_active`, `is_delete`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `created_by`, `updated_by`) VALUES
(292, 1, '5', '213', 'Expert Talk By Tricks Robotics', '2025-02-12', '<p><span style=\"font-size:16pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\',serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>About Workshop:</strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\',serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">A workshop on &quot;Expert Talk By tricks robotics&quot; was held on [12/02/2025] at [XF-01], bringing together professionals, academics, and students to discuss the latest advancements and innovations in the field of electrical engineering. The event aimed to provide a platform for knowledge exchange, networking, and collaboration among participants.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\',serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Objective&nbsp;</strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\',serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">The primary objectives of the workshop were:</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ol>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:decimal\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\',serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">To introduce participants to emerging technologies and trends in electrical engineering.</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:decimal\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\',serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">To provide insights into practical applications of modern electrical engineering concepts.</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:decimal\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\',serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">To encourage interaction and discussion among industry experts, academics, and students.</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:decimal\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\',serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">To explore the challenges and opportunities in adopting new technologies</span></span></span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\',serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>About Workshop Session</strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\',serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">The workshop successfully achieved its objectives, providing attendees with a comprehensive overview of trends in electrical engineering trick robotics. The event fostered collaboration and knowledge sharing, equipping participants with the tools and insights needed to navigate the rapidly evolving landscape of electrical engineering.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n', '2025-10-19-78-2025-02-21-19-EXPERT TALK DIPLOMA.pdf', 1, 0, '2025-02-13 05:40:01', '2025-02-13 05:40:01', NULL, NULL),
(293, 1, '5', '23', 'Search Engine Optimization', '2025-02-01', '<p>Search Engine Optimization (SEO) is the process of improving a website&rsquo;s visibility on search engines like Google, Bing, and Yahoo. By optimizing content, structure, and technical elements, SEO helps websites rank higher in search results, driving more organic traffic. It plays a crucial role in digital marketing by increasing brand awareness, improving credibility, and enhancing user experience.</p>\r\n', '2025-02-20-63-Expert_Talk_SEO_merged (1).pdf', 1, 0, '2025-02-20 11:43:40', '2025-02-20 11:43:40', NULL, NULL),
(294, 1, '5', '23', 'Resume Building and  Importance of LinkedIn Profile', '2025-02-01', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\">LinkedIn provides opportunities to connect with recruiters, industry professionals, and alumni. Following company pages, applying for jobs directly, engaging in discussions, and sharing professional content increases visibility. Sending personalized connection requests and interacting with professionals helps in networking effectively. Many companies also post job openings exclusively on LinkedIn, making it an essential tool for job seekers.</p>\r\n', '2025-02-20-48-Resume_building_merge (1).pdf', 1, 0, '2025-02-20 11:51:33', '2025-02-20 11:51:33', NULL, NULL),
(295, 1, '5', '23', 'QTONZ Infotech', '2025-02-11', '<p style=\"margin-left:30px; margin-right:11px; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\">The mission at Qtonz is to be catalysts for digital evolution, empowering businesses to thrive in an ever-changing landscape through innovative technology solutions. We are dedicated to harnessing the power of technology to solve complex challenges, drive growth, and create lasting value for our clients and communities. By fostering a culture of collaboration, excellence, and integrity, we aim to deliver exceptional solutions that inspire confidence, drive success, and propel our clients towards their goals. Our relentless pursuit of excellence drives us to continuously innovate, adapt, and exceed expectations, ensuring that we remain at the forefront of digital transformation.</span></p>\r\n', '2025-02-21-16-Diploma_Industrial_Visit_Report(final).pdf', 0, 1, '2025-02-21 06:41:15', '2025-02-21 06:41:15', NULL, NULL),
(296, 1, '5', '24', 'Expert Talk By Tricks Robotics', '2025-02-12', '<p><span style=\"font-size:16pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\',serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>About Workshop:</strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\',serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">A workshop on &quot;Expert Talk By tricks robotics&quot; was held on [12/02/2025] at [XF-01], bringing together professionals, academics, and students to discuss the latest advancements and innovations in the field of electrical engineering. The event aimed to provide a platform for knowledge exchange, networking, and collaboration among participants.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\',serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Objective&nbsp;</strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\',serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">The primary objectives of the workshop were:</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ol>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:decimal\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\',serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">To introduce participants to emerging technologies and trends in electrical engineering.</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:decimal\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\',serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">To provide insights into practical applications of modern electrical engineering concepts.</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:decimal\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\',serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">To encourage interaction and discussion among industry experts, academics, and students.</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:decimal\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\',serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">To explore the challenges and opportunities in adopting new technologies</span></span></span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\',serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>About Workshop Session</strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\',serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">The workshop successfully achieved its objectives, providing attendees with a comprehensive overview of trends in electrical engineering trick robotics. The event fostered collaboration and knowledge sharing, equipping participants with the tools and insights needed to navigate the rapidly evolving landscape of electrical engineering.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n', '2025-02-21-19-EXPERT TALK DIPLOMA.pdf', 1, 0, '2025-02-21 09:38:51', '2025-02-21 09:38:51', NULL, NULL),
