</li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:decimal\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\',serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">To explore the challenges and opportunities in adopting new technologies</span></span></span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\',serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>About Workshop Session</strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\',serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">The workshop successfully achieved its objectives, providing attendees with a comprehensive overview of trends in electrical engineering trick robotics. The event fostered collaboration and knowledge sharing, equipping participants with the tools and insights needed to navigate the rapidly evolving landscape of electrical engineering.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n', '2025-10-19-33-2025-02-21-66-EXPERT TALK DEGREE UPDATED.pdf', 1, 0, '2025-02-21 09:40:14', '2025-02-21 09:40:14', NULL, NULL),
(298, 3, '1', '132', 'Career Advising', '2023-09-15', '<p>Embark on a journey of career wisdom with our expert speaker! In this insightful talk, BCA students will gain valuable guidance on navigating the dynamic world of technology. Discover key strategies for success, explore emerging trends, and receive practical advice for shaping a rewarding career. Don&#39;t miss this opportunity to set a course for your professional future!</p>\r\n', NULL, 1, 0, '2025-03-06 06:31:28', '2025-03-06 06:31:28', NULL, NULL),
(299, 3, '1', '132', 'Resume Building', '2023-09-21', '<p>Resume is the most important part of student life. In this session students<br />\r\nimprove their knowledge of the importance of resume building.<br />\r\n● Resume contains a summary of what you do for a living. Whether any executive<br />\r\nassistant or the executive manager of a large corporation, students must be able<br />\r\nto explain what you do.<br />\r\n● The ability to explain your responsibilities and the purpose of your duties is what<br />\r\nenables you to move from one position to another. A well-written resume is<br />\r\nproof that you understand how your tasks and responsibilities fit into the overall<br />\r\ngoals of the organization for which you work.</p>\r\n', NULL, 1, 0, '2025-03-06 06:34:07', '2025-03-06 06:34:07', NULL, NULL),
(300, 3, '1', '132', 'LinkedIn profile', '2023-09-18', '<p>In this Session Students can know the impotence of the profile and<br />\r\nwhat the use of LinkedIn Profile, also students learn how to use<br />\r\nLinkedIn profile.<br />\r\nA complete LinkedIn profile can help you connect with opportunities<br />\r\nby showcasing your unique professional story through experience,<br />\r\nskills, and education.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>LinkedIn is the world&#39;s largest professional network on the internet.<br />\r\nYou can use LinkedIn to find the right job or internship, connect and<br />\r\nstrengthen professional relationships, and learn the skills you need to<br />\r\nsucceed in your career.<br />\r\nUser can access LinkedIn from a desktop, LinkedIn mobile app, or<br />\r\nmobile web experience.</p>\r\n', NULL, 1, 0, '2025-03-06 07:01:11', '2025-03-06 07:01:11', NULL, NULL),
(301, 3, '1', '132', 'Communication Skill Enhancements', '2023-10-31', '<p>Communication Skill Enhancement gives students the opportunity to learn more about effective communication. It helps and guide students and makes their interactions easy with others. It helps to improve communication skills for the betterment in future.<br />\r\nExpert person Prof. Hema Goswami ma&rsquo;am provided best guidance to students, for improving their communication skills.</p>\r\n', NULL, 1, 0, '2025-03-06 07:06:14', '2025-03-06 07:06:14', NULL, NULL),
(302, 3, '1', '132', 'Artificial Intelligence', '2024-02-27', '<p>Session Talk organized for the students of BSC.IT on topic&nbsp; Artificial Intelligence&nbsp;by Computer Science.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Students of Computer Application has enjoy and Learn from this session and gain knowledge of impact of AI in industries and current and upcoming job opportunities in AI.</p>\r\n', NULL, 1, 0, '2025-03-06 07:19:46', '2025-03-06 07:19:46', NULL, NULL),
(303, 3, '1', '132', 'Unlocking the Power of  WordPress', '2024-07-30', '<p>The workshop aims to equip students with the knowledge of how expert systems can be implemented in WordPress through the use of plugins and custom development. It will cover the basics of expert systems, their role in decision-making processes, and how they can be used to automate tasks and provide personalized content or recommendations on a website. By Mr. Rahul Dungarani (CEO, Jnext Services PVT. LTD.)</p>\r\n', '2025-03-08-12-2024-09-16-37-3rdexpert talk_30_7_2024_Jnex_surat.pdf', 1, 0, '2025-03-08 06:07:44', '2025-03-08 06:07:44', NULL, NULL),
(304, 3, '1', '132', 'Skill enhancement', '2024-08-14', '<p>Skill enhancement for students is a crucial aspect of modern education, designed to prepare them for the complexities of the professional world. It involves developing a blend of technical, cognitive, and interpersonal skills that are essential for success in both academic and career pursuits. Through targeted training and practical experiences, students can sharpen their problem-solving abilities, enhance their communication and collaboration skills, and adapt to new technologies and methodologies.&nbsp;</p>\r\n', '2025-03-08-90-2024-09-17-47-Skill  enhancement.pdf', 1, 0, '2025-03-08 06:11:00', '2025-03-08 06:11:00', NULL, NULL),
(305, 3, '1', '132', 'Programming and design guides &amp; SEO  Unlocked for business Growth', '2025-01-21', '<p>The objective of this Expert Talk was to enhance students&#39; knowledge in Website Designing, Advanced CSS, and the Figma tool, providing insights from industry leader Bhargav sir of Code Decorator. The session aimed to bridge the gap between academic learning and industry practices, empowering students with practical skills and expertise in cutting-edge web development technologies. The objective of the talk, &quot;SEO Unlocked for Business Growth,&quot; was to empower businesses with actionable insights and strategies to leverage the latest advancements in search engine optimization (SEO).</p>\r\n', '2025-03-08-12-2025-01-31-38-21-Jan-2025-Expert Talk-Code Decorator-BCA4_MCA2.pdf', 1, 0, '2025-03-08 06:16:37', '2025-03-08 06:16:37', NULL, NULL),
(306, 3, '1', '132', 'Isro - Ahmedabad Industrial Visit Report', '2025-02-27', '<p>Visiting the Indian Space Research Organisation (ISRO) in Ahmedabad presents an invaluable opportunity for students to witness firsthand the remarkable advancements in space science and technology. The visit aims to bridge the gap between theoretical learning and real-world applications by providing insights into satellite development, remote sensing, and space communication systems. By exploring the research and innovations at the Space Applications Centre (SAC) and the Physical Research Laboratory (PRL), students can deepen their understanding of how space technology contributes to societal progress. This experience not only fosters scientific curiosity but also inspires the next generation of space scientists and engineers to actively contribute to India&rsquo;s space exploration endeavors.</p>\r\n', '2025-03-08-83-BSC_IT Industry Visit.pdf', 1, 0, '2025-03-08 06:37:59', '2025-03-08 06:37:59', NULL, NULL),
(307, 3, '1', '132', 'Isro - Ahmedabad Industrial Visit Report', '2025-02-27', '<p>Visiting the Indian Space Research Organisation (ISRO) in Ahmedabad presents an invaluable opportunity for students to witness firsthand the remarkable advancements in space science and technology. The visit aims to bridge the gap between theoretical learning and real-world applications by providing insights into satellite development, remote sensing, and space communication systems. By exploring the research and innovations at the Space Applications Centre (SAC) and the Physical Research Laboratory (PRL), students can deepen their understanding of how space technology contributes to societal progress. This experience not only fosters scientific curiosity but also inspires the next generation of space scientists and engineers to actively contribute to India&rsquo;s space exploration endeavors.</p>\r\n', '2025-03-08-34-BSC_IT Industry Visit.pdf', 1, 0, '2025-03-08 06:39:37', '2025-03-08 06:39:37', NULL, NULL),
