(350, 6, '1', '74', 'Three Steps to Achieve Success and Happiness in Your Life by Bhavikaben Sheth', '2024-07-12', '<p>The Expert Talk, Three Steps to Achieve Success and Happiness in Your Life, was conducted by Bhavikaben Sheth with the aim of inspiring students to excel in their careers and academics. The session focused on three key principles essential for achieving both success and personal fulfillment.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Bhavikaben Sheth emphasized the importance of goal setting, consistent effort, and a positive mindset. She highlighted practical strategies to help students stay motivated, overcome challenges, and maintain a balance between their academic and personal lives. Through real-life examples and interactive discussions, the session encouraged students to adopt a proactive approach to learning and self-improvement.</p>\r\n', '2025-03-26-20-Expert Talk Bhavikben Sheth.pdf', 1, 0, '2025-03-26 06:31:30', '2025-03-26 06:31:30', NULL, NULL),
(351, 1, '5', '23', 'Research Methodology', '2025-02-07', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\">The primary objective of the expert talk on Research Methodology was to introduce students and budding researchers to the foundational principles, structured approaches, and best practices involved in conducting academic and applied research. The session aimed to equip participants with the necessary skills to initiate, plan, execute, and document research in a systematic and scholarly manner.</p>\r\n', '2025-04-05-77-07-02-2025_4th-Diploma_Expert-Talk-on reseach-methodology.pdf', 1, 0, '2025-04-05 10:06:08', '2025-04-05 10:06:08', NULL, NULL),
(352, 1, '5', '25', 'Introduction to React JS', '2025-04-05', '<p>The Expert Talk on &quot;Introduction to React JS&quot; aimed to provide students with a foundational understanding of React and its core concepts like components, JSX, props, state, and the virtual DOM. Led by an industry expert, the session bridged theory with real-world application, highlighting current trends in web development and encouraging students to explore front-end development using React.</p>\r\n', '2025-04-15-84-05-Apr-2025-Expert Talk-Introduction to React JS 2nd Diploma.pdf', 1, 0, '2025-04-15 09:42:46', '2025-04-15 09:42:46', NULL, NULL),
(353, 1, '1', '4', 'Introduction to React JS', '2025-04-05', '<p>The Expert Talk on &quot;Introduction to React JS&quot; aimed to provide students with a foundational understanding of React and its core concepts like components, JSX, props, state, and the virtual DOM. Led by an industry expert, the session bridged theory with real-world application, highlighting current trends in web development and encouraging students to explore front-end development using React.</p>\r\n', '2025-04-15-86-05-Apr-2025-Expert Talk-Introduction to React JS B.Tech Sem-2.pdf', 1, 0, '2025-04-15 10:05:43', '2025-04-15 10:05:43', NULL, NULL),
(354, 1, '1', '9', 'Catalysis', '2025-01-31', '', NULL, 1, 0, '2025-05-06 11:14:41', '2025-05-06 11:14:41', NULL, NULL),
(355, 1, '1', '6', 'International Relation Cell', '2025-02-06', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\">The expert speaker for the session was Dr. Manishkumar Hasmukhbhai Vaghela, a distinguished figure in the field of international education consultancy. Dr. Vaghela serves as the Director at Just Abroad, an education consultancy specializing in connecting Indian students with academic opportunities in top global destinations such as the USA, UK, Australia, New Zealand, and Canada.</p>\r\n', '2025-05-10-82-06-02-2025_6th-Degree-Class-H_Introductory-session-on-IR-Cell.pdf', 1, 0, '2025-05-10 10:39:12', '2025-05-10 10:39:12', NULL, NULL),
(356, 1, '5', '23', 'Research Methodology', '2025-02-07', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\">Dr. Jigar K. Andharia is an Assistant Professor at Gyanmanjari Innovative University (GMIU), bringing extensive experience in renewable energy research, particularly in solar energy conversion technologies. He has been recognized for his contributions to the field, notably receiving the CSIR-Senior Research Fellowship from the Council of Scientific &amp; Industrial Research (CSIR), India.</p>\r\n', '2025-05-10-99-07-02-2025_4th-Diploma_Expert-Talk-on reseach-methodology.pdf', 1, 0, '2025-05-10 10:55:27', '2025-05-10 10:55:27', NULL, NULL),
(357, 1, '5', '23', 'Becoming You, at Your Best', '2025-07-11', '<p>The expert talk on <strong>&ldquo;Becoming You, at Your Best&rdquo;</strong>, held on <strong>11th July 2025</strong> at <strong>Gyanmanjari Institute of Technology, Bhavnagar</strong>, was a highly engaging and motivational session aimed at first-semester diploma students of the Information Technology department. Delivered by <strong>Ms. Niketa Acharya</strong>, a renowned motivational speaker and personal development mentor, the talk focused on building self-awareness, emotional intelligence, and a growth-oriented mindset. Through interactive tools like journaling, SWOT analysis, and mindfulness exercises, students explored their identity, strengths, and aspirations. Ms. Acharya&rsquo;s insightful guidance and empathetic communication helped students gain clarity about their goals and encouraged them to embrace their individuality. The session concluded with a lively Q&amp;A, leaving the students inspired and better equipped to begin their academic and personal journeys with confidence and purpose.</p>\r\n', '2025-07-14-18-know-who-you-are-11-07.pdf', 1, 0, '2025-07-14 08:09:07', '2025-07-14 08:09:07', NULL, NULL),
(358, 1, '1', '6', 'Alumni Interaction', '2025-07-18', '<p>The <strong>Alumni Interaction Session</strong> with <strong>Mr. Zankhit Gundigara</strong> from <strong>York IE APAC Pvt. Ltd.</strong> was an enriching experience for students, offering practical insights into the world of startups and innovation. As an alumnus, Mr. Gundigara shared his professional journey, highlighting key concepts such as product-market fit, go-to-market strategies, and the role of customer validation in building successful ventures. He emphasized the importance of adaptability, critical thinking, and continuous learning in shaping a future-ready career. The session was interactive and informative, with students actively participating in discussions and seeking guidance on career development and industry trends. His approachable nature and real-world knowledge left a lasting impression, motivating students to explore entrepreneurial opportunities and think beyond traditional career paths.</p>\r\n', '2025-07-19-91-Alumni Interaction B.tech 5th C.pdf', 1, 0, '2025-07-19 11:56:36', '2025-07-19 11:56:36', NULL, NULL),
(359, 1, '5', '575', 'Hum Main Hai HERO', '2023-07-25', '<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The Department of Computer Science and Engineering had organized the Expert Talk on Hum Main Hai Hero on&nbsp; date : 25th July,2023 for Diploma and Degree engineering students.</p>\r\n', '2025-07-22-12-2024-01-13-73-expert talk_by-bharat_vaghela (1).pdf', 1, 0, '2025-07-22 03:46:27', '2025-07-22 03:46:27', NULL, NULL),
(360, 1, '5', '575', 'Domain Selection and Awareness', '2023-10-10', '<p>The Department of Computer Science and Engineering had organized the Expert Talk on Domain Selection and Awareness Date : 10th October,2024&nbsp;for&nbsp; engineering students.</p>\r\n', '2025-07-22-55-domain.pdf', 1, 0, '2025-07-22 03:49:20', '2025-07-22 03:49:20', NULL, NULL),
(361, 1, '5', '575', 'Internship Project', '2024-07-03', '<p>The Department of Computer Science and Engineering had organized the Expert Talk on Internship Project Date : 3rd July,2024&nbsp;for Diploma&nbsp; Engineering Students.</p>\r\n', NULL, 1, 0, '2025-07-22 03:53:43', '2025-07-22 03:53:43', NULL, NULL),
(362, 1, '5', '575', 'Artificial Intelligence', '2024-03-02', '<p>The Department of Computer Science and Engineering had organized the Expert Talk on Artificial Intelligence date : 2nd March,2024&nbsp;for Diploma Engineering Students.</p>\r\n', NULL, 1, 0, '2025-07-22 03:57:26', '2025-07-22 03:57:26', NULL, NULL),
(363, 1, '5', '575', 'Pathway to Becoming a Digital Marketing Pro', '2025-01-26', '<p>Mr. Ramesh G. Samatiya, the Founder and CEO of Triovate Pvt. Ltd., Ahmedabad, is a distinguished expert with over a decade of experience in SEO and digital marketing. Renowned for his innovative approach and leadership, he has successfully guided businesses in achieving their digital goals. His extensive knowledge and practical insights make him a valuable resource for aspiring professionals looking to thrive in the dynamic field of digital marketing.</p>\r\n', '2025-07-22-23-Expert Talk-Triovate Pvt Ltd-SEM-4_SEM-6.pdf', 1, 0, '2025-07-22 04:02:06', '2025-07-22 04:02:06', NULL, NULL),
(364, 1, '5', '575', 'Introduction to React JS', '2025-04-05', '<p>The Expert Talk on &quot;Introduction to React JS&quot; aimed to provide students with a foundational understanding of React and its core concepts like components, JSX, props, state, and the virtual DOM. Led by an industry expert, the session bridged theory with real-world application, highlighting current trends in web development and encouraging students to explore front-end development using React.</p>\r\n', '2025-07-22-46-Expert Talk-Introduction to React JS 2nd Diploma.pdf', 1, 0, '2025-07-22 04:06:09', '2025-07-22 04:06:09', NULL, NULL),
(365, 1, '5', '23', 'Alumni Interaction', '2025-07-22', '<p>The session featured <strong>Mr. Kishan Dava</strong>, an accomplished alumnus of the institute, who is currently working as a software professional at <strong>Altimetrik India Pvt Ltd</strong>. With his rich experience in <strong>full-stack development</strong>, <strong>cloud-native solutions</strong>, and <strong>agile software methodologies</strong>, Mr. Dava delivered an insightful and inspiring talk that resonated strongly with the students. He shared his personal journey&mdash;from being a diploma student at GMIU to becoming a key contributor at a leading global tech company&mdash;emphasizing the importance of persistence, learning from failures, and adapting to new technologies.</p>\r\n', '2025-07-24-15-Alumni Interaction Diploma 1st B (22-07).pdf', 1, 0, '2025-07-24 05:53:05', '2025-07-24 05:53:05', NULL, NULL),
(366, 1, '1', '6', 'Alumni Interaction', '2025-07-22', '<p>The session featured <strong>Mr. Kishan Dava</strong>, an accomplished alumnus of the institute, who is currently working as a software professional at <strong>Altimetrik India Pvt Ltd</strong>. With his rich experience in <strong>full-stack development</strong>, <strong>cloud-native solutions</strong>, and <strong>agile software methodologies</strong>, Mr. Dava delivered an insightful and inspiring talk that resonated strongly with the students. He shared his personal journey&mdash;from being a diploma student at GMIU to becoming a key contributor at a leading global tech company&mdash;emphasizing the importance of persistence, learning from failures, and adapting to new technologies.</p>\r\n', '2025-07-24-96-Alumni Interaction B.tech 1st Y (22-07).pdf', 1, 0, '2025-07-24 05:54:27', '2025-07-24 05:54:27', NULL, NULL),
(367, 1, '1', '6', 'Building Scalable Full Stack Apps with MERN, Next.js &amp; TypeScript', '2025-07-25', '<p>The expert talk on &ldquo;Building Scalable Full Stack Apps with MERN, Next.js &amp; TypeScript&rdquo; was held on 25th July 2025 at GMIU Bhavnagar for B.Tech 3rd Semester IT students. Delivered by Ms. Ramona Frangrance Denny from ADITE Technology, the session covered modern web development using MERN stack, Next.js, and TypeScript. Students gained insights into scalable app development, clean coding, and industry tools like Git, Docker, and CI/CD, bridging academic knowledge with real-world practices.</p>\r\n', '2025-07-26-37-expert talk B.tech (3rd-Z) 25-07.pdf', 1, 0, '2025-07-26 05:33:04', '2025-07-26 05:33:04', NULL, NULL),
(368, 1, '5', '23', 'Behind the Code: Secrets of Software Testing', '2025-08-19', '<p>The Expert Talk on <em>&ldquo;Behind the Code: Secrets of Software Testing&rdquo;</em> was organized by the Department of Information Technology on <strong>19th August 2025</strong>, with <strong>Mr. Kilonbhai Mehta</strong> from Apex Software House, Bhavnagar, as the expert speaker. The session highlighted the crucial role of software testing in ensuring quality, security, and reliability of applications, while also bridging academic concepts with real-world practices. Mr. Mehta discussed manual and automated testing, regression testing, and tools like Selenium and JUnit, sharing practical insights from his professional journey. He further emphasized the growing career opportunities in software testing and motivated students to explore this field with the right skills and mindset. The session concluded with an interactive Q&amp;A, leaving participants with valuable takeaways and a deeper understanding of testing as an integral part of software development.</p>\r\n', '2025-08-19-16-expert talk Diploma (3rd) 19-08.pdf', 1, 0, '2025-08-19 09:23:36', '2025-08-19 09:23:36', NULL, NULL),
