(376, 1, '1', '4', 'Hum Main Hai HERO', '2025-07-07', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\">Shri Bharat Vaghela is a highly skilled motivational expert who specializes in inspiring, guiding, and empowering individuals or groups to overcome obstacles, reach their goals, and unlock their full potential. They often speak, write, coach, or consult across various settings such as educational institutions, corporate environments, and public platforms.</p>\r\n', '2025-09-10-61-7-7-2025_Expert Talk_1st_B.Tech._CSE.pdf', 1, 0, '2025-09-10 11:18:14', '2025-09-10 11:18:14', NULL, NULL),
