(405, 1, '1', '2', 'An Expert Talk on PLC SCADA &amp; AI-ML', '2025-07-18', '<p>The expert talk aimed to bridge academic learning with real-world engineering applications, giving students valuable exposure to current industry trends, practical technologies, and evolving career opportunities. Organized on 18th July 2025 by Sofcon India Pvt. Ltd., the session focused on PLC SCADA, Industrial Automation, and AI-ML, offering insights into how these technologies are transforming modern industries and enabling smart manufacturing. Expert speakers Mr. Vishal Vadher and Mr. Harvish Upadhyay highlighted the practical relevance of theoretical concepts, essential technical and soft skills, and the importance of interdisciplinary collaboration, sustainability, and ethical engineering practices. The interactive seminar, attended by students across multiple engineering branches, provided hands-on understanding, clarified doubts through Q&amp;A, and concluded with e-certificates, ultimately motivating students to innovate, think critically, and explore emerging technology-driven career paths.</p>\r\n', '2025-11-26-92-Expert Talk.pdf', 1, 0, '2025-11-26 10:42:47', '2025-11-26 10:42:47', NULL, NULL),
(406, 1, '5', '22', 'An Expert Talk on PLC SCADA &amp; AI-ML', '2025-07-18', '<p>The expert talk aimed to bridge academic learning with real-world engineering applications, giving students valuable exposure to current industry trends, practical technologies, and evolving career opportunities. Organized on 18th July 2025 by Sofcon India Pvt. Ltd., the session focused on PLC SCADA, Industrial Automation, and AI-ML, offering insights into how these technologies are transforming modern industries and enabling smart manufacturing. Expert speakers Mr. Vishal Vadher and Mr. Harvish Upadhyay highlighted the practical relevance of theoretical concepts, essential technical and soft skills, and the importance of interdisciplinary collaboration, sustainability, and ethical engineering practices. The interactive seminar, attended by students across multiple engineering branches, provided hands-on understanding, clarified doubts through Q&amp;A, and concluded with e-certificates, ultimately motivating students to innovate, think critically, and explore emerging technology-driven career paths.</p>\r\n', '2025-11-26-97-Expert Talk-Diploma.pdf', 1, 0, '2025-11-26 10:49:58', '2025-11-26 10:49:58', NULL, NULL),
(407, 1, '1', '3', 'GATE JAM-2025 Awareness Seminar', '2025-10-06', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\">The session was conducted by Ms. Sneha Ghosh and Ms. Keertana Nair, ambassadors from IIT-Bombay. They shared valuable information about exam patterns, eligibility criteria, preparation strategies, and the importance of GATE and JAM scores for admission into IITs, NITs, and IISc. The speakers also emphasized opportunities in Public Sector Undertakings (PSUs) and research fellowships available through GATE qualifications. Students from different streams of B.Tech, B.Sc, and M.Sc actively participated and interacted with the ambassadors during the Q&amp;A session.</p>\r\n', '2025-11-27-67-GATE JAM_2025 SEMINAR.pdf', 1, 0, '2025-11-27 09:45:55', '2025-11-27 09:45:55', NULL, NULL),
(408, 1, '1', '212', 'GATE JAM-2025 Awareness Seminar', '2025-10-06', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\">The session was conducted by Ms. Sneha Ghosh and Ms. Keertana Nair, ambassadors from IIT-Bombay. They shared valuable information about exam patterns, eligibility criteria, preparation strategies, and the importance of GATE and JAM scores for admission into IITs, NITs, and IISc. The speakers also emphasized opportunities in Public Sector Undertakings (PSUs) and research fellowships available through GATE qualifications. Students from different streams of B.Tech, B.Sc, and M.Sc actively participated and interacted with the ambassadors during the Q&amp;A session.<br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n', '2025-11-27-100-GATE JAM_2025 SEMINAR.pdf', 1, 0, '2025-11-27 09:47:37', '2025-11-27 09:47:37', NULL, NULL),
(409, 1, '1', '1', 'Automation', '2025-07-18', '<p>Our university regularly organizes Expert Talks to provide students with valuable insights from leaders across various industries and academic fields. These sessions allow students to learn directly from professionals who share their expertise, real-world experiences, and emerging trends. Expert Talks help bridge the gap between classroom learning and practical applications, encouraging students to think critically and expand their perspectives. By engaging with distinguished speakers, students gain inspiration, career guidance, and a deeper understanding of current developments in their chosen domains.</p>\r\n', '2025-12-09-61-Expert talk Report B. TECH. ALL.pdf', 1, 0, '2025-12-09 09:45:44', '2025-12-09 09:45:44', NULL, NULL),
(410, 1, '5', '21', 'Automation', '2025-07-18', '<p>Expert Talks at our university bring industry specialists and academic leaders to campus to share their knowledge and experiences. These sessions help students understand real-world challenges and modern advancements. By interacting with experts, students gain practical insights that complement their classroom learning. The talks also inspire students to explore new ideas and career opportunities. This initiative strengthens academic growth and promotes a culture of continuous learning.</p>\r\n', NULL, 1, 0, '2025-12-09 09:48:10', '2025-12-09 09:48:10', NULL, NULL),
(411, 1, '2', '26', 'Automation', '2025-07-18', '<p>The university organizes Expert Talks to enhance students&rsquo; academic and professional exposure. Renowned experts from various fields are invited to discuss emerging trends, innovative practices, and industry expectations. These interactive sessions encourage students to broaden their understanding beyond textbooks. Through meaningful dialogue, students develop critical thinking, professional confidence, and career readiness. Expert Talks serve as a vital platform for bridging theoretical knowledge with practical.</p>\r\n', NULL, 1, 0, '2025-12-09 09:49:49', '2025-12-09 09:49:49', NULL, NULL),
(412, 1, '2', '116', 'Automation', '2025-07-18', '<p>Our Expert Talk series provides students the opportunity to learn from specialists across diverse sectors. These sessions offer real-world knowledge, skill-building insights, and career guidance. Expert interactions help students stay updated with current trends and industry demands. The program enriches learning and motivates students to pursue excellence in their fields.</p>\r\n', NULL, 1, 0, '2025-12-09 09:51:16', '2025-12-09 09:51:16', NULL, NULL),
(413, 1, '2', '311', 'Automation', '2025-07-18', '<p>Expert Talks at our university bring industry specialists and academic leaders to campus to share their knowledge and experiences. These sessions help students understand real-world challenges and modern advancements. By interacting with experts, students gain practical insights that complement their classroom learning. The talks also inspire students to explore new ideas and career opportunities. This initiative strengthens academic growth and promotes a culture of continuous learning.</p>\r\n', NULL, 1, 0, '2025-12-09 09:54:07', '2025-12-09 09:54:07', NULL, NULL),
