(427, 1, '5', '565', 'Expert talk on Memory Magic: Arrays &amp; Pointers', '2025-09-13', '<p>The online expert talk, <em>&ldquo;Memory Magic: Arrays &amp; Pointers&rdquo;</em>, was organized for Diploma IT 1st semester students under the Premium Program. Conducted by Ms. Disha Shukla from Nova Techset, the session ran from 11:00 AM to 1:00 PM on 13th September 2025. The talk aimed at simplifying the often challenging concepts of arrays and pointers in C programming by explaining them step by step with relatable examples. Ms. Shukla connected theoretical knowledge with practical applications, demonstrating how these fundamentals are applied in real-world IT solutions. The session was interactive, student-friendly, and highly impactful, leaving participants motivated to strengthen their basics and explore programming with greater confidence.</p>\r\n', '2025-12-24-69-Premium Program expert talk Diploma (1st).pdf', 0, 1, '2025-12-24 06:38:50', '2025-12-24 06:38:50', NULL, NULL),
(428, 1, '5', '565', 'Expert talk on Memory Magic: Arrays &amp; Pointers', '2025-09-13', '<p>The online expert talk, <em>&ldquo;Memory Magic: Arrays &amp; Pointers&rdquo;</em>, was organized for Diploma Computer Engineering 1st semester students under the Premium Program. Conducted by Ms. Disha Shukla from Nova Techset, the session ran from 11:00 AM to 1:00 PM on 13th September 2025. The talk aimed at simplifying the often challenging concepts of arrays and pointers in C programming by explaining them step by step with relatable examples. Ms. Shukla connected theoretical knowledge with practical applications, demonstrating how these fundamentals are applied in real-world IT solutions. The session was interactive, student-friendly, and highly impactful, leaving participants motivated to strengthen their basics and explore programming with greater confidence.</p>\r\n', '2025-12-24-37-Premium Program expert talk Diploma (1st).pdf', 1, 0, '2025-12-24 06:39:57', '2025-12-24 06:39:57', NULL, NULL),
(429, 2, '1', '119', 'EXPERT TALK ON PHARMACOLOGY AND PHARMACOGNOSY', '2026-01-19', '<p>The objective of the expert session was to enhance students&#39; understanding of core concepts in Pharmacology and Pharmacognosy, bridge theoretical knowledge with clinical and practical applications, and provide academic guidance for future professional development.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>About Expert Session</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The expert session was conducted by Dr. Prakash Shah and Dr. R. K. Goyal, who delivered an insightful and interactive lecture on Pharmacology and Pharmacognosy. The session covered fundamental principles, drug classification, mechanisms of action, medicinal plant sources, and therapeutic relevance. The experts shared real-life examples, recent advancements, and examination-oriented tips, which helped students gain clarity and confidence in the subjects. The session concluded with an interactive question-and-answer segment, encouraging active student participation.</p>\r\n', '2026-01-21-65-DocScanner Jan 21, 2026 11-29 AM.pdf', 1, 0, '2026-01-21 06:26:13', '2026-01-21 06:26:13', NULL, NULL),
(430, 1, '1', '6', 'Professional Career Guidance', '2026-01-21', '<p>The session was delivered by Mr. Jeet Jagani, Chief Executive Officer of Stackdot, whose extensive industry experience provided students with direct exposure to contemporary professional practices, organizational expectations, and technology-driven career ecosystems. His participation significantly reinforced the academic&ndash;industry interface.</p>\r\n', '2026-01-24-55-Professional Career Guidance T&P B.Tech (6th-C) 21-01-2026.pdf', 1, 0, '2026-01-24 06:29:11', '2026-01-24 06:29:11', NULL, NULL),
(431, 1, '1', '6', 'Expert Talk on Industry Expectations and Career Readiness', '2026-02-07', '<p>This expert talk was organized for the students of <strong>B.Tech Semester 6 &ndash; Classes C &amp; G</strong> to provide direct exposure to industry expectations, professional practices, and career readiness. The session aimed to bridge the gap between academic learning and real-world industry requirements through expert insights and practical perspectives.</p>\r\n', '2026-02-11-37-Expert Talk T&P B.Tech (6th-C&G) 07-02-2026.pdf', 1, 0, '2026-02-11 05:35:49', '2026-02-11 05:35:49', NULL, NULL);
