(1, '1', 'FET', 'INSTITUTE OF ENGINEERING &amp; TECHNOLOGY', '', 'faculty-of-engineering-amp-technology', '', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">In Gyanmanjari Innovative University, an attempt is being made to provide the best education in the Diploma to PG course in Engineering, covering important aspects like skill based education and startup and innovation, with a curriculum not according to the current industry demand and with an approach like flipped classroom, project based learning.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">With the latest learning approach Human values are being imparted to the students by making them globally competent and self-reliant.. By connecting with more than 583 different industries, students get the best placements, internships and practical exposure compared to theory. By such study the student needs and present Cultivating the right understanding can lead in the right direction.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Since 2015 every year and semester, the university has been known for its results, start-up and research achievements and socially useful projects at the Gujarat level.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Excellent infrastructural facilities, best faculties, mentorship program, master mind, club activity and various competitions held at national and international level and projects like IEP have improved the students.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Along with the UG degree, the students will be given an excellent opportunity to advance in trending courses like cyber security, AI and data science, robotics and animation, minor degree in order to get more fulfillments in their field. B group students are also given the choice of courses like food technology and biotechnology as an option to make a better career in the field of engineering.</span></p>\r\n', '<p>Apply for BTech, MTech &amp; Diploma at GMIU University Bhavnagar 2025. Check eligibility, fees, placements &amp; courses. Apply online now.</p>\r\n', '<p>BTech Admission 2025, Engineering Admission Bhavnagar, Diploma Engineering Courses, MTech Programs GMIU, Engineering University Bhavnagar, Best Private Engineering College Gujarat, Engineering courses, Engineering degree, B.Tech course, Engineering university, Online engineering courses, Engineering courses list, Engineering program, Engineering degree near me, B.Tech courses list, Engineering education, University engineering courses, Best engineering colleges, Engineering specializations, Distance learning engineering, btech courses after 12th</p>\r\n', '<p>BTech, Diploma, MTech Engineering Admission 2025 - GMIU Bhavnagar</p>\r\n', 1, 0, '2023-03-06 11:31:03', '2025-06-28 10:56:54', NULL, NULL),
(2, '2', 'FPH', 'INSTITUTE OF PHARMACY', '', 'faculty-of-pharmacy', '', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Faculty of Pharmacy at GMIU offers Bachelor of Pharmacy course of 4years durations with 100 intakes. Faculty of Pharmacy having the state of art and ample infrastructure to gratify the need of courses being presented including a fully-fledged library and computer center. The B. Pharm course is approved by the pharmacy council of India, New Delhi. The Faculty of Pharmacy provides a rich environment for research, entrepreneurship, innovation, placement through experience in addition to quality education based on the syllabus of pharmacy to students. GMIU, Faculty of Pharmacy provides students with various ADD on Courses like workshops on modern equipment and instruments, Outdoor activities, field projects of various subjects of pharmacy like Pharmaceutics, Quality Assurance, Pharmacology, Pharmacognosy and Microbiology, pharmacy based computer advanced programs etc. to enhance their Theory &amp; Practical knowledge and skills about the field of Pharmacy so that they can become profession fit for Pharmaceutical industryas per New Education Policy 2020. It will also enhance the application of their experience and developed skills in industry. Along with this, the overall development of students through activities like 7 point execution and Mastermind will shape,accelerate and enrich the career of the students and create their unique skills and identity at the global level.</span></p>\r\n', 'Meet GMIU Pharmacy faculty—qualified experts dedicated to quality education. Apply now for B Pharma, D Pharma & M Pharma Admission 2025 in Bhavnagar.', 'B Pharma Admission 2025, D Pharma Admission Gujarat, Pharmacy College Bhavnagar, Pharmacy Admission 2025 Gujarat, M Pharma Courses, Pharmacy Fees 2025 Gujarat, GUJCET Pharmacy Admission, Top Pharmacy Colleges Gujarat, Best Pharmacy College Bhavnagar, GMIU Pharmacy Admission , pharmacy course, pharm d, d pharma, diploma in pharmacy, d pharma course, d pharma fees, pharm d course, d pharmacy admission, d pharma course fees, best d2d pharmacy college in bhavnagar, best d2d pharmacy college in gujarat, best d2d pharmacy college near me, best d2d pharmacy college in my city, top d2d pharmacy college, top d2d pharmacy college in bhavnagar, top d2d pharmacy college in gujarat, top d2d pharmacy college near me, top d2d pharmacy college in my city, bachelor of pharmacy, b pharma, pharmacy course, b pharma fees, b pharmacy admission, pharmacy degree, pharmacy programs, pharmacy courses online, pharmacy degree online, pharmacy university, b pharma course fees, bachelor of pharmacy online, pharmacy bachelor degree, pharmacy degree programs, bachelor of science in pharmacy, pharmacy program online, pharmacy bachelor degree online, master of pharmacy online, online d pharma course, bpharm admission, b pharma online course, online pharmacology programs, master of pharmacology, pharmacy technology course, b pharma university in delhi, pharmacy course in delhi, bachelors degree in pharmaceutical sciences\n', 'Excellence in Pharmaceutical Education | Gyanmanjari University | GMIU\n', 1, 0, '2023-03-07 05:48:13', '2025-06-27 10:36:47', NULL, NULL),
(3, '3', 'FSC', 'INSTITUTE OF SCIENCE', '', 'faculty-of-science', '', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Faculty of Science working in Gyanmanjari Innovative University which provides best education and research to students.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\">It provides a platform to build a career by studying the trending courses in the university as per the current demand and enhances the aptitude in the principles of science in the natural world and research in that field. Trending courses in current demand like B.Sc. Radiotherapy, Medical Technology, Computer Science, Industrial Chemistry have given an excellent option to the students by making them proficient in that field and giving importance to research to make them holders of international recognition degrees and best career.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\">Academic activity in Gyanmanjari Innovative University will be given practical exposure as per new NEP 2020 with new technology approach and various advanced tools to make it more capable in different ways like skill development program, case study, association with industry.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\">Choosing national and international conference and research, Students will become globally self-reliant by assessment through dissertation and research paper. Along with studies, through start-up cell, the society has to do new researches and create projects to join the youth in nation building. All round development and potential of the student Various clubs like yoga club, sports club and various programs are organized to bring out.</span>&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n', 'Meet the GMIU faculty member – explore their academic qualifications, teaching expertise, and dedication to enhancing the student learning experience at GMIU.', 'science degrees, bsc courses, bsc degree, science courses, bsc admission, science majors, msc courses, bachelor of science courses, science university, science subject, science courses in university, study science, bsc university, bsc subjects, bsc study, faculty of education, university of the sciences degrees, education courses in university, faculty of science, msc courses list, msc university, apply for bsc, online science university, bsc admission process, university of sciences, science online course, bsc science courses, master of science courses list, msc admission process, msc faculty', 'Faculty of Science | Advanced Learning at GMIU', 1, 0, '2023-03-07 05:49:36', '2025-06-27 09:36:15', NULL, NULL),
