(14, '14', 'FLS', 'INSTITUTE OF LIBRARY SCIENCE', '', 'faculty-of-library-science', 'B.Lib. M.Lib. is master level course. Library and Information Science is related with schools of library and information science. Library science is a social science consolidate the humanities, law and applied science and studying topics related to libraries; organization, the collection, and the political economy of information. The collection, storage, retrieval, classification, manipulation, and dissemination of information is perturbed in this course. It is career presenting in nature and provide many job opportunities for candidates after its successful completion.', 'B.Lib. M.Lib. is master level course. Library and Information Science is related with schools of library and information science. Library science is a social science consolidate the humanities, law and applied science and studying topics related to libraries; organization, the collection, and the political economy of information. The collection, storage, retrieval, classification, manipulation, and dissemination of information is perturbed in this course. It is career presenting in nature and provide many job opportunities for candidates after its successful completion.', '', '', '', 1, 1, '2023-03-07 06:01:47', '2025-03-18 05:49:27', NULL, NULL),
(15, '15', 'FHM', 'INSTITUTE OF HOTEL MANAGEMENT', '', 'faculty-of-hotel-management', 'GMIU offers the best hotel management program, providing students with a comprehensive education, experienced faculty, and state-of-the-art facilities. The curriculum covers essential skills such as hotel operations, revenue management, marketing, and customer service, while hands-on learning opportunities through internships and real-world projects provide practical application of knowledge. The college also offers a range of extracurricular activities, modern classrooms, fully equipped labs, and a state-of-the-art hospitality training center, as well as partnerships with leading hotels and hospitality companies for internships, job placements, and mentorship programs. With a focus on industry-relevant knowledge and practical application, GMIU is the ideal choice for anyone seeking a successful career in hotel management.', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">GMIU offers the best hotel management program, providing students with a comprehensive education, experienced faculty, and state-of-the-art facilities. The curriculum covers essential skills such as hotel operations, revenue management, marketing, and customer service, while hands-on learning opportunities through internships and real-world projects provide practical application of knowledge. The college also offers a range of extracurricular activities, modern classrooms, fully equipped labs, and a state-of-the-art hospitality training center, as well as partnerships with leading hotels and hospitality companies for internships, job placements, and mentorship programs. With a focus on industry-relevant knowledge and practical application, GMIU is the ideal choice for anyone seeking a successful career in hotel management.</span></p>\r\n', 'Discover the profile of GMIU faculty member – Learn about their qualifications, expertise, and dedication to providing an excellent academic experience at GMIU.', 'Hotel Management Course, Hotel Management Course Fees, Hotel Management, Diploma In Hotel Management, Hospitality Management Course, Hotel Management Certificate, Diploma In Hospitality Management, Hospitality Course, Hospitality Management, Hotel Management Course Near Me, Hotel Management University, Hotel Management Courses Online, Hm Course, International Institute Of Hotel Management, Hospitality Programs, Best Online Courses For Hospitality Management, Bhm Course, Hospitality Management Courses Online, Hospitality Management Certificate, Hotel Management Training, Hotel Management Courses In Uk For International Students, Hotel Management Fees, Hotel And Hospitality Management, Hospitality University, Online Hospitality Management Certificate, Hospitality Certificate Online, Hotel Management Certificate Courses, Hospitality Management Online, Institute Of Hotel Management, Hospitality Management Programs, Hotel Management Course Duration, International Hospitality Management, College School, International Hotel Management, College Online School, Hotel Management Admission, College Classes, School College, Hotel And Hospitality Management Courses, Diploma In Management, Hospitality And Management Course, Online College Courses, College Programs, Apply For College, College Online, College Application, Us Colleges', 'Faculty of Hotel Management at Gyanmanjari Innovative University', 1, 0, '2023-03-07 06:03:26', '2025-06-11 09:11:26', NULL, NULL),
(16, '16', 'FVC', 'VOCATIONAL/CERTIFICATE COURSE', '', 'vocational-certificate-course', 'A vocational degree is an academic certificate awarded to students who have completed the degree requirements for a specific trade or career. Vocational degrees are popular because they typically require less time to complete than a traditional degree program (e.g., associate or bachelor\'s degree), and upon completion, the student is often ready to begin working the trade A college undergraduate degree focuses on developing an individual\'s all-around intelligence and critical-thinking skills.', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">A vocational degree is an academic certificate awarded to students who have completed the degree requirements for a specific trade or career. Vocational degrees are popular because they typically require less time to complete than a traditional degree program (e.g., associate or bachelor&#39;s degree), and upon completion, the student is often ready to begin working the trade A college undergraduate degree focuses on developing an individual&#39;s all-around intelligence and critical-thinking skills.</span></p>\r\n', 'Discover GMIU faculty profiles—explore academic qualifications, expertise, and their role in fostering an exceptional learning environment.', 'Vocational Courses, University Courses, Get A Bachelor\'s Degree In 6 Months, 6 Months It Courses, Degree In 6 Months, Photography Degree Courses, Vocational Degree, Safety Degree Course, 6 Months Degree Course, Digital Marketing Course Degree, Vocational Courses For International Students, International Courses, Vocational Certificate, Vocational Program, Digital Marketing Course In University, Undergraduate Degree Program, Vocational It Courses, Bachelor College, Vocational Computer Science, Cloud Technology Degree, Popular Degrees, Cloud Computing Course University, Courses For Undergraduate Students, 6 Months Technical Courses', 'Vocational/Certificate Courses at Gyanmanjari Innovative University', 1, 0, '2023-03-07 06:04:12', '2025-06-27 11:07:19', NULL, NULL),
(17, '17', NULL, 'Law', '', 'law', '', '', '', '', '', 1, 1, '2023-03-07 09:15:52', '2024-12-09 05:10:17', NULL, NULL),
(18, '18', 'N/A', 'INTEGRATED COURSE', '', 'integrated-course', 'Integrated courses usually follow a 3+2 years\' pattern, including bachelor\'s and master\'s (except for law courses). Pursuing an integrated course after 12th helps take off the burden of worrying about admission after your degree and helps you choose your specialization beforehand. By this, you save your efforts for the specific line you want and have a clear goal. At the same time, during the bachelor\'s period or the first three years of the integrated course, you will have more exposure and opportunities to broaden the scope of your knowledge. Thus, it provides you with the best of both worlds.', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Integrated courses usually follow a 3+2 years&#39; pattern, including bachelor&#39;s and master&#39;s (except for law courses). Pursuing an integrated course after 12th helps take off the burden of worrying about admission after your degree and helps you choose your specialization beforehand. By this, you save your efforts for the specific line you want and have a clear goal. At the same time, during the bachelor&#39;s period or the first three years of the integrated course, you will have more exposure and opportunities to broaden the scope of your knowledge. Thus, it provides you with the best of both worlds.</span></p>\r\n', 'Explore the BBA MBA Integrated Course at Gyanmanjari Innovative University. Learn about integrated MBA programs, fees, and more after 12th with flexible options.', 'BBA Mba Integrated Course, Integrated Mba, Mba Integrated Course, BBA And Mba Integrated Course, Integrated BBA Mba, Integrated Mba After 12th, BBA Integrated Course, Integrated Courses After 12th, Integrated Mba Fees, Bca Mca Integrated Course, Online Integrated Mba, Integrated Mba Online, Integrated Course BBA Mba, 5 Year Integrated Courses After 12th, Integrated B Tech After 10th, Integrated Degree, Integrated Degree Courses, Integrated Ug Courses, Integrated Ug And Pg, Integrated Courses, Integrated Degree Courses After 12th, Integrated Course For Commerce Students, Integrated 5 Years Course, Best Integrated Courses After 12th, Integrated Course For Commerce', 'Integrated MBA at GMIU: Earn a BBA and MBA in One Program', 0, 0, '2023-03-07 09:19:11', '2025-06-11 09:11:26', NULL, NULL),
(19, '19', 'Ph. D', 'Ph.D (MIN.3-YEARS)', '', 'ph-d-min-3-years-', '', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Doctor of Philosophy, is a high-level degree earned after a period of three or more years of graduate-level study, culminating in the creation, submission, presentation and defense of a research dissertation. This is an academic or professional degree that, in most countries, qualifies the degree holder to teach their chosen subject at university level or to work in a specialized position in their chosen field.</span></p>\r\n', 'Meet the esteemed faculty member at GMIU, bringing expertise and a commitment to academic excellence, shaping students futures with knowledge and guidance.', 'Phd In Management, Phd Degree, Phd Programs, Phd Course, Phd Admission, College Degrees, Bachelor Degree Years, Apply For Phd, Phd In Engineering, Phd In Mathematics, Phd University, Phd In Commerce, Degree Program, Phd Course Fees, Phd Certificate, Phd In 2 Years, Phd By Research, Phd Research, Phd Degree Courses, 2 Year Phd Program, Professional Phd, Phd Degree Program, Phd Course List, Phd Syllabus, Phd Subject List, Phd Fee Structure, Phd List, Phd Admission In Us, Phd After Degree, Phd Admission In, Phd Ugc, Phd For Phd', 'Ph.D. (Minimum 3 Years) - Gyanmanjari Innovative University | GMIU', 1, 0, '2023-03-10 11:38:37', '2025-06-11 09:11:26', NULL, NULL),
(20, NULL, 'FET-D2D', 'INSTITUTE OF ENGINEERING &amp; TECHNOLOGY (D2D)', '', 'faculty-of-engineering-amp-technology-d2d-', '', '', '', '', '', 0, 1, '2023-12-26 07:01:10', '2025-07-01 10:14:18', NULL, NULL),
(21, NULL, 'FOP-D2D', 'INSTITUTE OF PHARAMCY -D2D', '', 'faculty-of-pharamcy-d2d', '', '<p>N/A</p>\r\n', '', '', '', 1, 1, '2023-12-26 07:02:16', '2025-03-18 05:49:27', NULL, NULL),
(22, NULL, 'DDP', 'DUAL DEGREE PROGRAMS', '', 'dual-degree-programs', '', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">A Dual Degree Program offers students the opportunity to pursue two distinct academic disciplines simultaneously, leading to the attainment of two separate degrees. This innovative approach to education provides a broader and more versatile skill set, fostering interdisciplinary thinking and preparing individuals for diverse career paths. Dual degree programs are designed to create synergy between complementary fields, allowing students to explore the intersections of their chosen disciplines. Whether combining business and technology, humanities and sciences, or any other pair of fields, these programs empower graduates to navigate complex challenges with a well-rounded perspective. The significance of a dual degree lies in its ability to produce graduates who can bridge gaps between different domains, fostering innovation and adaptability in a rapidly changing world.</span></p>\r\n', 'Explore dual degree programs at GMIU—offering diverse options like IT, Cyber Security, and Political Science to expand your academic and career potential.', 'Dual Degree Programs, College Programs, Bachelor Degree, Science Degrees, It Degree Programs, College Degrees, Cyber Security University, Technology Degrees, It Tech Degree, Political Science Degree, Technical Degree, Technology Programs, Business Degree, Bachelor Programs, Dual Degree, Cybersecurity Programs, Degree Courses, Ba Degree, Cyber Security Degree Programs, Education Degree, Business Technology Degree, Ba In Business Administration, Administration Degree, Public Administration Degree, Computer It Degree, Digital Marketing Degree, Technical Degree Programs, It Security Degree, Commerce Degree, Public Administration Course, Degree Programs, Ba Course, University Degrees, Business And Administration Degree, Computer Degree, University Programs, Degrees From Home, Degree Program, Bachelor\'s In Political Science, Marketing Degree Programs, Business It Degree, Security Degree, Undergraduate Program', 'Dual Degree & IT Programs at GMIU | Tech & Science', 1, 0, '2023-12-30 05:58:57', '2025-06-27 10:41:34', NULL, NULL),
(23, NULL, 'HM', 'INSTITUTE OF HOSPITAL MANAGEMENT', '', 'faculty-of-hospital-management', '', '', '', '', '', 1, 1, '2024-06-06 08:55:10', '2025-03-18 05:49:27', NULL, NULL),
(24, NULL, 'FL', 'Faculty of Law', '', 'faculty-of-law', '', '&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;In Gyanmanjari Innovative University, you embark on a journey through a dynamic and multifaceted legal landscape. With your degree, you are equipped to explore different career paths, from practicing as a lawyer in court to working in corporate law, legal consulting, academia or even public service.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif&quot;&gt;The Indian legal system offers a wide range of opportunities. You can choose to specialize in areas such as constitutional law, criminal law, corporate law, intellectual property, environmental law or human rights. Additionally, the growing demand for legal professionals in the corporate sector is opening doors to corporate counsel positions, where you can advise businesses on regulatory compliance, contracts, and other legal matters.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Beyond traditional roles, your legal education also prepares you for alternative careers in legal journalism, policy analysis, and nongovernmental organizations (NGOs) focused on advocacy and social justice. Additionally, you have the opportunity to pursue your studies or practice law in other common law jurisdictions around the world.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif&quot;&gt;By entering the professional world, you will have the chance to contribute to the rule of law, uphold justice and have a significant impact on society. Whether you choose to practice in court, advise on a board of directors or engage in public service, your legal training provides a solid foundation for a rewarding and impactful career.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;', '', '', '', 1, 1, '2024-08-30 07:11:40', '2024-12-09 05:10:17', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `tbl_faculty` (`id`, `code`, `shortname`, `name`, `thumbnail`, `faculty_slug`, `short_description`, `description`, `meta_description`, `meta_keywords`, `pageTitle`, `is_active`, `is_delete`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `created_by`, `updated_by`) VALUES
(25, NULL, 'FL', 'Faculty of Law', '', 'faculty-of-law', '', '&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif&quot;&gt;In Gyanmanjari Innovative University, you embark on a journey through a dynamic and multifaceted legal landscape. With your degree, you are equipped to explore different career paths, from practicing as a lawyer in court to working in corporate law, legal consulting, academia or even public service.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif&quot;&gt;The Indian legal system offers a wide range of opportunities. You can choose to specialize in areas such as constitutional law, criminal law, corporate law, intellectual property, environmental law or human rights. Additionally, the growing demand for legal professionals in the corporate sector is opening doors to corporate counsel positions, where you can advise businesses on regulatory compliance, contracts, and other legal matters.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Beyond traditional roles, your legal education also prepares you for alternative careers in legal journalism, policy analysis, and nongovernmental organizations (NGOs) focused on advocacy and social justice. Additionally, you have the opportunity to pursue your studies or practice law in other common law jurisdictions around the world.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif&quot;&gt;By entering the professional world, you will have the chance to contribute to the rule of law, uphold justice and have a significant impact on society. Whether you choose to practice in court, advise on a board of directors or engage in public service, your legal training provides a solid foundation for a rewarding and impactful career.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;', '', '', '', 1, 1, '2024-08-30 07:12:36', '2024-12-09 05:10:17', NULL, NULL),
(26, NULL, 'FL', 'INSTITUTE OF LAW', '', 'faculty-of-law', '', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">In Gyanmanjari Innovative University, you embark on a journey through a dynamic and multifaceted legal landscape. With your degree, you are equipped to explore different career paths, from practicing as a lawyer in court to working in corporate law, legal consulting, academia or even public service.&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">The Indian legal system offers a wide range of opportunities. You can choose to specialize in areas such as constitutional law, criminal law, corporate law, intellectual property, environmental law or human rights. Additionally, the growing demand for legal professionals in the corporate sector is opening doors to corporate counsel positions, where you can advise businesses on regulatory compliance, contracts, and other legal matters.&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">Beyond traditional roles, your legal education also prepares you for alternative careers in legal journalism, policy analysis, and nongovernmental organizations (NGOs) focused on advocacy and social justice. Additionally, you have the opportunity to pursue your studies or practice law in other common law jurisdictions around the world.&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">By entering the professional world, you will have the chance to contribute to the rule of law, uphold justice and have a significant impact on society. Whether you choose to practice in court, advise on a board of directors or engage in public service, your legal training provides a solid foundation for a rewarding and impactful career.</span></span></p>\r\n', '<p>Discover GMIU&rsquo;s esteemed faculty committed to delivering quality education and mentorship, supporting students&rsquo; academic and professional growth.</p>\r\n', '<p>law course, university admission, ba llb course, llb admission, ba llb, llb degree, university of law, llb law, law university, bachelors degree in law, university of law courses, bachelors in law, the law university, university of law application, llb degree online, llb law degree, university of law apply, law studies, law admission, law education, llb admission process, law degree university, educational law degree, llb fees, law course after graduation, university of law llb, careers in law, law degree course, law at university, foundation law degree, law admission process, llb admission fees, law studies degree</p>\r\n', '<p>LLB &amp; Law Courses at GMIU | LLB Admission</p>\r\n', 1, 0, '2024-08-30 07:52:18', '2025-11-18 05:34:50', NULL, NULL),
(27, NULL, 'GGC', 'Gyanmanjari Girls College', '', 'gyanmanjari-arts-commerce-girls-college', '', '<p>Nowadays being a competitive era it is necessary to get good and quality education in this competitive era. Our curriculum is also innovative compared to other institutes to enhance the student&#39;s local and international opportunities. Along with the required study in the classroom by the expert faculty of Gnanmanjari, the university will coordinate with various corporate companies for placements and internships in different domains, research based projects, workshops for improving life and social skills, case studies and experiential learning. Also sent by college in institutions. Evaluation will be done through seminars, debates by experts coming from corporate companies. The college will be guided by international level experts in subjects like international research. Gujarat government&#39;s I-hub, along with professional associations like CII provides startup information, study as well as government exam preparation and interview preparation is done under the GENIUS program. Students of general stream in the college can do multi-tasking project work with students of different faculties.</p>\r\n', 'Apply to GMIU’s Commerce programs—BCom, MCom, and online BCom—ideal for aspiring students seeking comprehensive commerce education and career growth.', 'College Application, Arts University, Education Study, Faculty In University, Bachelor Of Commerce, Commerce Courses, Master Of Commerce, Bcom Courses, Bachelor Of Commerce Online, Bcom Subjects, Online Bcom, Online Bcom Course, Courses For Commerce Students, After Graduation Courses In Commerce, Bcom Admission, Mcom Admission, Bcom Course Details, Courses After Bcom, Bcom University, Online Courses For Commerce Students, After 12 Commerce Courses, Bcom Colleges Near Me, Bachelor Of Commerce Accounting, B Commerce, Commerce University, Bachelor Of Commerce Subjects, Online Courses For Bcom Students, Study Commerce, University Admission, University Study, Degree Programs, Faculty Of Arts, Ba Programs, Ba University, Activities For Students, Ma In Administration, Ma University, University For Ba, College Information, Ba Subject, University Of Arts, Good Universities, Ba Programme, Bachelor Of Arts Courses, Ba Admission Fees, Arts University, Ba In Administration, University Study, Master In Arts, Ba Study, Ba Course Fees, Ba Bachelor Of Arts, Ba Arts, Faculty Of Arts', 'Gyanmanjari Arts/Commerce Girls College | Empowering Women Students', 1, 0, '2024-10-15 07:13:18', '2025-06-27 11:23:01', NULL, NULL),
(28, NULL, 'FODM', 'Faculty &amp; Of  ( Demo-demo)', '', 'faculty-amp-of-demo-demo', '', '&lt;p&gt;Faculty Of Demo&lt;/p&gt;', '', '', '', 1, 1, '2024-12-12 06:57:34', '2024-12-12 07:01:05', NULL, NULL);
