(12, 4, 'Poster Presentation Competition', '', 'Management Department', '2025-03-27-79-IKSVE Report.docx', 'The Poster Presentation Competition, organized by the IKSVE Cell, will take place on 8th February 2025 at the University Campus. The event was coordinated by Prof. Radhika Chhaya from the Management Department, with guidance provided by Prof. Nisarggendu Bhatt. Participants will choose from a list of 10 topics, all focused on the integration of Vedic and Modern Knowledge. This competition aims to encourage innovative thinking and deep exploration into how ancient wisdom can complement contemporary understanding. It promises to be an exciting platform for students to showcase their research and ideas.', 1, 0, '2025-03-27 05:35:53', '2025-03-27 05:37:48', '2025-02-08');
