(13, 2, '1', '119', '2023-04-29', '2023', 'B.Pharmacy semester 2 students', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\">Gyanmanjari Pharmacy College have arranged Industrial vist at Medinex Pvt.Ltd (Mamsa) near by Bhavnagar. It is one of the most leading API manufacturing company. Students of semester 2 of Pharmacy have got visited and gained thorogh knowledge regarding different medicinal chemistry process and also visited water treatment plant. All students have gained knowledge about cGLP and cGMP plant and how they run.</p>\r\n', '2023-10-27-28-INDUSTRIAL VISIT REPORT medinex lab sem 2 2023.pdf', 1, 0, '2023-10-27 09:10:40', '2023-10-27 09:10:40', NULL, NULL),
(14, 2, '1', '119', '2023-01-30', '2023', 'Gyanmanjari Pharmacy students ', '<p>Gyanmanjari Pharamcy semester students have visited Sarvottam Dairy (Sihor) which is situated at Sihor town near by Bhavnagar city. Around 75 students and faculties were participated this visit. They have got enogh knowledge regarding milk pastuarization, stirring, packaging and supply chain which is beneficial to them as per their curriculum.</p>\r\n', '2023-10-27-67-Industrial Visit ( Sarvottam Dairy) sihor.pdf', 1, 0, '2023-10-27 09:35:49', '2023-10-27 09:35:49', NULL, NULL),
(15, 1, '5', '24', '2023-09-26', '2023', 'Visit at Railway Workshop', '<ul>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\"><span style=\"color:black\">Industry visit held for 5th semester diploma students on the day of 26th September, 2023 to gain practical knowledge as well to introduce with Industry.</span></span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n', '2023-11-29-50-railway.pdf', 1, 0, '2024-01-06 07:19:45', '2024-01-06 07:19:45', NULL, NULL),
(16, 1, '5', '24', '2023-09-26', '2023', '220 KV Vartej Sub-Station Visi', '<ul>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\"><span style=\"color:black\">Industry Visit held for pre-final year and final year students to enhance practical knowledge on 8th august, 2022.</span></span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n', '2023-11-29-99-vartej.pdf', 1, 0, '2024-01-17 02:03:59', '2024-01-17 02:03:59', NULL, NULL),
(17, 1, '5', '24', '2022-11-11', '2022', '66 KV Sub-Station Visit', '<ul>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"><span style=\"color:black\">Industry visit held for 3rd semester diploma students on the day of 11th November, 2022 to enhance their practical knowledge.</span></span></span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n', '2023-11-29-39-66.pdf', 1, 0, '2023-11-29 08:23:27', '2023-11-29 08:23:27', NULL, NULL),
(18, 1, '5', '24', '2022-11-26', '2022', 'GSECL Padva Power Plant Visit', '<ul>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"><span style=\"color:black\">Industry visit held for 3rd and 5th semester diploma students on the day of 26th November, 2022 to gain practical knowledge as well to introduce with Industry.</span></span></span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n', '2023-11-29-53-padva.pdf', 1, 0, '2023-11-29 08:24:42', '2023-11-29 08:24:42', NULL, NULL),
(19, 8, '1', '89', '2023-10-28', '2023', 'Regional Science Center', '<p>The Regional Science Centre tour was the interface between the<br />\r\ncollege life and the marine science world. All those who attended<br />\r\nexperienced the moment. It was clear that all the basic and<br />\r\nfundamental of each information and working methodology be<br />\r\nlearnt thoroughly. Students learnt how science works, what is<br />\r\nthe current platform and languages, upcoming facilities and helpline<br />\r\nbriefs.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The center will provide outdoor installations like animatronics dinosaurs,<br />\r\nscience-theme-based toy trains, nature exploration tours, motion simulators,<br />\r\nportable solar observatories, and others.<br />\r\nThis also has several others including the Marine Aquatic gallery, Automobile<br />\r\ngallery, Nobel Prize gallery for Physiology and Medicine, Electro-Mechanics<br />\r\ngallery, and Biology Science gallery.</p>\r\n', '2023-12-14-63-RegionalCenter_visit_28_10_23.docx.pdf', 1, 0, '2023-12-14 10:54:49', '2023-12-14 10:54:49', NULL, NULL),
