(216, 1, '5', '23', '2024-08-07', '2024', 'Parle Company Visit', '<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Since 1929, Parle have grown to become India&#39;s leading manufacturer of biscuits and confectionery. As the makers of the world&#39;s largest selling biscuit, Parle-G, and a host of other very popular brands, the Parle name symbolizes quality, nutrition and superior taste.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>In 1939, Parle launched its first biscuit, Parle Gluco, which was later rebranded as Parle-G. The &quot;G&quot; in Parle-G stands for &quot;Glucose,&quot; emphasizing the biscuit&#39;s energy-giving qualities. Parle-G became a staple in Indian households, known for its affordability and taste.</p>\r\n', '2024-08-10-97-industry visit report bridge course diploma parle (1).pdf', 1, 0, '2024-08-10 05:29:36', '2024-08-10 05:29:36', NULL, NULL),
