(223, 1, '5', '23', '2024-08-30', '2024', 'Industry Visit At Amul Dairy', '<h3>Amul Today</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Today, Amul is a massive dairy cooperative with millions of farmers as members, producing a wide range of products, including milk, butter, cheese, yogurt, and ice cream. The brand is known not only in India but globally for its quality products. Amul&rsquo;s growth has been powered by its robust supply chain, modern marketing strategies (including the famous Amul girl ads), and unwavering commitment to empowering farmers.&nbsp;</p>\r\n', '2024-09-08-93-Amul Dairy Visit.pdf', 1, 0, '2024-09-08 13:40:22', '2024-09-08 13:40:22', NULL, NULL),
(224, 1, '5', '25', '2024-08-08', '2024', 'Amul Dairy, Anand', '<p>The Department of Computer Science and Engineering Students visited <strong>Amul Dairy, Anand</strong> on <strong>8th August 2024</strong>.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n', '2024-09-10-79-3rd Diploma Amul Dairy - Anand (1).pdf', 1, 0, '2024-12-20 07:27:20', '2024-12-20 07:27:20', NULL, NULL),
(225, 1, '1', '4', '2024-09-04', '2024', 'Amul Dairy,Anand', '<p>The Department of Computer Science and Engineering Students visited&nbsp;<strong>Amul Dairy, Anand</strong>&nbsp;on&nbsp;<strong>4th September 2024</strong>.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n', '2024-09-10-69-3rd degree.pdf', 1, 0, '2024-12-19 11:33:28', '2024-12-19 11:33:28', NULL, NULL),
(226, 8, '1', '89', '2024-09-06', '2024', 'MEETANSHI, Bhavnagar', '<p>The objective of a visit to an IT company for students is to provide them with a comprehensive understanding of the IT industry and its various aspects. This includes gaining knowledge about the latest trends, technologies, and innovations in the IT sector, exploring various career paths and opportunities available in the industry, and understanding the skills and qualifications required for each role. Additionally, students will have the opportunity to observe and learn from the company&#39;s operations, projects, and teams, and gain hands-on experience through interactive sessions or workshops.&nbsp;<br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n', '2024-09-16-19-industrial visit BCA3_G_Meetanshi.pdf', 1, 0, '2024-09-16 05:26:37', '2024-09-16 05:26:37', NULL, NULL),
