(236, 1, '5', '25', '2024-08-20', '2024', 'Amul Dairy – Anand – Gujarat.', '<p>The world famous co-operative dairy &lsquo;Amul&rsquo; is one of the main features of Anand. Amul is the biggest dairy not only in India, but in Asia too. It is owned by thousands of small and medium farmers. Amul has created revolution. The experiment has led to small dairies at district and village levels. Other states and even many countries have been inspired by it.</p>\r\n', '2024-11-23-69-Industry Visit -Amul Dairy Anand Diploma SEM-3 Report-31-8-2024.pdf', 0, 1, '2024-12-27 04:46:31', '2024-12-27 04:46:31', NULL, NULL),
(237, 1, '5', '25', '2024-09-04', '2024', 'Android Mobile App Development', '<p>Expert speaker Divyam Oza guided participants through the essentials of Android mobile app development, including app structure, UI design, activity lifecycle, data management, and API integration. Attendees gained hands-on experience in building and testing Android apps, with real-time demonstrations and practical coding sessions, preparing them for future mobile development projects.</p>\r\n', '2024-11-23-62-04-Sep-2024 Workshop on Android Technology - Diploma.pdf', 0, 1, '2024-12-27 04:45:31', '2024-12-27 04:45:31', NULL, NULL),
(238, 1, '1', '4', '2024-09-03', '2024', 'Android Mobile App Development', '<p>Expert speaker Divyam Oza guided participants through the essentials of Android mobile app development, including app structure, UI design, activity lifecycle, data management, and API integration. Attendees gained hands-on experience in building and testing Android apps, with real-time demonstrations and practical coding sessions, preparing them for future mobile development projects.</p>\r\n', '2024-11-23-75-03-Sep-2024 Workshop on Android Technology - Degree (1).pdf', 1, 0, '2024-11-23 09:28:03', '2024-11-23 09:28:03', NULL, NULL),
(239, 1, '5', '25', '2024-09-17', '2024', 'Azziptech - Bhavnagar', '<p>The Department of Computer Science and Engineering Students visited <strong>AzzipTech, Bhavnagar</strong> on <strong>17th September 2024</strong>.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n', '2024-11-23-37-Industrial Visit Azziptech-Bhavnagar-27-Sep-2024_VBB.pdf', 1, 0, '2024-12-20 07:28:07', '2024-12-20 07:28:07', NULL, NULL),
(240, 8, '1', '135', '2024-10-09', '2024', 'Tops Technologies', '<p>A group of 28 students recently visited TOPS Technology in Ahmedabad as part of an educational tour aimed at gaining practical insights into the IT industry. The visit provided the students with an opportunity to explore various technology domains, interact with industry experts, and understand the functioning of a leading IT training and placement company. The students were exposed to real-time projects and the latest technologies, such as Java, Python, Data Science, and Full Stack Development, which are highly sought after in the job market. The visit also included career counseling sessions, where students learned about the training programs and placement assistance offered by TOPS Technology, helping them align their academic knowledge with industry demands and enhance their future career prospects.</p>\r\n', '2024-11-29-15-industrial visit TOPS.pdf', 1, 0, '2024-11-29 10:09:40', '2024-11-29 10:09:40', NULL, NULL),
(241, 8, '1', '134', '2024-10-09', '2024', 'Tops Technologies', '<p>A group of 28 students recently visited TOPS Technology in Ahmedabad as part of an educational tour aimed at gaining practical insights into the IT industry. The visit provided the students with an opportunity to explore various technology domains, interact with industry experts, and understand the functioning of a leading IT training and placement company. The students were exposed to real-time projects and the latest technologies, such as Java, Python, Data Science, and Full Stack Development, which are highly sought after in the job market. The visit also included career counseling sessions, where students learned about the training programs and placement assistance offered by TOPS Technology, helping them align their academic knowledge with industry demands and enhance their future career prospects.</p>\r\n', '2024-11-29-65-industrial visit TOPS.pdf', 1, 0, '2024-11-29 10:09:47', '2024-11-29 10:09:47', NULL, NULL),
