(248, 1, '1', '3', '2024-08-22', '2024', 'Water Purification Plant Takht', '<p>The industrial visit to the Water Purification Plant at Takhteshwar, Bhavnagar, was an enriching experience for the students of Gyanmanjari Innovative University. It bridged the gap between theoretical knowledge and practical application, providing students with a deeper appreciation of the complexities&nbsp;On 22nd August, 2024, the students of Gyanmanjari Innovative University, from Diploma 3rd Semester, Diploma 5th Semester, and Degree 3rd Semester, had the opportunity to visit the Water Purification Plant at Takhteshwar, Bhavnagar. The visit was organized to provide students with practical exposure to water treatment processes and enhance their understanding of the theoretical concepts learned in their coursework.&nbsp;</p>\r\n', '2024-11-29-75-industrial visit.pdf', 1, 0, '2024-11-30 06:18:03', '2024-11-30 06:18:03', NULL, NULL),
(249, 1, '5', '24', '2024-08-22', '2024', 'Water Purification Plant Takht', '<p>The industrial visit to the Water Purification Plant at Takhteshwar, Bhavnagar, was an enriching experience for the students of Gyanmanjari Innovative University. It bridged the gap between theoretical knowledge and practical application, providing students with a deeper appreciation of the complexities&nbsp;On 22nd August, 2024, the students of Gyanmanjari Innovative University, from Diploma 3rd Semester, Diploma 5th Semester, and Degree 3rd Semester, had the opportunity to visit the Water Purification Plant at Takhteshwar, Bhavnagar. The visit was organized to provide students with practical exposure to water treatment processes and enhance their understanding of the theoretical concepts learned in their coursework.&nbsp;<br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n', '2024-11-30-16-industrial visit.pdf', 1, 0, '2024-11-30 06:15:31', '2024-11-30 06:15:31', NULL, NULL),
(250, 1, '9', '244', '2024-08-22', '2024', 'Water Purification Plant Takht', '<p>On 22nd August, 2024, the students of Gyanmanjari Innovative University, from Diploma 3rd Semester, Diploma 5th Semester, and Degree 3rd Semester, had the opportunity to visit the Water Purification Plant at Takhteshwar, Bhavnagar. The visit was organized to provide students with practical exposure to water treatment processes and enhance their understanding of the theoretical concepts learned in their coursework.&nbsp;<br />\r\nThe industrial visit to the Water Purification Plant at Takhteshwar, Bhavnagar, was an enriching experience for the students of Gyanmanjari Innovative University. It bridged the gap between theoretical knowledge and practical application, providing students with a deeper appreciation of the complexities&nbsp;involved in water treatment. The visit also highlighted the significance of clean water in public health and the role of engineers in ensuring its availability.&nbsp;</p>\r\n', '2024-11-30-96-industrial visit.pdf', 0, 1, '2024-11-30 06:16:04', '2024-11-30 06:16:04', NULL, NULL),
(251, 1, '1', '3', '2024-10-07', '2024', 'Science City, Bhavnagar ', '<p>On 07th October, 2024, the students of Gyanmanjari Innovative University, from Diploma 3rd Semester, Diploma 5th Semester, and Degree 3rd Semester, had the opportunity to visit the Science City, Bhavnagar. To explore the educational exhibits and scientific displays aimed at promoting science and technology among the public.&nbsp;<br />\r\nThe visit was informative and engaging, making science accessible and interesting for students and the general public alike. Science City offers a wellrounded educational experience. The interactive displays engage visitors in understanding complex scientific ideas in a simple, engaging way. The planetarium and 3D theatre further enhance learning through immersive experiences. Students and children, in particular, benefit from the hands-on demonstrations and explanations.</p>\r\n', '2024-11-30-37-industrial visit science city.pdf', 1, 0, '2024-11-30 06:26:32', '2024-11-30 06:26:32', NULL, NULL),
(252, 1, '5', '24', '2024-10-07', '2024', 'Science City, Bhavnagar  ', '<p>On 07th October, 2024, the students of Gyanmanjari Innovative University, from Diploma 3rd Semester, Diploma 5th Semester, and Degree 3rd Semester, had the opportunity to visit the Science City, Bhavnagar. To explore the educational exhibits and scientific displays aimed at promoting science and technology among the public.&nbsp;<br />\r\nThe visit was informative and engaging, making science accessible and interesting for students and the general public alike. Science City offers a wellrounded educational experience. The interactive displays engage visitors in understanding complex scientific ideas in a simple, engaging way. The planetarium and 3D theatre further enhance learning through immersive experiences. Students and children, in particular, benefit from the hands-on demonstrations and explanations.</p>\r\n', '2024-11-30-54-industrial visit science city.pdf', 1, 0, '2024-11-30 06:30:25', '2024-11-30 06:30:25', NULL, NULL),
(253, 1, '1', '212', '2024-10-07', '2024', 'Science City, Bhavnagar ', '<p>The Science City in Bhavnagar provides an interactive and educational experience. It houses various science exhibits, a planetarium, and live demonstrations that focus on physics, chemistry, biology, and space exploration.&nbsp;</p>\r\n', '2024-12-03-68-industrial visit science city.pdf', 1, 0, '2024-12-03 11:03:45', '2024-12-03 11:03:45', NULL, NULL),
