ew Roman\',serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">&ndash; Insight into thermal efficiency and waste&nbsp; management.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:96px; margin-right:76px; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\',serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Engineers and staff at the station explained each process in detail, and interactive sessions were&nbsp; held to clarify student doubts.The visit was successfully accomplished under the valuable&nbsp; guidance and coordination of </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\',serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Prof. Jaydipsinh Parmar</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\',serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\',serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Prof. Disha Siddhapura</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\',serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, and </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\',serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Prof.&nbsp; Pankaj Chaudhary</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\',serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, whose efforts ensured a well-organized and educational experience for&nbsp; all the participating students.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:97px\"><span style=\"font-size:15.960000038146973pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\',serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Conclusion&nbsp;</strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:96px; margin-right:76px; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span st