(342, 1, '5', '213', '2025-07-29', '2025', 'Thermal Power Station Padva', '<p style=\"margin-left:97px\"><span style=\"font-size:15.960000038146973pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\',serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Objective&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:96px; margin-right:76px; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\',serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">The primary objective of the industrial visit was to provide students with practical exposure to&nbsp; the real-time functioning of a thermal power plant. By visiting the Bhavnagar Thermal Power&nbsp; Station, students gained a deeper understanding of how electricity is generated using thermal&nbsp; energy, how various components like boilers, turbines, and control systems operate, and how&nbsp; power is managed and transmitted efficiently. The visit aimed to bridge the gap between&nbsp; theoretical classroom learning and actual industrial practices, thereby enhancing students&#39;&nbsp; technical knowledge, observational skills, and interest in power system engineering..&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:96px\"><span style=\"font-size:15.960000038146973pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\',serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>About Activities:&nbsp;</strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:96px; margin-right:89px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\',serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">During the visit, students were guided through various sections of the power plant including: </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:9.960000038146973pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Noto Sans Symbols\',sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">&bull; </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\',serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Boiler Unit </strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\',serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">&ndash; Introduction to steam generation and combustion process.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:121px; margin-right:77px\"><span style=\"font-size:9.960000038146973pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Noto Sans Symbols\',sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">&bull; </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\',serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Turbine Section </strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\',serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">&ndash; Demonstration of energy conversion from thermal to mechanical&nbsp; and then to electrical.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:121px; margin-right:77px\"><span style=\"font-size:9.960000038146973pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Noto Sans Symbols\',sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">&bull; </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\',serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Control Room </strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\',serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">&ndash; Understanding centralized control and monitoring of power plant&nbsp; operations.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:121px; margin-right:76px\"><span style=\"font-size:9.960000038146973pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Noto Sans Symbols\',sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">&bull; </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\',serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Cooling System &amp; Ash Handling </strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\',serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">&ndash; Insight into thermal efficiency and waste&nbsp; management.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:96px; margin-right:76px; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\',serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Engineers and staff at the station explained each process in detail, and interactive sessions were&nbsp; held to clarify student doubts.The visit was successfully accomplished under the valuable&nbsp; guidance and coordination of </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\',serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Prof. Jaydipsinh Parmar</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\',serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\',serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Prof. Disha Siddhapura</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\',serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, and </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\',serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Prof.&nbsp; Pankaj Chaudhary</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\',serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, whose efforts ensured a well-organized and educational experience for&nbsp; all the participating students.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:97px\"><span style=\"font-size:15.960000038146973pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\',serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Conclusion&nbsp;</strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:96px; margin-right:76px; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\',serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">The industrial visit to the GNITE Thermal Power Station was highly beneficial.&nbsp; It provided students with valuable insights into large-scale power production and helped them&nbsp; relate their theoretical knowledge to practical applications. The coordination and support of the&nbsp; faculty members made the visit informative and well-Organized</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n', '2025-10-31-52-2. Industry Visit Thermal Power plant visit DE3_EC.pdf', 1, 0, '2025-10-31 02:39:36', '2025-10-31 02:39:36', NULL, NULL),
(343, 26, '1', '365', '2025-10-15', '2025', ' INDUSTRIAL VISIT AT SUMITOMO ', '<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n', '2025-11-10-26-SUMITOMO CHEMICALS LTD..docx', 1, 0, '2025-11-18 05:38:25', '2025-11-18 05:38:25', NULL, NULL),
(344, 1, '1', '562', '2025-09-12', '2025', 'MEETANSHI TECHNOLOGIES LLP', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\">The industrial visit to Meetanshi Technologies LLP, Bhavnagar offered valuable insights into the operations of a dynamic IT company specializing in web development, mobile applications, full-stack solutions, and cloud integration. Participants observed the company&rsquo;s use of modern technologies such as React, Flutter, Node.js, Python, and AWS, along with its collaborative development processes in a professional environment. The visit helped bridge the gap between classroom learning and practical applications, providing participants with a clearer understanding of software development practices, industry standards, and potential career opportunities in the IT sector. Furthermore, the visit highlighted emerging trends in software and game development, enabling participants to understand the evolving landscape of digital solutions. It also served as a platform for discussing career opportunities and professional growth within the IT industry.</p>\r\n', '2025-11-11-49-12-9-25_Meetanshi Technology_Industry Visit TPA Report.pdf', 1, 0, '2025-11-11 07:31:38', '2025-11-11 07:31:38', NULL, NULL),
(345, 1, '1', '562', '2025-09-11', '2025', 'ADITE TECHNOLOGIES', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\">The industrial visit to Adite Technologies LLP, Bhavnagar offered valuable insights into the operations of a dynamic IT company specializing in web development, mobile applications, full-stack solutions, and cloud integration. Participants observed the company&rsquo;s use of modern technologies such as React, Flutter, Node.js, Python, and AWS, along with its collaborative development processes in a professional environment. The visit helped bridge the gap between classroom learning and practical applications, providing participants with a clearer understanding of software development practices, industry standards, and potential career opportunities in the IT sector. Furthermore, the visit highlighted emerging trends in software and game development, enabling participants to understand the evolving landscape of digital solutions. It also served as a platform for discussing career opportunities and professional growth within the IT industry.</p>\r\n', '2025-11-11-85-11-9-25_Adite Technologies_Industry Visit_TPA Report.pdf', 1, 0, '2025-11-11 07:33:54', '2025-11-11 07:33:54', NULL, NULL),
(346, 1, '1', '562', '2025-09-09', '2025', 'LinkedIn profile Creation', '<p>The LinkedIn Profile Creation Activity Session conducted to help them build a strong<br />\r\nprofessional identity in the digital era.<br />\r\nThe session focused on creating and optimizing LinkedIn profiles, guiding students on how to<br />\r\neffectively showcase their skills, academic achievements, projects, and certifications.<br />\r\nStudents learned the importance of networking, personal branding, and career-building<br />\r\nthrough LinkedIn, gaining insights into how a well- crafted profile can open doors to<br />\r\ninternships, job opportunities, and industry connections.<br />\r\nThis activity aimed to enhance students&#39; employability, encourage proactive career planning,<br />\r\nand prepare them for the professional world.</p>\r\n', '2025-11-11-17-9-9-25_Linkedin Profile Creation_1st B.Tech_TPA Report.pdf', 0, 1, '2025-11-11 07:55:12', '2025-11-11 07:55:12', NULL, NULL),
(347, 1, '1', '2', '2025-09-26', '2025', 'Industrial Visit at Internatio', '<p>The industrial visit to the International Automobile Centre of Excellence (iACE), Gandhinagar, offered fifth-semester Mechanical and Aeronautical Engineering students from Gyanmanjari Institute of Technology an enriching exposure to modern automotive technologies and industry practices. Established through a collaboration between the Government of Gujarat and Maruti Suzuki, iACE serves as a premier hub for automotive skill development, featuring advanced labs, EV training modules, diagnostic tools, and state-of-the-art manufacturing and testing facilities. Through guided tours, live demonstrations, and expert interactions, students gained practical insights into electric mobility, vehicle diagnostics, automation, and sustainable transportation. The visit effectively bridged the gap between theoretical knowledge and real-world applications, familiarizing students with evolving industry trends and career opportunities. Overall, the experience enhanced their technical competence, encouraged innovation, and prepared them to contribute meaningfully to the rapidly transforming automotive and mobility ecosystem.</p>\r\n', '2025-11-26-87-Industrial Visit.pdf', 1, 0, '2025-11-26 11:06:48', '2025-11-26 11:06:48', NULL, NULL),
(348, 1, '5', '22', '2025-09-26', '2025', 'Industrial Visit at Internatio', '<p>The industrial visit to the International Automobile Centre of Excellence (iACE), Gandhinagar, offered fifth-semester Mechanical and Aeronautical Engineering students from Gyanmanjari Institute of Technology an enriching exposure to modern automotive technologies and industry practices. Established through a collaboration between the Government of Gujarat and Maruti Suzuki, iACE serves as a premier hub for automotive skill development, featuring advanced labs, EV training modules, diagnostic tools, and state-of-the-art manufacturing and testing facilities. Through guided tours, live demonstrations, and expert interactions, students gained practical insights into electric mobility, vehicle diagnostics, automation, and sustainable transportation. The visit effectively bridged the gap between theoretical knowledge and real-world applications, familiarizing students with evolving industry trends and career opportunities. Overall, the experience enhanced their technical competence, encouraged innovation, and prepared them to contribute meaningfully to the rapidly transforming automotive and mobility ecosystem.</p>\r\n', '2025-11-26-34-Industrial Visit.pdf', 1, 0, '2025-11-26 11:08:05', '2025-11-26 11:08:05', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `tbl_industry_visit` (`id`, `faculty_id`, `level_id`, `program_id`, `date`, `visit_year`, `visit_name`, `visit_description`, `report`, `is_active`, `is_delete`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `created_by`, `updated_by`) VALUES
(349, 1, '1', '3', '2025-08-30', '2025', 'Field visit to Shetrunji Dam', '<p><strong>Introduction</strong><br />\r\nThe primary objective of this educational field visit was to provide students with practical exposure to hydroelectric generation systems, dam construction techniques, and water management processes. It aimed to bridge the gap between theoretical knowledge and real-world applications in the field of electrical and civil infrastructure.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<strong>Objectives</strong><br />\r\n? To create awareness about various professional student chapters and their significance. ? To motivate students to become members and participate in technical and professional events. ? To develop leadership, teamwork, and networking skills among students through chapter activities. About the Activity Shetrunji Dam is one of the significant water reservoirs in the Bhavnagar region, designed for irrigation, water supply, and power generation purposes. It plays an essential role in regional water management and supports local agriculture and industries. Details of Visit: Students were given a guided tour of the dam site by the technical staff, who explained: ? The working principle of hydroelectric power generation. ? Control and monitoring mechanisms used for water flow and turbine operation. ? Electrical power distribution and safety systems associated with dam operations. ? Environmental and safety measures maintained at the site. Students actively interacted with the engineers and gained insights into the challenges of dam maintenance and operation during different seasons</p>\r\n', '2025-11-27-24-15. Field Visit__(3th-5th )_(30-08- 2025).docx.pdf', 1, 0, '2025-11-27 09:16:05', '2025-11-27 09:16:05', NULL, NULL),
(350, 1, '1', '212', '2025-08-30', '2025', 'Field visit to Shetrunji Dam', '<p><strong>Introduction</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>The primary objective of this educational field visit was to provide students with practical exposure to hydroelectric generation systems, dam construction techniques, and water management processes. It aimed to bridge the gap between theoretical knowledge and real-world applications in the field of electrical and civil infrastructure.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Objectives</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>? To create awareness about various professional student chapters and their significance. ? To motivate students to become members and participate in technical and professional events. ? To develop leadership, teamwork, and networking skills among students through chapter activities. About the Activity Shetrunji Dam is one of the significant water reservoirs in the Bhavnagar region, designed for irrigation, water supply, and power generation purposes. It plays an essential role in regional water management and supports local agriculture and industries.</p>\r\n', '2025-11-27-21-15. Field Visit__(3th-5th )_(30-08- 2025).docx.pdf', 1, 0, '2025-11-27 09:17:32', '2025-11-27 09:17:32', NULL, NULL),
(351, 1, '5', '24', '2025-08-30', '2025', 'Field visit to Shetrunji Dam', '<p>Introduction</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The primary objective of this educational field visit was to provide students with practical exposure to hydroelectric generation systems, dam construction techniques, and water management processes. It aimed to bridge the gap between theoretical knowledge and real-world applications in the field of electrical and civil infrastructure.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Objectives</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>? To create awareness about various professional student chapters and their significance. ? To motivate students to become members and participate in technical and professional events. ? To develop leadership, teamwork, and networking skills among students through chapter activities. About the Activity Shetrunji Dam is one of the significant water reservoirs in the Bhavnagar region, designed for irrigation, water supply, and power generation purposes. It play</p>\r\n', '2025-11-27-62-15. Field Visit__(3th-5th )_(30-08- 2025).docx.pdf', 1, 0, '2025-11-27 09:19:24', '2025-11-27 09:19:24', NULL, NULL),
(352, 1, '5', '213', '2025-08-30', '2025', 'Field visit to Shetrunji Dam', '<p><strong>Introduction</strong><br />\r\nThe primary objective of this educational field visit was to provide students with practical exposure to hydroelectric generation systems, dam construction techniques, and water management processes. It aimed to bridge the gap between theoretical knowledge and real-world applications in the field of electrical and civil infrastructure.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Objectives</strong><br />\r\n? To create awareness about various professional student chapters and their significance. ? To motivate students to become members and participate in technical and professional events. ? To develop leadership, teamwork, and networking skills among students through chapter activities.</p>\r\n', '2025-11-27-75-15. Field Visit__(3th-5th )_(30-08- 2025).docx.pdf', 1, 0, '2025-11-27 09:21:19', '2025-11-27 09:21:19', NULL, NULL),
(353, 1, '5', '24', '2025-06-20', '2025', 'Western Railway Workshop Visit', '<p>The main objective of an industrial visit is to bridge the gap between theoretical learning and practical application. It provides students with exposure to real working environments and helps them gain insight into the internal operations of companies and industries.<br />\r\n1. Real-World Exposure: To give students a firsthand experience of how industries operate in real time.<br />\r\n2. Application of Knowledge: To help students understand the practical implementation of theoretical concepts learned in the classroom.<br />\r\n3. Interaction with Professionals: To facilitate direct interaction with industry professionals and understand their roles, responsibilities, and experiences.<br />\r\n4. Awareness of Industry Practices: To make students familiar with industrial practices, technologies, workflows, and quality standards.<br />\r\n5. Career Orientation: To inspire students</p>\r\n', '2025-11-27-89-1. Report on Industrial Visit at Western Railway Workshop Bhavnagar Para (June - 2025) (1).pdf', 1, 0, '2025-11-27 10:09:54', '2025-11-27 10:09:54', NULL, NULL),
(354, 1, '5', '213', '2025-06-20', '2025', 'Western Railway Workshop Visit', '<p>The main objective of an industrial visit is to bridge the gap between theoretical learning and practical application. It provides students with exposure to real working environments and helps them gain insight into the internal operations of companies and industries.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>1. Real-World Exposure: To give students a firsthand experience of how industries operate in real time.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>2. Application of Knowledge: To help students understand the practical implementation of theoretical concepts learned in the classroom.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>3. Interaction with Professionals: To facilitate direct interaction with industry professionals and understand&nbsp;their roles, responsibilities, and experiences.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>4. Awareness of Industry Practices: To make students familiar with industrial practices, technologies, workflows,&nbsp;and quality standards.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>5. Career Orientation: To inspire students by showing them various career opportunities and paths in the&nbsp;industry.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>6. Skill Development: To improve students&#39; observational, analytical, and communication skills.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>7. Innovation and Ideas: To stimulate innovation and creativity by observing industrial problem-solving and&nbsp;process optimization.</p>\r\n', '2025-11-27-94-1. Report on Industrial Visit at Western Railway Workshop Bhavnagar Para (June - 2025) (1).pdf', 1, 0, '2025-11-27 10:14:15', '2025-11-27 10:14:15', NULL, NULL),
(355, 1, '5', '575', '2023-11-08', '2023', 'TOPS TECHNOLOGY', '<p>The Department of Computer Science and Engineering Students visited Tops Technology On Date: <strong>8th November 2023.</strong></p>\r\n', '2025-12-06-23-2024-01-13-20-tops technologis visit report.docx', 1, 0, '2025-12-06 06:25:58', '2025-12-06 06:25:58', NULL, NULL),
(356, 1, '5', '575', '2023-07-14', '2023', 'Sarvottam Dairy, Sihor', '<p>The Department of Computer Science and Engineering Students visited <strong>Sarvottam Dairy</strong> on <strong>14th July 2023</strong> to gain insights into its operations and management practices.</p>\r\n', '2025-12-06-14-Sarvottam Dairy Computer.pdf', 1, 0, '2025-12-06 06:32:24', '2025-12-06 06:32:24', NULL, NULL),
(357, 1, '1', '1', '2025-07-28', '2025', 'Visit of Commercial Site', '<p>Industrial visits are organized to give students real-time exposure to industry operations and work culture. These visits help students connect classroom learning with practical applications. By observing processes and interacting with professionals, students gain valuable insights into modern technologies and industry expectations. The experience enhances their understanding, builds confidence, and prepares them for future careers.</p>\r\n', '2025-12-12-11-12.Industrial Visit Report B. TECH. ALL.pdf', 1, 0, '2025-12-12 08:14:57', '2025-12-12 08:14:57', NULL, NULL),
(358, 1, '5', '21', '2025-07-28', '2025', 'Commercial Site visit ', '<p>Industrial visits offer students an opportunity to witness how industries function on a daily basis. These tours allow students to see practical applications of their academic concepts in real settings. By meeting professionals and learning about their roles, students gain awareness of current technologies and workplace requirements. Such experiences broaden their understanding and help them develop the skills needed for their future careers.</p>\r\n', '2025-12-12-32-12.Industrial Visit Report DIPLOMA ALL.pdf', 1, 0, '2025-12-12 08:23:43', '2025-12-12 08:23:43', NULL, NULL),
(359, 1, '5', '21', '2025-08-30', '2025', 'Shetrujay dam Visit', '', '2025-12-12-63-12.Industrial Visit Report Diploma ALL.docx', 1, 0, '2025-12-12 08:29:04', '2025-12-12 08:29:04', NULL, NULL),
(360, 1, '1', '1', '2024-09-10', '2024', 'Bhikhada Dam Visit', '<p>A dam visit is organized to provide students with practical exposure to water resource management and hydraulic structures. The visit helps students understand the design, construction, and functioning of dams. By observing real-life applications and interacting with experts, students gain insights into safety measures, environmental impact, and engineering practices. Such visits enhance learning through real-world experience.</p>\r\n', '2025-12-15-36-bhikda dam visit (1).pdf', 1, 0, '2025-12-15 05:44:39', '2025-12-15 05:44:39', NULL, NULL),
(361, 1, '1', '1', '2025-03-01', '2025', 'Adani Port Visit (Mundra)', '<p>The visit to Adani Port, Mundra, provided students with practical exposure to port operations and logistics management. Students observed large-scale cargo handling, transportation systems, and modern port infrastructure. Interaction with industry professionals offered insights into safety practices, automation, and global trade processes. The visit enhanced students&rsquo; understanding of real-world industrial operations and supply chain management.</p>\r\n', '2025-12-15-44-MUNDRA VISIT - MKV, ADR.pdf', 1, 0, '2025-12-15 05:53:23', '2025-12-15 05:53:23', NULL, NULL),
(362, 1, '5', '21', '2025-03-01', '2025', 'Adani Port Visit (Mundra)', '<p>The educational visit to Adani Port, Mundra, gave students firsthand experience of port functioning and logistics activities. Students learned about cargo movement, port infrastructure, and advanced operational systems. Discussions with professionals helped them understand safety standards, technology usage, and international trade operations. This visit enriched their practical knowledge and provided valuable industry exposure.</p>\r\n', '2025-12-15-55-MUNDRA VISIT - MKV, ADR.pdf', 1, 0, '2025-12-15 05:55:35', '2025-12-15 05:55:35', NULL, NULL),
