mentors, guiding students on career planning, higher studies, industry expectations, and skill development. During the session, alumni often discuss their personal success stories, challenges faced in the professional world, and how the knowledge gained in college helped them shape their careers. These interactions also foster a strong bond between alumni and the institution, encouraging networking, collaboration, and future opportunities such as internships and placements. Overall, an alumni interaction enriches students&rsquo; understanding of the professional environment, motivates them to set clear goals, and strengthens the institution&rsquo;s alumni network.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n', '2025-10-31-96-ALUMINI INTERACTION bcom 3.pdf', 1, 0, '2025-10-31 06:56:49', '2025-10-31 06:56:49', NULL, NULL),
(9, 4, 1, 55, 'alumni', 'ALUMNI MEET 2025', '2025-08-25', '<p><span style=\"font-size:16pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\',serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Objective of session&nbsp;</strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\',serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">The main objectives of the Alumni Interaction are to strengthen the bond between the alumni and the institution and to create a platform for sharing valuable experiences and guidance with current students. This interaction aims to bridge the gap between academic learning and real-world industry practices by allowing alumni to share their career journeys, challenges, and achievements. It also provides an excellent opportunity for students to gain career insights, practical knowledge, and networking opportunities that can help them in their future endeavors. Moreover, alumni interactions serve as a source of motivation and inspiration for students, encouraging them to set clear professional goals. Through such sessions, institutions can also gather feedback from alumni to enhance the curriculum and teaching methods, ensuring continuous improvement and maintaining strong alumni relations.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\',serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>About Session</strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\',serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">An &nbsp; Alumni Interaction &nbsp; is an engaging session where former students of the institution (alumni) return to share their experiences, insights, and professional journeys with current students. The main purpose of this interaction is to bridge the gap between academic learning and real-world applications. Alumni serve as valuable mentors, guiding students on career planning, higher studies, industry expectations, and skill development. During the session, alumni often discuss their personal success stories, challenges faced in the professional world, and how the knowledge gained in college helped them shape their careers. These interactions also foster a strong bond between alumni and the institution, encouraging networking, collaboration, and future opportunities such as internships and placements. Overall, an alumni interaction enriches students&rsquo; understanding of the professional environment, motivates them to set clear goals, and strengthens the institution&rsquo;s alumni network.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n', '2025-10-31-70-ALUMINI INTERACTION bcom 3.pdf', 1, 0, '2025-10-31 07:10:47', '2025-10-31 07:10:47', NULL, NULL),
(10, 1, 1, 2, 'interview', 'Mock Interview', '2025-11-05', '<p>The mock interview session held at Gyanmanjari Diploma Engineering College on 5th November 2025 offered fifth-semester Mechanical Engineering students a valuable opportunity to experience a simulated real-world interview environment. Conducted by an experienced industry professional, the session aimed to enhance students&rsquo; employability by helping them practice technical and behavioral questions, improve communication skills, and strengthen confidence. Through structured interviews and personalized feedback, students gained insights into industry expectations, effective self-presentation, body language, and stress management. The expert&rsquo;s guidance helped participants refine their responses and better align their academic knowledge with professional requirements. Overall, the session proved highly beneficial, equipping students with essential skills and boosting their readiness for upcoming placement interviews and career opportunities.</p>\r\n', '2025-11-26-25-Mock Interview.pdf', 1, 0, '2025-11-26 11:12:06', '2025-11-26 11:12:06', NULL, NULL),
(11, 1, 5, 22, 'interview', 'Mock Interview', '2025-11-05', '<p>The mock interview session held at Gyanmanjari Diploma Engineering College on 5th November 2025 offered fifth-semester Mechanical Engineering students a valuable opportunity to experience a simulated real-world interview environment. Conducted by an experienced industry professional, the session aimed to enhance students&rsquo; employability by helping them practice technical and behavioral questions, improve communication skills, and strengthen confidence. Through structured interviews and personalized feedback, students gained insights into industry expectations, effective self-presentation, body language, and stress management. The expert&rsquo;s guidance helped participants refine their responses and better align their academic knowledge with professional requirements. Overall, the session proved highly beneficial, equipping students with essential skills and boosting their readiness for upcoming placement interviews and career opportunities.</p>\r\n', '2025-11-26-79-Mock Interview-Diploma.pdf', 1, 0, '2025-11-26 11:12:39', '2025-11-26 11:12:39', NULL, NULL),
(12, 1, 1, 2, 'alumni', 'Alumni Interaction', '2025-10-08', '<p>The alumni interaction held at Gyanmanjari Diploma Engineering College on 8th October 2025 brought valuable guidance and inspiration to fifth-semester Mechanical Engineering students through an engaging session by distinguished alumnus and entrepreneur Mr. Mahedi Hasan. Sharing insights from his journey since graduating in 2021, Mr. Hasan highlighted how the technical skills, teamwork, and problem-solving abilities developed during his college years shaped his entrepreneurial success. His talk emphasized adaptability, innovation, resilience, and the importance of continuous learning in today&rsquo;s dynamic professional environment. Through real-life examples and an interactive Q&amp;A, he encouraged students to think creatively, develop essential soft skills, and consider entrepreneurial pathways. The session strengthened alumni&ndash;institution bonds, offered meaningful mentorship, and motivated students to pursue growth-oriented and innovative career paths.</p>\r\n', '2025-11-26-60-Alumni Interaction.pdf', 1, 0, '2025-11-26 11:17:35', '2025-11-26 11:17:35', NULL, NULL),
(13, 1, 5, 22, 'alumni', 'Alumni Interaction', '2025-10-08', '<p>The alumni interaction held at Gyanmanjari Diploma Engineering College on 8th October 2025 brought valuable guidance and inspiration to fifth-semester Mechanical Engineering students through an engaging session by distinguished alumnus and entrepreneur Mr. Mahedi Hasan. Sharing insights from his journey since graduating in 2021, Mr. Hasan highlighted how the technical skills, teamwork, and problem-solving abilities developed during his college years shaped his entrepreneurial success. His talk emphasized adaptability, innovation, resilience, and the importance of continuous learning in today&rsquo;s dynamic professional environment. Through real-life examples and an interactive Q&amp;A, he encouraged students to think creatively, develop essential soft skills, and consider entrepreneurial pathways. The session strengthened alumni&ndash;institution bonds, offered meaningful mentorship, and motivated students to pursue growth-oriented and innovative career paths.</p>\r\n', '2025-11-26-58-Alumni Interaction-Diploma.pdf', 1, 0, '2025-11-26 11:18:33', '2025-11-26 11:18:33', NULL, NULL),
(14, 4, 1, 53, 'alumni', 'Alumini Interaction', '2025-08-25', '<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong>Objective of session</strong></span><br />\r\nThe main objectives of the Alumni Interaction are to strengthen the bond between the alumni and the institution and to create a platform for sharing valuable experiences and guidance withcurrent students. This interaction aims to bridge the gap between academic learning and real-world industry practices by allowing alumni to share their career journeys, challenges, and achievements. It also provides an excellent opportunity for students to gain career insights, practical knowledge, and networking opportunities that can help them in their future endeavors. Moreover, alumni interactions serve as a source of motivation and inspiration for students, encouraging them to set clear professional goals. Through such sessions, institutions can also gather feedback from alumni to enhance the curriculum and teaching methods, ensuring continuous improvement and maintaining strong alumni relations.<br />\r\n<strong><span style=\"font-size:16px\">About Session</span></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>An Alumni Interaction is an engaging session where former students of the institution (alumni) return to share their experiences, insights, and professional journeys with current students. The main purpose of this interaction is to bridge the gap between academic learning and real-world applications. Alumni serve as valuable mentors, guiding students on career planning, higher studies, industry expectations, and skill development. During the session, alumni often discuss their personal success stories, challenges faced in the professional world, and how the knowledge gained in college helped them shape their careers. These interactions also foster a strong bond between alumni and the institution, encouraging networking, collaboration, and future opportunities such as internships and placements. Overall, an alumni interaction enriches students&rsquo; understanding of the professional environment, motivates them to set clear goals, and strengthens the institution&rsquo;s alumni network.</p>\r\n', '2025-12-08-65-ALUMINI INTERACTION bcom 3.pdf', 1, 0, '2025-12-08 03:16:49', '2025-12-08 03:16:49', NULL, NULL),
(15, 4, 1, 53, 'alumni', 'Alumini Interaction', '2025-08-25', '<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Objective of session</strong></span><br />\r\nThe main objectives of the Alumni Interaction are to strengthen the bond between the alumni and the institution and to create a platform for sharing valuable experiences and guidance with current students. This interaction aims to bridge the gap between academic learning and real-world industry practices by allowing alumni to share their career journeys, challenges, and achievements. It also provides an excellent opportunity for students to gain career insights, practical knowledge, and networking opportunities that can help them in their future endeavors. Moreover, alumni interactions serve as a source of motivation and inspiration for students, encouraging them to set clear professional goals. Through such sessions, institutions can also gather feedback from alumni to enhance the curriculum and teaching methods, ensuring continuous improvement and maintaining strong alumni relations.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>About Session</strong></span><br />\r\nAn Alumni Interaction is an engaging session where former students of the institution(alumni) return to share their experiences, insights, and professional journeys with current students. The main purpose of this interaction is to bridge the gap between academic learning and real-world applications. Alumni serve as valuable mentors, guiding students on career planning, higher studies, industry expectations, and skill development. During the session,alumni often discuss their personal success stories, challenges faced in the professional world, and how the knowledge gained in college helped them shape their careers. These interactions also foster a strong bond between alumni and the institution, encouraging networking, collaboration, and future opportunities such as internships and placements. Overall, an alumni interaction enriches students&rsquo; understanding of the professional environment, motivates them to set clear goals, and strengthens the institution&rsquo;s alumni network.</p>\r\n', '2025-12-08-50-ALUMINI INTERACTION bcom 3.pdf', 1, 0, '2025-12-08 03:33:58', '2025-12-08 03:33:58', NULL, NULL),
(16, 1, 1, 1, 'interview', 'Mock Interview', '2025-10-10', '<p>As part of the ongoing Training and Placement activities at GMIU, a Mock Interview session was organized to help students prepare for their professional careers. The session featured simulated interviews, providing students valuable exposure to real-world interview scenarios. Participants received personalized feedback on their communication, technical skills, and overall performance. This initiative aims to enhance students&#39; confidence and better equip them for upcoming job opportunities.</p>\r\n', NULL, 1, 0, '2025-12-09 09:14:12', '2025-12-09 09:14:12', NULL, NULL),
(17, 1, 5, 21, 'interview', 'Mock Interview', '2025-10-10', '<p>To support students in their career readiness, GMIU recently conducted a Mock Interview session as part of its Training and Placement activities. The session offered students a chance to practice their interview skills in a realistic setting, with feedback from industry professionals. The mock interviews focused on improving communication, problem-solving, and technical expertise. This initiative is designed to boost students&rsquo; confidence and better prepare them for the competitive job market.</p>\r\n', NULL, 1, 0, '2025-12-09 09:20:15', '2025-12-09 09:20:15', NULL, NULL),
(18, 1, 1, 1, 'alumni', 'Alumni Interaction', '2025-08-26', '<p>GMIIU fosters strong and meaningful connections with its alumni community through regular events, mentorship programs, and collaborative initiatives. Alumni play a key role in guiding current students by sharing real-world insights and professional experiences. Through networking sessions and interactive workshops, students gain valuable exposure to industry trends and career pathways. The university also encourages alumni to contribute to academic growth through guest lectures and panel discussions. This dynamic engagement helps build a supportive, lifelong network that strengthens both personal and institutional growth.</p>\r\n', NULL, 1, 0, '2025-12-09 09:29:02', '2025-12-09 09:29:02', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `tbl_laboratories` (`id`, `faculty_id`, `level_id`, `program_id`, `title`, `description`, `is_active`, `is_delete`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `created_by`, `updated_by`) VALUES
(1, '', '', '1,15,21,116', 'Concrete Technology Lab', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><big><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif\"><span dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"EN-US\"><strong>Concrete Technology laboratory </strong>provide the facilities to conduct all types of quality test related to <strong>Cement, Aggregates and Concrete</strong> as in fresh and hardened form. Students will able to learn the standard procedure for all types of testing and their quality of material <strong>as per Indian standard Provisions</strong></span></span></span></big></p>\r\n', 1, 0, '2023-10-05 12:16:07', '2023-10-09 15:26:31', 0, 0),
(2, '', '', '1,15,21,311', 'Surveying Lab', '<p><big><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif\"><span style=\"background-color:white\"><span style=\"color:black\">The Collective field work of Surveying Lab provides the Knowledge about the <strong>Instrumental details (From Agrimensor Level to the Professional Surveyor) and Methodology about Surveying</strong></span></span></span></span></big></p>\r\n', 1, 0, '2023-10-05 13:34:50', '2025-12-09 08:48:30', 0, 0),
(3, '', '', '4,6,7,23,89,90,132,133,134,135,179,186,195,196,226,232,233,234,235,245,246,247,248,255,257,575', 'IOS LAB', '<p>An iOS lab typically refers to a hands-on environment where students, developers, or professionals can learn, experiment, and work on creating apps for iOS devices (like iPhones and iPads). It involves using tools like Xcode and Swift, focusing on practical exercises such as coding, debugging, and testing iOS applications. The lab may also cover aspects like UI/UX design, performance optimization, and app deployment on the App Store.</p>\r\n', 1, 0, '2023-10-06 05:49:44', '2025-06-11 08:59:45', 0, 0),
(4, '', '', '6,7,23,89,90,132,133,134,135,186,195,196,226,234,235,247,248,255', 'WEB DEVELOPMENT LAB', '<p>PHP(short for Hypertext PreProcessor) is the most widely used open source and general purpose server side scripting language used mainly in web development to create dynamic websites and applications. A survey by W3Tech shows that almost 79% of the websites in their data are developed using PHP. So it is necessary to provide depth practical knowledge of PHP to the students.</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>PHP</li>\r\n	<li>HTML</li>\r\n	<li>CSS</li>\r\n	<li>JS</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n', 1, 0, '2023-10-06 07:22:59', '2024-07-23 10:46:05', 0, 0),
(5, '', '', '6,7,23,89,132,234,235,247,248,255', 'ANDROID LAB', '<p>The Android operating system is the world&rsquo;s most popular mobile platform. The objective of the lab is to develop interactive applications in smartphone with multiple activities including audio, video, and notifications. Android app development using Marvel App (Wireframing and Prototyping), Android Studio (development), Appium (testing), Jira &amp; Trello (issue tracking), play store management (deployment).</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Android</li>\r\n	<li>JAVA</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n', 1, 0, '2023-10-06 07:23:38', '2024-07-23 10:46:40', 0, 0),
(6, '', '', '6,7,23,89,132,234,235,247,248,255', 'COMPUTER LAB', '<p>The computer laboratories across the campus comprise over six hundred computers for students and staff. The laboratories form an integral part of the curriculum, providing an environment where students reinforce their understanding of the fundamental principles of Computer Engineering and implement that knowledge in experimental analysis and problem-solving. The Computer Engineering department has state of the art laboratory facilities to furnish the needs of engineering students. Every course offered by the department includes laboratory experiments; as a result, every lab is equipped with a sufficient number of latest computer nodes to meet the requirement of a single computer per student.</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Database</li>\r\n	<li>CS / Network Lab</li>\r\n	<li>.Net / MS SQL Lab</li>\r\n	<li>Python Tools Lab</li>\r\n	<li>C / C++ / Java Lab</li>\r\n	<li>Data Structure Lab</li>\r\n	<li>PHP / MYSQL Lab</li>\r\n	<li>Digital Electronics Lab</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n', 1, 0, '2023-10-06 07:24:33', '2024-07-23 10:47:13', 0, 0),
(7, '', '', '2', 'demo', '<p>demo</p>\r\n', 1, 1, '2023-10-06 09:16:01', '2023-10-06 09:16:35', 0, 0),
(8, '', '', '1,15,21,26,116,311', 'Soil Engineering Lab', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span dir=\"rtl\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif\">The Soil Engineering Lab Provides the Ground base and <strong>up-skill the students</strong> for Testing of Soil and its <strong>Physical and Engineering Properties</strong> as per <strong>Bureau of Indian Standard.</strong> After that Students understand the conducting test procedures with full efficiency and ability</span></span></span></p>\r\n', 1, 0, '2023-10-07 07:58:17', '2025-12-09 08:52:31', 0, 0),
(9, '', '', '3,16,24,28', 'Electrical Machine Laboratory', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"background-color:white\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\"><span style=\"color:black\">The Laboratory is equipped with conventional and modern Electrical and Electronics measuring equipment, various AC and DC Electrical Machines and Transformers</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"background-color:white\"><span style=\"color:black\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\">Cut section of DC motor</span></span></span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"background-color:white\"><span style=\"color:black\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\">Cut section of AC induction motor</span></span></span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"background-color:white\"><span style=\"color:black\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\">Phase Sequence Indicator.</span></span></span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"background-color:white\"><span style=\"color:black\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\">D.C. generator</span></span></span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n', 1, 1, '2023-10-09 07:47:22', '2024-01-17 10:30:28', 0, 0),
(10, '', '', '3,16,24,28', 'Power Electronics Laboratory', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"background-color:white\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\"><span style=\"color:black\">This Laboratory is equipped with Single Phase and Three Phase AC to DC Converters, different types of DC-DC Choppers, Single Phase AC Voltage Controllers, Cyclo-converters, Single Phase and Three Phase Inverters.</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"background-color:white\"><span style=\"color:black\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\">Gate/Base driver circuit trainer</span></span></span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"background-color:white\"><span style=\"color:black\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\">rectifier trainer</span></span></span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"background-color:white\"><span style=\"color:black\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\">Servo motor drive</span></span></span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"background-color:white\"><span style=\"color:black\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\">Device Characteristics Trainer</span></span></span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"background-color:white\"><span style=\"color:black\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\">Step down &amp; Step up chopper trainer</span></span></span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n', 1, 1, '2023-10-09 07:48:33', '2024-03-09 05:48:58', 0, 0),
(11, '', '', '3,16,24,28', 'High Voltage Engineering Laboratory', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"background-color:white\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\"><span style=\"color:black\">The High Voltage Laboratory is equipped to perform full scale high voltage testing. The laboratory is therefore equipped with three AC transformers for 500 kV which can be arranged in cascade to make up to 1500 kV, and a 20 stage lightning impulse generator up to 4 MV and 200 kJ.</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"background-color:white\"><span style=\"color:black\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\">62.5mm Sphere gap Assembly,</span></span></span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"background-color:white\"><span style=\"color:black\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\">10kV Horn Gap Apparatus</span></span></span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"background-color:white\"><span style=\"color:black\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\">50kV HV Capacitance divider</span></span></span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"background-color:white\"><span style=\"color:black\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\">70kV HV Resistance divider</span></span></span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"background-color:white\"><span style=\"color:black\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\">Electrolytic Tank</span></span></span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n', 1, 1, '2023-10-09 07:49:37', '2024-03-09 05:54:56', 0, 0),
(12, '', '', '3,16,24,28', 'Switchgear &amp; Protection Laboratory', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"background-color:white\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\"><span style=\"color:black\">Switch gear is an integral part of an electric power system. Switchgear includes fuses, switches, relays, isolators, circuit breaker, potential and current transformer, indicating device, lightning arresters, etc. that protects electrical hardware from faulty conditions.</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"background-color:white\"><span style=\"color:black\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\">Radial feeder protection panel</span></span></span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"background-color:white\"><span style=\"color:black\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\">Micro controller based IMDT over current relay panel</span></span></span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"background-color:white\"><span style=\"color:black\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\">Different protection 3 phase transformer</span></span></span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n', 1, 1, '2023-10-09 07:50:31', '2024-03-09 10:53:52', 0, 0),
(13, '', '', '1,15,21,116,311', 'Environmental Engineering Lab', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif\"><big>The <span style=\"background-color:white\">Environmental Engineering Lab Studies provide the information about the Water Treatment Tests, Chemical and Bacteriological properties of water. Also provide the various test methods for drinking water sustainability. </span></big></span></span></p>\r\n', 1, 0, '2023-10-09 14:31:04', '2025-12-09 08:49:46', 0, 0),
(14, '', '', '1,15,21,311', 'Fluid Mechanics Lab', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif\"><big><span style=\"background-color:white\">Fluid Mechanics Lab Acknowledge the Students/Scholars to Understand the Behaviour of Fluids under different Condition of Atmosphere and Forces and Evaluate the different parameters of fluid in Open and Close Channels.</span></big></span></span></p>\r\n', 1, 0, '2023-10-09 14:45:10', '2025-12-09 08:53:07', 0, 0),
(15, '', '', '4,5,25', 'IoS Lab', '<p>An iOS lab typically refers to a hands-on environment where students, developers, or professionals can learn, experiment, and work on creating apps for iOS devices (like iPhones and iPads). It involves using tools like Xcode and Swift, focusing on practical exercises such as coding, debugging, and testing iOS applications. The lab may also cover aspects like UI/UX design, performance optimization, and app deployment on the App Store.</p>\r\n', 1, 0, '2023-10-13 09:04:28', '2025-03-27 08:18:13', 0, 0),
(16, '', '', '4,5,25,245,246,575', 'Web Development Lab', '<p>A web development lab is a specialized space where individuals can learn and practice building websites and web applications. It is equipped with computers, software tools, and resources for coding in languages like HTML, CSS, JavaScript, and frameworks such as React or Angular. The lab focuses on hands-on experience with web design, front-end and back-end development, debugging, and deployment.</p>\r\n', 1, 0, '2023-10-13 09:07:07', '2025-06-11 09:01:34', 0, 0),
(17, '', '', '4,5,232,246', 'Android Lab', '<p>The Android operating system is the world&rsquo;s most popular mobile platform. The objective of the lab is to develop interactive applications in smartphone with multiple activities including audio, video, and notifications. Android app development using Marvel App (Wireframing and Prototyping), Android Studio (development), Appium (testing), Jira &amp; Trello (issue tracking), play store management (deployment).</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Android</li>\r\n	<li>JAVA</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n', 1, 0, '2023-10-13 09:10:38', '2024-02-20 04:07:41', 0, 0),
(18, '', '', '4,5,25,232,233,245,246,575', 'Computer Lab', '<p>The computer laboratories across the campus comprise over six hundred computers for students and staff. The laboratories form an integral part of the curriculum, providing an environment where students reinforce their understanding of the fundamental principles of Computer Engineering and implement that knowledge in experimental analysis and problem-solving. The Computer Engineering department has state of the art laboratory facilities to furnish the needs of engineering students. Every course offered by the department includes laboratory experiments; as a result, every lab is equipped with a sufficient number of latest computer nodes to meet the requirement of a single computer per student.</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Database</li>\r\n	<li>CS / Network Lab</li>\r\n	<li>.Net / MS SQL Lab</li>\r\n	<li>Python Tools Lab</li>\r\n	<li>C / C++ / Java Lab</li>\r\n	<li>Data Structure Lab</li>\r\n	<li>PHP / MYSQL Lab</li>\r\n	<li>Digital Electronics Lab</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n', 1, 0, '2023-10-13 09:22:54', '2025-06-11 09:02:08', 0, 0),
(19, '', '', '119', 'test', '<p>test</p>\r\n', 1, 1, '2023-10-19 08:55:28', '2024-01-12 02:29:21', 0, 0),
(20, '', '', '90,133,134,135,186,195,196,226', 'IOS LAB', '<p>The purpose of this lab aims at providing students the knowledge about the Apple development in Operating System Environment. The iOS lab is privileged with the cutting edge infrastructure with Apple devices such as iMacs, Macbooks, Mac Mini, iPads &amp; iPhones. It is a space to collaborate with students to work with a diverse team on real-world problems and create apps to solve them.</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>IOS</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n', 1, 0, '2023-12-12 10:33:37', '2023-12-12 10:33:37', 0, 0),
(21, '', '', '89,90,133,134,135,186,195,196,226', 'WEB DEVELOPMENT LAB', '<p>PHP(short for Hypertext PreProcessor) is the most widely used open source and general purpose server side scripting language used mainly in web development to create dynamic websites and applications. A survey by W3Tech shows that almost 79% of the websites in their data are developed using PHP. So it is necessary to provide depth practical knowledge of PHP to the students.</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>PHP</li>\r\n	<li>HTML</li>\r\n	<li>CSS</li>\r\n	<li>JS</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n', 1, 1, '2023-12-12 10:36:29', '2023-12-12 10:40:44', 0, 0),
(22, '', '', '133', 'IOS LAB', '<p>The purpose of this lab aims at providing students the knowledge about the Apple development in Operating System Environment. The iOS lab is privileged with the cutting edge infrastructure with Apple devices such as iMacs, Macbooks, Mac Mini, iPads &amp; iPhones. It is a space to collaborate with students to work with a diverse team on real-world problems and create apps to solve them.</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>IOS</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n', 1, 0, '2023-12-12 10:43:10', '2023-12-12 10:43:10', 0, 0),
(23, '', '', '133', 'WEB DEVELOPMENT LAB', '<p>PHP(short for Hypertext PreProcessor) is the most widely used open source and general purpose server side scripting language used mainly in web development to create dynamic websites and applications. A survey by W3Tech shows that almost 79% of the websites in their data are developed using PHP. So it is necessary to provide depth practical knowledge of PHP to the students.</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>PHP</li>\r\n	<li>HTML</li>\r\n	<li>CSS</li>\r\n	<li>JS</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n', 1, 0, '2023-12-12 10:45:44', '2023-12-12 10:45:44', 0, 0),
(24, '', '', '133', 'ANDROID LAB', '<p>The Android operating system is the world&rsquo;s most popular mobile platform. The objective of the lab is to develop interactive applications in smartphone with multiple activities including audio, video, and notifications. Android app development using Marvel App (Wireframing and Prototyping), Android Studio (development), Appium (testing), Jira &amp; Trello (issue tracking), play store management (deployment).</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Android</li>\r\n	<li>JAVA</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n', 1, 0, '2023-12-12 10:46:51', '2023-12-12 10:46:51', 0, 0),
(25, '', '', '133', 'COMPUTER LAB', '<p>The computer laboratories across the campus comprise over six hundred computers for students and staff. The laboratories form an integral part of the curriculum, providing an environment where students reinforce their understanding of the fundamental principles of Computer Engineering and implement that knowledge in experimental analysis and problem-solving. The Computer Engineering department has state of the art laboratory facilities to furnish the needs of engineering students. Every course offered by the department includes laboratory experiments; as a result, every lab is equipped with a sufficient number of latest computer nodes to meet the requirement of a single computer per student.</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Database</li>\r\n	<li>CS / Network Lab</li>\r\n	<li>.Net / MS SQL Lab</li>\r\n	<li>Python Tools Lab</li>\r\n	<li>C / C++ / Java Lab</li>\r\n	<li>Data Structure Lab</li>\r\n	<li>PHP / MYSQL Lab</li>\r\n	<li>Digital Electronics Lab</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n', 1, 0, '2023-12-12 10:49:14', '2023-12-12 10:49:14', 0, 0),
