(123, '', '', '16', 'Power Electronics Laboratory', '<p>This Laboratory is equipped with Single Phase and Three Phase AC to DC Converters, different types of DC-DC Choppers, Single Phase AC Voltage Controllers, Cyclo-converters, Single Phase and Three Phase Inverters.</p>\r\n', 1, 0, '2024-12-19 11:45:36', '2025-11-19 17:27:24', 0, 0),
(124, '', '', '8,118', 'Fluid Flow Operations Lab', '<p>Chemical fluid flow operation labs are&nbsp;essential in chemical engineering programs for providing practical experience in understanding and applying fluid dynamics principles.&nbsp;These labs offer students the opportunity to conduct experiments using various equipment to study different aspects of fluid flow, including measurement of fluid properties, flow characteristics, and frictional losses.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Bernoulli&#39;s Theorem&nbsp;</li>\r\n	<li>Venturi Meter</li>\r\n	<li>Orifice Meter</li>\r\n	<li>Rotameter</li>\r\n	<li>Pressure Measurement devices&nbsp;</li>\r\n	<li>Centrifugal Pumps&nbsp;</li>\r\n	<li>Pipe Friction</li>\r\n	<li>Notches and weirs</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n', 1, 0, '2025-06-04 09:03:01', '2025-06-04 09:03:01', 0, 0),
(125, '', '', '8,118', 'Heat Transfer Operations Lab', '<p>A Heat Transfer Operations Lab is&nbsp;a practical educational space where students gain hands-on experience with heat transfer principles and their applications.&nbsp;It provides a platform for understanding the three modes of heat transfer &ndash; conduction, convection, and radiation &ndash; and their impact on various industrial processes.&nbsp;Through experiments, students learn about heat transfer in different scenarios</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Thermal Conductivity of Metal Rod</li>\r\n	<li>Thermal Conductivity of Composite Wall</li>\r\n	<li>Critical Radious of Insulating Material&nbsp;</li>\r\n	<li>Specifice Heat of Air</li>\r\n	<li>Heat Transfer Co-effcient of Agitated Vessel&nbsp;</li>\r\n	<li>Stephan Boltzmann&nbsp;</li>\r\n	<li>Film and Drop wise condensation&nbsp;</li>\r\n	<li>Heat Exchanger&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n', 1, 0, '2025-06-04 09:12:28', '2025-06-04 09:14:25', 0, 0),
(126, '', '', '8,118', 'Mass Transfer Operation Lab', '<p>A Mass Transfer Operations Lab&nbsp;focuses on understanding and applying the principles of mass transfer, which is the movement of mass from one location to another, often between different phases (like gas to liquid).&nbsp;These labs provide hands-on experience with equipment used in chemical engineering processes, such as distillation, absorption, extraction, and leaching.&nbsp;Students learn about various mass transfer operations and how they&#39;re used in industries for separation and purification of materials</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Diffusion rate (Liquid-Gas)</li>\r\n	<li>Diffusion Coeffcient (Liquid-Liquid)</li>\r\n	<li>Rate of Absorotion</li>\r\n	<li>Packed Column</li>\r\n	<li>Leaching&nbsp;</li>\r\n	<li>VLE Setup</li>\r\n	<li>Batch Distillation</li>\r\n	<li>Humidification and Dehumidification&nbsp;</li>\r\n	<li>Dryer&nbsp;</li>\r\n	<li>Ion Exchange</li>\r\n	<li>Crytllizer</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n', 1, 0, '2025-06-04 09:21:17', '2025-06-04 09:22:04', 0, 0),
(127, '', '', '8,118', 'Chemical Engineering Process Simulation Lab', '<p>A chemical engineering process lab is&nbsp;a dedicated space where students and researchers conduct experiments and studies related to chemical processes.&nbsp;These labs provide hands-on experience with equipment and techniques used in the design, operation, and optimization of chemical processes</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>DWSIM Process Simulator&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n', 1, 0, '2025-06-04 09:26:39', '2025-06-04 09:26:39', 0, 0),
(128, '', '', '8,118', 'Chemical Reaction Engineering Lab', '<p>A Chemical Reaction Engineering lab is&nbsp;a hands-on educational space where students learn about chemical kinetics, reactor operation, and the design of chemical processes.&nbsp;It provides practical experience complementing theoretical knowledge gained in the classroom.&nbsp;The lab allows students to explore the behavior of chemical reactions in various reactor types and conditions, such as batch, continuous stirred-tank, and plug flow reactors</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Isothermal CSTR</li>\r\n	<li>PFR</li>\r\n	<li>Reaction Kinetics&nbsp;</li>\r\n	<li>Batch Reactor&nbsp;</li>\r\n	<li>RTD of PFR</li>\r\n	<li>RTD of CSTR</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n', 1, 0, '2025-06-04 09:29:36', '2025-06-04 09:29:36', 0, 0),
(129, '', '', '8,118', 'Unit Operations Lab', '<p>A Mechanical Operations Lab, particularly in the field of Chemical Engineering, is&nbsp;a hands-on facility where students learn about and apply various mechanical processes used in industrial settings.&nbsp;These labs provide practical experience with equipment used for size reduction, separation, and filtration of solids, liquids, and gases</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Mechanical Sieves</li>\r\n	<li>Jaw Crusher&nbsp;</li>\r\n	<li>Ball Mill</li>\r\n	<li>Cyclone Separator</li>\r\n	<li>Magnetic Separator&nbsp;</li>\r\n	<li>Vacuum Leaf Filter</li>\r\n	<li>Froth Floatation Cell</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n', 1, 0, '2025-06-04 09:33:58', '2025-06-04 09:33:58', 0, 0),
(130, '', '', '8,118', 'Process Control and Instrumentation Lab', '<p>A Chemical Process Control and Instrumentation Lab is&nbsp;a specialized laboratory where students and researchers learn about and apply the principles of instrumentation and control in chemical processes.&nbsp;These labs focus on measuring and controlling process variables like temperature, pressure, flow, and level, ensuring efficient and safe operations.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Calibration of Pressure Gauges</li>\r\n	<li>Control Valve Characteristics</li>\r\n	<li>Characteristics Of P.I.D. Controller</li>\r\n	<li>MEASUREMENT OF LEVEL BY AIR PURGE METHOD</li>\r\n	<li>Time Constant of Thermocouple &amp; Thermometer</li>\r\n	<li>Time Constant of Manometer</li>\r\n	<li>Interacting &amp; Non Interacting System</li>\r\n	<li>Study Of P-I &amp; I-P Convertor</li>\r\n	<li>TEMPERATURE CONTROL TRAINER</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n', 1, 0, '2025-06-04 09:43:18', '2025-06-04 09:47:46', 0, 0),
(131, '', '', '3,16,24,28,212,213,239,244,252,256,259', 'Computer Lab', '<p>Computer Laboratory for Electrical and Electronics &amp; Communication Engineering is a modern, well-equipped facility that supports simulation, programming, and design activities. It provides students with practical exposure to tools like MATLAB, PSpice, LabVIEW, KEIL, Proteus, and Xilinx, enabling analysis and design of circuits, control systems, power electronics, signal processing, and communication systems.</p>\r\n', 1, 0, '2025-10-17 10:36:58', '2025-10-17 10:36:58', 0, 0),
(132, '', '', '562,563,565', 'IOS Lab', '<p>An IOS lab typically refers to a hands-on environment where students, developers, or professionals can learn, experiment, and work on creating apps for iOS devices (like iPhones and iPads). It involves using tools like Xcode and Swift, focusing on practical exercises such as coding, debugging, and testing iOS applications. The lab may also cover aspects like UI/UX design, performance optimization, and app deployment on the App Store.</p>\r\n', 1, 0, '2025-11-11 06:26:55', '2025-12-24 09:17:31', 0, 0),
(133, '', '', '233,562,565', 'Web Development Lab', '<p>A web development lab is a specialized space where individuals can learn and practice building websites and web applications. It is equipped with computers, software tools, and resources for coding in languages like HTML, CSS, JavaScript, and frameworks such as React or Angular. The lab focuses on hands-on experience with web design, front-end and back-end development, debugging, and deployment.</p>\r\n', 1, 0, '2025-11-11 06:28:23', '2025-12-24 09:18:17', 0, 0),
(134, '', '', '562,563,565', 'Computer Lab', '<p>The computer laboratories across the campus comprise over six hundred computers for students and staff. The laboratories form an integral part of the curriculum, providing an environment where students reinforce their understanding of the fundamental principles of Computer Engineering and implement that knowledge in experimental analysis and problem-solving. The Computer Engineering department has state of the art laboratory facilities to furnish the needs of engineering students. Every course offered by the department includes laboratory experiments; as a result, every lab is equipped with a sufficient number of latest computer nodes to meet the requirement of a single computer per student.</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Database</li>\r\n	<li>CS / Network Lab</li>\r\n	<li>.Net / MS SQL Lab</li>\r\n	<li>Python Tools Lab</li>\r\n	<li>C / C++ / Java Lab</li>\r\n	<li>Data Structure Lab</li>\r\n	<li>PHP / MYSQL Lab</li>\r\n	<li>Digital Electronics Lab</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n', 1, 0, '2025-11-11 06:29:51', '2025-12-24 09:17:51', 0, 0);
