(37, '', '', '51', '&lt;ul&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;The mission of the faculty of the GMIU, is given by the goals outlined below.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;To provide high quality instruction that develops in an integrative manner, conceptual understanding, analytical skills, and enthusiasm for learning and inquiry in the applied &amp;amp; pure sciences.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Teach fundamental principles and unifying concepts in the sciences, humanities &amp;amp; maths through a curriculum requiring exposure to multiple sub-disciplines of education.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Teach students to function as a scientist, through exposure to the scientific process used in hypothesis, experimentation, observation and analysis, including course work and teaching laboratories incorporating experimental or discovery-based approaches, as well as reading and analysis of scientific research literature.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;To provide an atmosphere of excellence that advances the GMIU&amp;nbsp;contribution to acquire knowledge for M.Sc. Students&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;', '&lt;ul&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;We believe that true excellence in education requires a commitment to equity and social justice Thus we strive to prepare&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Creative&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Culturally competent&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Critically reflective&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Graduates who possess deep knowledge in their field of study and work collaboratively to achieve high quality education for all.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;', 1, 0, '2024-02-17 06:40:56', '2024-01-11 11:44:26', NULL, NULL),
(38, '', '', '233,245', '&lt;ul&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;To provide skill based environment that helps students to improve problem solving skill.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;To provide spotlight to students to the recent tools and technologies in the area of computer hardware and software.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;To prepare students as per current industrial requirement through Institute-Industry Interaction (III).&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;To support research based projects and different activities in the rising areas of technology convergence.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;', '&lt;ul&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;We envision our students have skilled engineers not only in the field of science and technology, but also in every field to build strong and developed nation.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;', 1, 0, '2024-01-13 07:48:47', '2024-01-12 10:42:35', NULL, NULL),
(39, '', '', '208', '&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;The mission for the Department of Arts at Gyanmanjari Innovative University is to nurture artistic talents through a dynamic and inclusive educational environment. It aims to provide a platform that fosters creativity, innovation, and diverse artistic expressions, empowering students to become proficient and socially responsible person. The mission encompasses the integration of theoretical knowledge with practical skills, preparing students to excel in the global arts arena while upholding values of integrity, creativity, and cultural appreciation. Through dedicated faculty, state-of-the-art resources, and experiential learning opportunities, the Department of Arts at Gyanmanjari Innovative University endeavors to instill a passion for the arts and equip graduates with the tools to positively impact society through their artistic contributions&lt;/p&gt;', '&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;The envisioned prospect unfolds as a dedication to cultivating a nurturing milieu, one that incubates creativity, heralds innovation, and celebrates the kaleidoscope of artistic expressions. This overarching vision strives to endow students with a comprehensive education, intertwining theoretical knowledge with pragmatic skills, thereby molding them into global professionals adept at confronting contemporary challenges through artistic solutions. With a focal point on value-infused education, the department endeavors to forge artists of international acclaim who contribute constructively to society, embedding human values, innovation, and excellence into their artistic pursuits.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;Harnessing innovative pedagogical approaches and a curriculum centered on skills, the Department of Arts aspires to nurture students to their utmost potential. The aim is to equip them with the necessary tools and a mindset attuned to thriving in an ever-evolving artistic panorama.&lt;/p&gt;', 1, 0, '2024-01-15 05:53:29', '2024-01-15 05:42:32', NULL, NULL),
(40, '', '', '9', '&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif&quot;&gt;The Biotechnology Department&amp;#39;s mission is grounded in real-world applications and research. It strives to push the boundaries of scientific understanding and apply biotechnological innovations to practical challenges. The department is dedicated to developing tangible solutions in healthcare, agriculture, and environmental sustainability, with a commitment to making a positive impact on society. This involves conducting research, fostering collaborations, and translating scientific advancements into practical tools and technologies that address pressing issues contribute to real-world improvements, and&amp;nbsp;make scholarly professionals capable of taking real-world challenges through institute-industry initiatives.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;table border=&quot;1&quot; cellpadding=&quot;1&quot; cellspacing=&quot;1&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;width:500px&quot;&gt;\r\n	&lt;thead&gt;\r\n		&lt;tr&gt;\r\n			&lt;th scope=&quot;col&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Lucida Sans Unicode,Lucida Grande,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Mission of the Biotechnology Department&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/th&gt;\r\n		&lt;/tr&gt;\r\n	&lt;/thead&gt;\r\n	&lt;tbody&gt;\r\n		&lt;tr&gt;\r\n			&lt;td&gt;1. Advance Scientific Innovation&lt;/td&gt;\r\n		&lt;/tr&gt;\r\n		&lt;tr&gt;\r\n			&lt;td&gt;2. Develop Technological Solutions&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\r\n		&lt;/tr&gt;\r\n		&lt;tr&gt;\r\n			&lt;td&gt;3. Address Complex Challenges&lt;/td&gt;\r\n		&lt;/tr&gt;\r\n		&lt;tr&gt;\r\n			&lt;td&gt;4. Foster Breakthroughs in Healthcare, Agriculture, and Environment Sustainability&lt;/td&gt;\r\n		&lt;/tr&gt;\r\n		&lt;tr&gt;\r\n			&lt;td&gt;5. Benefit Society through Biotechnological Advancements&lt;/td&gt;\r\n		&lt;/tr&gt;\r\n	&lt;/tbody&gt;\r\n&lt;/table&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;', '&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif&quot;&gt;The vision of the Biotechnology Department is to be a pioneering force at the forefront of scientific discovery and technological application. It aspires to lead in the development of innovative solutions that transform healthcare, agriculture, and environmental sustainability. By fostering a dynamic research environment and cultivating interdisciplinary collaborations, the department aims to become a global hub for biotechnological excellence. Ultimately, the vision is to contribute significantly to societal well-being by translating groundbreaking research into practical solutions that address real-world challenges and drive positive change.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;table border=&quot;1&quot; cellpadding=&quot;1&quot; cellspacing=&quot;1&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;width:500px&quot;&gt;\r\n	&lt;tbody&gt;\r\n		&lt;tr&gt;\r\n			&lt;td style=&quot;text-align:center&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Lucida Sans Unicode,Lucida Grande,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vision of Biotechnology Department&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\r\n		&lt;/tr&gt;\r\n		&lt;tr&gt;\r\n			&lt;td&gt;1.&amp;nbsp;Be a Pioneering Force in Scientific Discovery and Technological Application in Gujarat Region&lt;/td&gt;\r\n		&lt;/tr&gt;\r\n		&lt;tr&gt;\r\n			&lt;td&gt;2. Lead in the development of innovative solutions in healthcare, agriculture, and environmental sustainability&lt;/td&gt;\r\n		&lt;/tr&gt;\r\n		&lt;tr&gt;\r\n			&lt;td&gt;3.&amp;nbsp;Foster a dynamic research environment and interdisciplinary collaborations&lt;/td&gt;\r\n		&lt;/tr&gt;\r\n		&lt;tr&gt;\r\n			&lt;td&gt;4.&amp;nbsp;Translate groundbreaking research into practical solutions for real-world impact&lt;/td&gt;\r\n		&lt;/tr&gt;\r\n		&lt;tr&gt;\r\n			&lt;td&gt;5. Become a Hub for Biotechnology on Saurashtra as well as Gujarat Region&lt;/td&gt;\r\n		&lt;/tr&gt;\r\n	&lt;/tbody&gt;\r\n&lt;/table&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;', 1, 0, '2024-01-24 07:03:21', '2024-01-24 07:03:21', NULL, NULL),
(41, '', '', '10', '&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif&quot;&gt;The Department of Food Technology&amp;#39;s Mission is to equip students with a comprehensive understanding of food science and technology, fostering a dynamic learning environment that combines theoretical knowledge with practical skills. The mission is to prepare graduates who can contribute to the food industry with innovative solutions, adhere to quality and safety standards, and address global food challenges.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;table border=&quot;1&quot; cellpadding=&quot;1&quot; cellspacing=&quot;1&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;width:500px&quot;&gt;\r\n	&lt;tbody&gt;\r\n		&lt;tr&gt;\r\n			&lt;td style=&quot;text-align:center&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Lucida Sans Unicode,Lucida Grande,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mission of Food Technology Department&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\r\n		&lt;/tr&gt;\r\n		&lt;tr&gt;\r\n			&lt;td&gt;1.&amp;nbsp;Equip students with food tech knowledge&lt;/td&gt;\r\n		&lt;/tr&gt;\r\n		&lt;tr&gt;\r\n			&lt;td&gt;2. Blend theory with practical skills&lt;/td&gt;\r\n		&lt;/tr&gt;\r\n		&lt;tr&gt;\r\n			&lt;td&gt;3. Prepare grads for the industry&amp;#39;s needs&lt;/td&gt;\r\n		&lt;/tr&gt;\r\n		&lt;tr&gt;\r\n			&lt;td&gt;4.&amp;nbsp;Focus on quality, safety, and innovation&lt;/td&gt;\r\n		&lt;/tr&gt;\r\n		&lt;tr&gt;\r\n			&lt;td&gt;5. Research especially emphasizes on Food Science.&lt;/td&gt;\r\n		&lt;/tr&gt;\r\n	&lt;/tbody&gt;\r\n&lt;/table&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;', '&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif&quot;&gt;To be a leading B.Tech program in Food Technology in the State of Gujarat, recognized for producing adept professionals who drive advancements in food processing, preservation, and safety. The vision is to empower students to become leaders in the field, contributing to sustainable food production, improving nutritional quality, and ensuring the safety and accessibility of food resources for the global population.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;table border=&quot;1&quot; cellpadding=&quot;1&quot; cellspacing=&quot;1&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;width:500px&quot;&gt;\r\n	&lt;tbody&gt;\r\n		&lt;tr&gt;\r\n			&lt;td style=&quot;text-align:center&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Lucida Sans Unicode,Lucida Grande,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Vision of Food Technology Department&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\r\n		&lt;/tr&gt;\r\n		&lt;tr&gt;\r\n			&lt;td&gt;1.&amp;nbsp;Drive innovation in food production&lt;/td&gt;\r\n		&lt;/tr&gt;\r\n		&lt;tr&gt;\r\n			&lt;td&gt;2.&amp;nbsp;Empower leaders for sustainable food&lt;/td&gt;\r\n		&lt;/tr&gt;\r\n		&lt;tr&gt;\r\n			&lt;td&gt;3. Enhance nutrition and global accessibility&lt;/td&gt;\r\n		&lt;/tr&gt;\r\n		&lt;tr&gt;\r\n			&lt;td&gt;4.&amp;nbsp;Foster a collaborative community of food tech experts&lt;/td&gt;\r\n		&lt;/tr&gt;\r\n		&lt;tr&gt;\r\n			&lt;td&gt;5.Empower grads&amp;nbsp;for sustainable food solutions&lt;/td&gt;\r\n		&lt;/tr&gt;\r\n	&lt;/tbody&gt;\r\n&lt;/table&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;', 1, 0, '2024-01-24 08:23:11', '2024-01-24 08:23:11', NULL, NULL),
(42, '', '', '74', '&lt;p&gt;The Department of English at Gyanmanjari University is dedicated to fostering a vibrant and intellectually stimulating academic environment that promotes a deep appreciation for the English language, literature, and critical thinking. Our mission is to empower students with the knowledge, skills, and cultural insights necessary to excel in diverse professional and academic pursuits.&lt;/p&gt;', '&lt;p&gt;Our vision at the Department of English is to be a globally recognized center of excellence, inspiring a profound love for language, literature, and critical inquiry. We aspire to cultivate a community of scholars, writers, and communicators who not only excel in their chosen fields but also contribute meaningfully to the cultural and intellectual enrichment of society&lt;/p&gt;', 1, 0, '2024-01-29 05:41:55', '2024-01-29 05:39:16', NULL, NULL),
(43, '', '', '82', '&lt;p&gt;The mission of our Master of Economics program is to cultivate skilled professionals with a strong grasp of economic principles and advanced analytical abilities. We prioritize academic excellence through a comprehensive curriculum, fostering specialization and expertise in diverse economic domains. Our commitment extends to promoting research, innovation, and a global perspective, emphasizing ethical decision-making and impactful policy analysis. We strive to develop effective communicators equipped for diverse audiences. Our ultimate goal is to graduate adaptable individuals committed to lifelong learning, ready to contribute meaningfully to academia, research, government, and the private sector, positively influencing economic decision-making on a global scale.&lt;/p&gt;', '&lt;p&gt;A Master of Economics program provides students with a strong foundation in microeconomics and macroeconomics, emphasizing quantitative and analytical skills. Specialization options include international economics or financial economics, and the program encourages the application of economic models to real-world issues. Students undertake research projects, developing expertise and contributing to academic discourse. The program also focuses on policy analysis, global perspectives, and ethical considerations. Graduates are equipped with effective communication skills and a commitment to lifelong learning. The vision is to produce adaptable professionals who make informed contributions to the dynamic economic landscape in academia, research, government, or the private sector.&lt;/p&gt;', 1, 0, '2024-01-29 05:52:02', '2024-01-29 05:52:02', NULL, NULL),
(44, '', '', '78', '&lt;p&gt;The mission of the MA Program in English Literature at Gyanmanjari University is to cultivate a community of advanced scholars and critical thinkers who engage deeply with the diverse and dynamic landscape of English literature. Through rigorous academic inquiry, research, and interdisciplinary exploration, we aim to empower our students with the knowledge, skills, and ethical perspectives necessary to contribute meaningfully to the ongoing evolution of literary scholarship. Our commitment is to foster a supportive and intellectually stimulating environment that nurtures a lifelong passion for literature and prepares graduates for leadership roles in academia, research, and related professional fields.&lt;/p&gt;', '&lt;p&gt;The vision of the MA Program in English Literature is to be a globally recognized hub of excellence in advanced literary studies. We aspire to produce graduates who not only demonstrate a profound understanding of literary traditions but also engage critically with emerging trends, theoretical perspectives, and interdisciplinary connections. Through a commitment to diversity, inclusivity, and ethical scholarship, we envision our graduates as transformative leaders, contributing innovative insights to the field and addressing societal challenges. Our program seeks to inspire a deep-seated love for literature, instill a global perspective, and empower individuals to make lasting contributions to the cultural and intellectual tapestry of the world.&lt;/p&gt;', 1, 0, '2024-01-29 09:35:23', '2024-01-29 09:35:23', NULL, NULL),
(45, '', '', '76,80', '&lt;p&gt;The mission of the Sociology Department at Gyanmanjari University is to provide a dynamic and inclusive educational environment that equips undergraduate students with a comprehensive understanding of sociological theories, research methods, and critical perspectives. We are committed to fostering intellectual curiosity, critical thinking, and a sociological imagination, empowering our graduates to analyze and address social issues, contribute to community well-being, and engage thoughtfully in a diverse and interconnected world.&lt;/p&gt;', '&lt;p&gt;The vision of the Sociology Department is to be a transformative force in shaping socially conscious individuals who understand, analyze, and contribute positively to the complex dynamics of societies. We aspire to produce graduates who embody a commitment to social justice, diversity, and ethical inquiry, preparing them to navigate the challenges of a rapidly changing global landscape and inspiring them to become agents of positive social change.&lt;/p&gt;', 1, 0, '2024-01-29 09:39:01', '2024-01-29 09:37:35', NULL, NULL),
(46, '', '', '75,81', '&lt;p&gt;The mission of the Psychology Department at Gyanmanjari University is to provide a comprehensive and dynamic education in psychology, encompassing both the BA and MA programs. We are dedicated to equipping students with a solid foundation in psychological theories, research methods, and practical skills, fostering critical thinking and ethical reasoning. Our goal is to inspire a passion for understanding human behavior, promoting diversity and inclusivity, and preparing graduates to contribute meaningfully to various professional, academic, and research domains.&lt;/p&gt;', '&lt;p&gt;The vision of the Psychology Department is to be a nurturing and innovative academic community that produces graduates with a deep understanding of psychological principles. We aspire to empower students, both at the undergraduate and graduate levels, to apply their knowledge in diverse contexts, whether in mental health, research, counseling, or related fields. Our graduates will be compassionate and ethical individuals who contribute positively to society, recognizing the importance of psychological insights in addressing complex human challenges.&lt;/p&gt;', 1, 0, '2024-01-29 09:40:59', '2024-01-29 09:40:59', NULL, NULL),
(47, '', '', '220,223', '&lt;p&gt;The mission of the Department of Gujarati at Gyanmanjari University is to cultivate a rich and comprehensive understanding of Gujarati language, literature, and culture. Through our programs, we aim to provide students with a strong foundation in Gujarati language proficiency, literary analysis, and cultural appreciation. We are committed to fostering a sense of pride in the linguistic and cultural heritage of Gujarat, preparing graduates to contribute actively to the preservation, promotion, and advancement of Gujarati literature and culture.&lt;/p&gt;', '&lt;p&gt;The vision of the Department of Gujarati is to be a dynamic hub for the exploration, preservation, and celebration of the Gujarati language and culture. We aspire to produce graduates who are not only proficient in the Gujarati language but also possess a deep appreciation for its rich literary traditions and cultural nuances. Through a combination of rigorous academic study, creative expression, and community engagement, our graduates will become ambassadors for the vitality and significance of Gujarati language and culture, both within Gujarat and on the global stage.&lt;/p&gt;', 1, 0, '2024-01-29 09:42:53', '2024-01-29 09:42:53', NULL, NULL),
(48, '', '', '221,224', '&lt;p&gt;The mission of the Department of History at Gyanmanjari University is to impart a comprehensive understanding of historical events, cultures, and societies through our BA and MA programs. We are committed to providing students with a rigorous education in historical methodologies, critical analysis, and the development of historical perspectives. Our aim is to foster a deep appreciation for the complexities of the past, encouraging graduates to engage thoughtfully with historical narratives and contribute to the broader understanding of human history.&lt;/p&gt;', '&lt;p&gt;The vision of the Department of History is to be a vibrant academic community that promotes a profound exploration of the past. We aspire to produce graduates who are not only well-versed in historical knowledge but also possess the analytical skills and critical thinking abilities to interpret and contextualize historical events. Through innovative research, interdisciplinary collaboration, and a commitment to inclusivity, our graduates will become agents of historical inquiry, contributing to a nuanced and global understanding of the complexities that have shaped human societies throughout time.&lt;/p&gt;', 1, 0, '2024-01-29 09:44:05', '2024-01-29 09:44:05', NULL, NULL),
(49, '', '', '73,83', '&lt;p&gt;The mission of the Department of Political Science at Gyanmanjari University is to provide a comprehensive and dynamic education in political science through our BA and MA programs. We are dedicated to equipping students with a profound understanding of political systems, theories, and processes. Our goal is to foster critical thinking, ethical reasoning, and a commitment to civic engagement. Through rigorous academic inquiry and practical experiences, we prepare graduates to analyze political phenomena, contribute to informed public discourse, and actively participate in shaping the future of political landscapes.&lt;/p&gt;', '&lt;p&gt;The vision of the Department of Political Science is to be a leading academic center that produces graduates with a deep understanding of political dynamics. We aspire to empower students, both at the undergraduate and graduate levels, to engage thoughtfully with political theories, institutions, and global issues. Our graduates will be well-equipped to navigate the complexities of governance, international relations, and social justice, contributing to informed decision-making and positive societal change. Through a commitment to diversity, inclusivity, and ethical leadership, our graduates will emerge as active and responsible citizens, influencing political discourse and shaping the trajectory of political systems.&lt;/p&gt;', 1, 0, '2024-01-29 09:47:42', '2024-01-29 09:47:42', NULL, NULL),
(50, '', '', '79,192', '&lt;p&gt;The mission of the Department of Mass Communication and Journalism at Gyanmanjari University is to provide a dynamic and comprehensive education that prepares students for the ever-evolving landscape of media and communication. Through our BA and MA programs, we aim to equip students with theoretical knowledge, practical skills, and ethical principles essential for success in the diverse fields of mass communication and journalism. Our commitment is to foster creativity, critical thinking, and effective communication, preparing graduates to navigate the complexities of the media industry and contribute responsibly to public discourse.&lt;/p&gt;', '&lt;p&gt;The vision of the Department of Mass Communication and Journalism is to be a pioneering hub for innovative and ethical media education. We aspire to produce graduates who are not only proficient in media technologies and communication strategies but also possess a deep understanding of the societal impact of media. Through experiential learning, research, and industry collaboration, our graduates will emerge as media professionals, storytellers, and communicators who shape the narrative landscape, contribute to informed public discourse, and uphold the principles of journalistic integrity.&lt;/p&gt;', 1, 0, '2024-01-29 09:58:38', '2024-01-29 09:58:38', NULL, NULL),
(51, '', '', '84,193', '&lt;p&gt;The mission of the Department of Public Administration at Gyanmanjari University is to provide a comprehensive education in public administration through our programs. We are dedicated to equipping students with the knowledge, skills, and ethical principles necessary for effective governance and public service. Our goal is to foster critical thinking, strategic management, and a commitment to social responsibility. Through a combination of academic rigor and practical experiences, we prepare graduates to navigate the complexities of public administration, contribute to organizational effectiveness, and address the evolving challenges of public service.&lt;/p&gt;', '&lt;p&gt;The vision of the Department of Public Administration is to be a leading academic center that produces graduates with a deep understanding of public administration principles and practices. We aspire to empower students, both at the undergraduate and graduate levels, to engage thoughtfully with the complexities of public service, policy analysis, and organizational leadership. Our graduates will be well-equipped to contribute to the development and implementation of effective public policies, foster ethical governance, and lead initiatives that positively impact communities. Through a commitment to inclusivity, innovation, and ethical leadership, our graduates will emerge as dedicated public servants, influencing positive change in governmental and non-governmental sectors.&lt;/p&gt;', 1, 0, '2024-01-29 10:00:05', '2024-01-29 10:00:05', NULL, NULL),
(52, '', '', '222,225', '&lt;p&gt;The mission of the Department of Archaeology at Gyanmanjari University is to provide a comprehensive and dynamic education in archaeology through our BA and MA programs. We are committed to cultivating a deep understanding of human history and cultural heritage through the systematic study of material remains. Our goal is to equip students with theoretical knowledge, methodological skills, and ethical principles essential for excavating, interpreting, and preserving the material traces of past civilizations. Through rigorous academic inquiry, fieldwork, and interdisciplinary collaboration, we prepare graduates to contribute to the ongoing exploration of human history and cultural evolution.&lt;/p&gt;', '&lt;p&gt;The vision of the Department of Archaeology is to be a renowned center of excellence in archaeological studies, producing graduates with a profound understanding of the methods and significance of archaeological research. We aspire to empower students, both at the undergraduate and graduate levels, to engage with the tangible and intangible aspects of cultural heritage, fostering a sense of stewardship for the preservation of our shared past. Our graduates will be well-equipped to conduct meaningful research, contribute to archaeological knowledge, and address the ethical challenges associated with the excavation and interpretation of cultural artifacts. Through a commitment to interdisciplinary approaches and a global perspective, our graduates will emerge as stewards of cultural heritage, influencing the appreciation and understanding of the diverse narratives that have shaped human civilizations.&lt;/p&gt;', 1, 0, '2024-01-29 10:01:19', '2024-01-29 10:01:19', NULL, NULL),
(53, '', '', '141', '&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;The mission of the PGDMLT Students, is given by the goals outlined below.&lt;br /&gt;\r\nTo provide high quality instruction that develops in an integrative manner, conceptual understanding, analytical skills, and enthusiasm for learning and inquiry in the applied &amp;amp; pure sciences.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;The preliminary objective is to invoke critical thinking and a sense of responsibility in students to serve in the healthcare sector.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br /&gt;\r\nTeach fundamental principles and unifying concepts in the disease diagnosis, critical analysis and medical laboratory management through a curriculum requiring exposure to multiple sub-disciplines of education.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br /&gt;\r\nMedical Laboratory Technology is the Fulcrum of Medical Science. The Programme has been designed to train fresh science graduates in the routine and modern diagnostic techniques in Medical Laboratory Technology. Students enrolled in the programme will be equipped to work in Ultra Modern Pathological Laboratories as well as in Conventional laboratories as Para Medicals.&lt;br /&gt;\r\nTo provide an atmosphere of excellence that advances the GMSC contribution to acquire knowledge for PGDMLT Students.&lt;/p&gt;', '&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;As a PG DMLT student at Gyanmajari University, you are embarking on a journey that positions you at the forefront of healthcare innovation. GMIU will polish the students&amp;nbsp;students to diagnose and manage these issues.&amp;nbsp;Students will acquire skill in basic medical laboratory skills, offering in-depth training in disease diagnosis, health analysis, and medical laboratory management.&amp;nbsp;GMIU emphasizes not just academic knowledge, but also practical skills, professional development, and co-curricular activities to prepare well-rounded graduates.&lt;/p&gt;', 1, 0, '2024-02-04 01:14:07', '2024-02-04 01:14:07', NULL, NULL),
(54, '', '', '200,201,228,278', '&lt;ul&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;The mission of the faculty of the GMSC, is given by the goals outlined below.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;To provide high quality instruction that develops in an integrative manner, conceptual understanding, analytical skills, and enthusiasm for learning and inquiry in the applied &amp;amp; pure sciences.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Teach fundamental principles and unifying concepts in the sciences, humanities &amp;amp; maths through a curriculum requiring exposure to multiple sub-disciplines of education.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Teach students to function as a scientist, through exposure to the scientific process used in hypothesis, experimentation, observation and analysis, including course work and teaching laboratories incorporating experimental or discovery-based approaches, as well as reading and analysis of scientific research literature.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;To provide an atmosphere of excellence that advances the GMSC contribution to acquire knowledge for B.Sc. Students&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;', '&lt;ul&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;We believe that true excellence in education requires a commitment to equity and social justice Thus we strive to prepare&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Creative&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Culturally competent&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Critically reflective&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Graduates who possess deep knowledge in their field of study and work collaboratively to achieve high quality education for all.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;', 1, 0, '2024-02-15 09:33:08', '2024-02-15 09:33:08', NULL, NULL),
(55, '', '', '226', '&lt;ul&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;To provide skill based environment that helps students to improve problem solving skill.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;To provide spotlight to students to the recent tools and technologies in the area of computer hardware and software.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;To prepare students as per current industrial requirement through Institute-Industry Interaction (III).&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;To support research based projects and different activities in the rising areas of technology convergence.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;', '&lt;ul&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;We envision our students have skilled engineers not only in the field of science and technology, but also in every field to build strong and developed nation.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;', 1, 0, '2024-02-17 06:40:31', '2024-02-17 06:40:31', NULL, NULL),
