(69, '', '', '68', '&lt;p&gt;The Mission of the Gyanmanjari Institute of Management Studies (GIMS) at Gyanmanjari Innovative University (GMIU) aims to empower management students with skills for&amp;nbsp;effective leadership and resource management. The mission is to nurture competent and ethical leaders capable of strategic thinking and informed decision-making. Courses focus on instilling adaptability and communication skills, preparing students for diverse industry roles. The ultimate goal is to empower individuals to drive innovation, enhance productivity, and contribute responsibly to organizational success.&lt;/p&gt;', '&lt;p&gt;The Vision of Gyanmanjari Institute of Management Studies (GIMS) at Gyanmanjari Innovative University (GMIU) is to equip Management students with the skills and knowledge needed to effectively lead and oversee organizations. They cover areas such as leadership, strategic planning, decision-making, and teamwork, fostering well- rounded professionals who can drive success in diverse industries. These courses prepare students for dynamic and challenging roles in today&amp;#39;s business world.&lt;/p&gt;', 1, 0, '2024-03-09 08:26:46', '2024-03-09 08:26:46', NULL, NULL),
(70, '', '', '70', '&lt;p&gt;The Mission of the Gyanmanjari Institute of Management Studies (GIMS) at Gyanmanjari Innovative University (GMIU) aims to empower management students with skills for&amp;nbsp;effective leadership and resource management. The mission is to nurture competent and ethical leaders capable of strategic thinking and informed decision-making. Courses focus on instilling adaptability and communication skills, preparing students for diverse industry roles. The ultimate goal is to empower individuals to drive innovation, enhance productivity, and contribute responsibly to organizational success.&lt;/p&gt;', '&lt;p&gt;The Vision of Gyanmanjari Institute of Management Studies (GIMS) at Gyanmanjari Innovative University (GMIU) is to equip Management students with the skills and knowledge needed to effectively lead and oversee organizations. They cover areas such as leadership, strategic planning, decision-making, and teamwork, fostering well- rounded professionals who can drive success in diverse industries. These courses prepare students for dynamic and challenging roles in today&amp;#39;s business world.&lt;/p&gt;', 1, 0, '2024-03-09 08:29:19', '2024-03-09 08:29:19', NULL, NULL),
(71, '', '', '54', '&lt;p&gt;The B.Com (Hons) programme in Banking &amp;amp; Insurance at Gyanmanjari Innovative University aims to provide students a thorough grasp of the ideas, principles, and practises of finance and accounting in the corporate world. The curriculum is designed to provide students the information and abilities they need to seek lucrative jobs in accounting and finance and to advance the financial sector as a whole.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;The following are the program&amp;#39;s particular goals:&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;br /&gt;\r\nAcademic Excellence: The course offers a demanding curriculum that includes both theoretical ideas and real-world applications in finance and accounting in an effort to provide high-quality education. The goal is to improve the students&amp;#39; analytical, decision-making, and problem-solving abilities.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;Professional Competence: Through the teaching of information and abilities pertinent to the finance and accounting fields, the programme seeks to enhance students&amp;#39; professional competence. Financial analysis, investment management, risk analysis, financial reporting, auditing, taxes, and other significant topics will be covered in class.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;Ethical Values: Gyanmanjari Innovative University places a strong emphasis on the value of ethics in the fields of accounting and finance. The curriculum seeks to inculcate in pupils a strong sense of professional ethics and integrity, enabling them to make moral judgements in their future jobs.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;contact with Industry: By hosting guest lectures, workshops, seminars, and internships, the institution promotes industry contact. These encounters provide students hands-on experience with real-world accounting and financial practises and aid in their better comprehension of market trends and needs.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;Gyanmanjari Innovative University understands the significance of holistic development. The programme emphasises developing students&amp;#39; communication, critical thinking, leadership, and collaboration abilities in addition to their technical knowledge so they may succeed in a variety of professional settings.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;The university encourages research and innovation in the fields of accounting and finance. Students are encouraged to conduct research projects, take part in academic contests, and enhance knowledge in their specific fields.&lt;/p&gt;', '&lt;p&gt;The vision of Gyanmanjari Innovative University&amp;#39;s B.Com (Hons) programme in Finance &amp;amp; Accounting is to provide a dynamic learning environment that equips students to succeed as professionals in the finance and accounting industries. In order to prepare students for successful employment in the financial, banking, auditing, and allied areas, our programme strives to foster a thorough grasp of financial management, investment techniques, and accounting concepts.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;Our programme aims to provide students with the information, skills, and ethical principles required to succeed in a fast changing financial environment via a mix of demanding academic coursework and real-world experience learning. We want students to have a thorough grasp of financial theories, analytical methods, and regulatory frameworks so they can make wise judgements and help organisations thrive and endure.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;Our faculty, which is made up of seasoned teachers and business experts, is committed to provide high-quality instruction that places an emphasis on creativity, problem-solving, and critical thinking. In order to improve students&amp;#39; analytical and decision-making skills, we encourage an interdisciplinary approach to learning that incorporates technology and real-world case studies.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;Beyond technical proficiency, we understand the need of honing crucial soft skills like leadership, collaboration, and communication. In order to support holistic development and improve their employability, our programme encourages students to take part in extracurricular activities, industrial internships, and networking events.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;Our B.Com (Hons) programme in Finance &amp;amp; Accounting has the vision of being a transformational educational experience that prepares graduates to be professionals who can adapt to changing market conditions and make significant contributions to the financial industry. Our goal is to create morally upright and socially conscious financial professionals who respect the highest standards of ethics.&lt;/p&gt;', 1, 0, '2024-03-12 08:30:50', '2024-03-12 08:30:50', NULL, NULL),
(72, '', '', '240', '&lt;p&gt;The Mission of the Gyanmanjari Institute of Management Studies (GIMS) at Gyanmanjari Innovative University (GMIU) aims to empower management students with skills for&amp;nbsp;effective leadership and resource management. The mission is to nurture competent and ethical leaders capable of strategic thinking and informed decision-making. Courses focus on instilling adaptability and communication skills, preparing students for diverse industry roles. The ultimate goal is to empower individuals to drive innovation, enhance productivity, and contribute responsibly to organizational success.&lt;/p&gt;', '&lt;p&gt;The Vision of Gyanmanjari Institute of Management Studies (GIMS) at Gyanmanjari Innovative University (GMIU) is to equip Management students with the skills and knowledge needed to effectively lead and oversee organizations. They cover areas such as leadership, strategic planning, decision-making, and teamwork, fostering well- rounded professionals who can drive success in diverse industries. These courses prepare students for dynamic and challenging roles in today&amp;#39;s business world.&lt;/p&gt;', 1, 0, '2024-03-15 03:01:14', '2024-03-15 03:01:14', NULL, NULL),
(73, '', '', '55', '&lt;p&gt;&lt;br /&gt;\r\nOur mission for the Bachelor of Commerce (B.Com) program is rooted in the belief that education is the key to empowering individuals to thrive in the dynamic and competitive world of business. Through a comprehensive curriculum, innovative teaching methods, and a commitment to excellence, we aim to equip our students with the knowledge, skills, and ethical values necessary to become successful and socially responsible business leaders.&lt;br /&gt;\r\nCore Values:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nExcellence: We strive for academic and professional excellence in all aspects of our program, fostering a culture of continuous improvement and innovation.&lt;br /&gt;\r\nIntegrity: We uphold the highest ethical standards, promoting honesty, fairness, and accountability in our academic and professional endeavors.&lt;br /&gt;\r\nCollaboration: We foster a collaborative and inclusive learning environment, where students, faculty, and industry partners work together to achieve common goals.&lt;br /&gt;\r\nSustainability: We promote sustainable practices and responsible stewardship of resources, recognizing the interconnectedness between business success and environmental and social well-being.&lt;br /&gt;\r\nEducational Objectives:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nDevelop a Strong Foundation in Business Principles: Our program aims to provide students with a solid understanding of core business disciplines such as accounting, finance, marketing, management, and economics.&lt;br /&gt;\r\nFoster Critical Thinking and Analytical Skills: We seek to cultivate students&amp;#39; ability to think critically, analyze complex problems, and make informed decisions based on evidence and logical reasoning.&lt;br /&gt;\r\nEncourage Creativity and Innovation: We encourage students to think creatively, explore new ideas, and develop innovative solutions to real-world business challenges.&lt;br /&gt;\r\nApproach:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nComprehensive Curriculum: Our curriculum is designed to provide a balanced blend of theoretical knowledge and practical skills, with a focus on real-world applications and experiential learning opportunities.&lt;br /&gt;\r\nEngaging Teaching Methods: We employ a variety of teaching methods, including lectures, case studies, simulations, group projects, and guest lectures by industry experts, to cater to diverse learning styles and interests.&lt;br /&gt;\r\nIndustry Partnerships: We collaborate closely with leading companies, industry associations, and alumni networks to provide students with valuable networking opportunities, internships, and practical insights into the business world.&lt;br /&gt;\r\nPersonalized Support: We offer personalized academic advising, career counseling, and mentorship programs to support students in their academic and professional development journey.&lt;/p&gt;', '&lt;p&gt;Our vision for the Bachelor of Commerce (B.Com) program is centered on creating a transformative educational experience that prepares students to excel as dynamic and ethical leaders in the global business landscape. Grounded in innovation, excellence, and social responsibility, our vision guides us in shaping future generations of business professionals who are equipped to address the complex challenges and opportunities of the 21st century.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;Vision Statement:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nTo be recognized as a leading hub of excellence in business education, inspiring and empowering students to become catalysts for positive change in the world of commerce.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;Core Principles:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nInnovation: We strive to foster a culture of innovation that encourages creativity, entrepreneurship, and adaptive thinking. By embracing emerging trends and technologies, we empower students to drive innovation and lead transformative change in their respective fields.&lt;br /&gt;\r\nExcellence: We are committed to upholding the highest standards of academic rigor, teaching quality, and student support services. Through continuous improvement and a relentless pursuit of excellence, we aim to ensure that our graduates are exceptionally well-prepared to succeed in a competitive global marketplace.&lt;br /&gt;\r\nEthical Leadership: We believe in the importance of cultivating ethical leadership qualities, integrity, and social responsibility in our students. Our program emphasizes the ethical dimensions of decision-making and encourages students to prioritize values such as honesty, fairness, and respect for diversity in their professional endeavors.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;Strategic Initiatives:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nCurriculum Innovation: We continuously evolve our curriculum to reflect emerging trends, industry best practices, and the evolving needs of the business community. Our interdisciplinary approach integrates core business disciplines with emerging fields such as sustainability, data analytics, and digital transformation.&lt;br /&gt;\r\nExperiential Learning: We provide students with hands-on learning experiences, internships, and industry projects that bridge the gap between theory and practice. These opportunities allow students to apply their knowledge in real-world settings, develop practical skills, and build professional networks.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;Industry Partnerships: We cultivate strong partnerships with leading companies, industry associations, and alumni networks to provide students with access to mentorship, internships, and career opportunities. These collaborations ensure that our curriculum remains relevant and responsive to the needs of the business community.&lt;br /&gt;\r\nStudent Support Services: We prioritize the holistic development and well-being of our students by offering comprehensive support services, including academic advising, career counseling, mental health resources, and extracurricular activities. Our goal is to create a supportive learning environment where every student can thrive academically, professionally, and personally.&lt;/p&gt;', 1, 1, '2024-03-15 03:19:21', '2024-03-15 03:05:12', NULL, NULL),
(74, '', '', '55', '&lt;p&gt;&lt;br /&gt;\r\nThe B.Com (Hons) programme in Finance &amp;amp; Accounting at Gyanmanjari Innovative University aims to provide students a thorough grasp of the ideas, principles, and practises of finance and accounting in the corporate world. The curriculum is designed to provide students the information and abilities they need to seek lucrative jobs in accounting and finance and to advance the financial sector as a whole.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;The following are the program&amp;#39;s particular goals:&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;Academic Excellence: The course offers a demanding curriculum that includes both theoretical ideas and real-world applications in finance and accounting in an effort to provide high-quality education. The goal is to improve the students&amp;#39; analytical, decision-making, and problem-solving abilities.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;Professional Competence: Through the teaching of information and abilities pertinent to the finance and accounting fields, the programme seeks to enhance students&amp;#39; professional competence. Financial analysis, investment management, risk analysis, financial reporting, auditing, taxes, and other significant topics will be covered in class.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;Ethical Values: Gyanmanjari Innovative University places a strong emphasis on the value of ethics in the fields of accounting and finance. The curriculum seeks to inculcate in pupils a strong sense of professional ethics and integrity, enabling them to make moral judgements in their future jobs.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;contact with Industry: By hosting guest lectures, workshops, seminars, and internships, the institution promotes industry contact. These encounters provide students hands-on experience with real-world accounting and financial practises and aid in their better comprehension of market trends and needs.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;Gyanmanjari Innovative University understands the significance of holistic development. The programme emphasises developing students&amp;#39; communication, critical thinking, leadership, and collaboration abilities in addition to their technical knowledge so they may succeed in a variety of professional settings.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;The university encourages research and innovation in the fields of accounting and finance. Students are encouraged to conduct research projects, take part in academic contests, and enhance knowledge in their specific fields&lt;/p&gt;', '&lt;p&gt;&lt;br /&gt;\r\nThe vision of Gyanmanjari Innovative University&amp;#39;s B.Com (Hons) programme in Finance &amp;amp; Accounting is to provide a dynamic learning environment that equips students to succeed as professionals in the finance and accounting industries. In order to prepare students for successful employment in the financial, banking, auditing, and allied areas, our programme strives to foster a thorough grasp of financial management, investment techniques, and accounting concepts.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;Our programme aims to provide students with the information, skills, and ethical principles required to succeed in a fast changing financial environment via a mix of demanding academic coursework and real-world experience learning. We want students to have a thorough grasp of financial theories, analytical methods, and regulatory frameworks so they can make wise judgements and help organisations thrive and endure.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;Our faculty, which is made up of seasoned teachers and business experts, is committed to provide high-quality instruction that places an emphasis on creativity, problem-solving, and critical thinking. In order to improve students&amp;#39; analytical and decision-making skills, we encourage an interdisciplinary approach to learning that incorporates technology and real-world case studies.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;Beyond technical proficiency, we understand the need of honing crucial soft skills like leadership, collaboration, and communication. In order to support holistic development and improve their employability, our programme encourages students to take part in extracurricular activities, industrial internships, and networking events.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;Our B.Com (Hons) programme in Finance &amp;amp; Accounting has the vision of being a transformational educational experience that prepares graduates to be professionals who can adapt to changing market conditions and make significant contributions to the financial industry. Our goal is to create morally upright and socially conscious financial professionals who respect the highest standards of ethics.&lt;/p&gt;', 1, 0, '2024-03-15 03:15:25', '2024-03-15 03:15:25', NULL, NULL),
(75, '', '', '126', '&lt;p&gt;The B.Com (Hons) programme in Finance &amp;amp; Accounting at Gyanmanjari Innovative University aims to provide students a thorough grasp of the ideas, principles, and practises of finance and accounting in the corporate world. The curriculum is designed to provide students the information and abilities they need to seek lucrative jobs in accounting and finance and to advance the financial sector as a whole.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;The following are the program&amp;#39;s particular goals:&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;Academic Excellence: The course offers a demanding curriculum that includes both theoretical ideas and real-world applications in finance and accounting in an effort to provide high-quality education. The goal is to improve the students&amp;#39; analytical, decision-making, and problem-solving abilities.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;Professional Competence: Through the teaching of information and abilities pertinent to the finance and accounting fields, the programme seeks to enhance students&amp;#39; professional competence. Financial analysis, investment management, risk analysis, financial reporting, auditing, taxes, and other significant topics will be covered in class.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;Ethical Values: Gyanmanjari Innovative University places a strong emphasis on the value of ethics in the fields of accounting and finance. The curriculum seeks to inculcate in pupils a strong sense of professional ethics and integrity, enabling them to make moral judgements in their future jobs.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;contact with Industry: By hosting guest lectures, workshops, seminars, and internships, the institution promotes industry contact. These encounters provide students hands-on experience with real-world accounting and financial practises and aid in their better comprehension of market trends and needs.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;Gyanmanjari Innovative University understands the significance of holistic development. The programme emphasises developing students&amp;#39; communication, critical thinking, leadership, and collaboration abilities in addition to their technical knowledge so they may succeed in a variety of professional settings.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;The university encourages research and innovation in the fields of accounting and finance. Students are encouraged to conduct research projects, take part in academic contests, and enhance knowledge in their specific fields.&lt;/p&gt;', '&lt;p&gt;&lt;br /&gt;\r\nThe vision of Gyanmanjari Innovative University&amp;#39;s B.Com (Hons) programme in Finance &amp;amp; Accounting is to provide a dynamic learning environment that equips students to succeed as professionals in the finance and accounting industries. In order to prepare students for successful employment in the financial, banking, auditing, and allied areas, our programme strives to foster a thorough grasp of financial management, investment techniques, and accounting concepts.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;Our programme aims to provide students with the information, skills, and ethical principles required to succeed in a fast changing financial environment via a mix of demanding academic coursework and real-world experience learning. We want students to have a thorough grasp of financial theories, analytical methods, and regulatory frameworks so they can make wise judgements and help organisations thrive and endure.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;Our faculty, which is made up of seasoned teachers and business experts, is committed to provide high-quality instruction that places an emphasis on creativity, problem-solving, and critical thinking. In order to improve students&amp;#39; analytical and decision-making skills, we encourage an interdisciplinary approach to learning that incorporates technology and real-world case studies.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;Beyond technical proficiency, we understand the need of honing crucial soft skills like leadership, collaboration, and communication. In order to support holistic development and improve their employability, our programme encourages students to take part in extracurricular activities, industrial internships, and networking events.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;Our B.Com (Hons) programme in Finance &amp;amp; Accounting has the vision of being a transformational educational experience that prepares graduates to be professionals who can adapt to changing market conditions and make significant contributions to the financial industry. Our goal is to create morally upright and socially conscious financial professionals who respect the highest standards of ethics.&lt;/p&gt;', 1, 0, '2024-03-15 03:17:28', '2024-03-15 03:17:28', NULL, NULL),
(76, '', '', '217', '&lt;p&gt;The B.Com (Hons) programme in Finance &amp;amp; Accounting at Gyanmanjari Innovative University aims to provide students a thorough grasp of the ideas, principles, and practises of finance and accounting in the corporate world. The curriculum is designed to provide students the information and abilities they need to seek lucrative jobs in accounting and finance and to advance the financial sector as a whole.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;The following are the program&amp;#39;s particular goals:&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;Academic Excellence: The course offers a demanding curriculum that includes both theoretical ideas and real-world applications in finance and accounting in an effort to provide high-quality education. The goal is to improve the students&amp;#39; analytical, decision-making, and problem-solving abilities.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;Professional Competence: Through the teaching of information and abilities pertinent to the finance and accounting fields, the programme seeks to enhance students&amp;#39; professional competence. Financial analysis, investment management, risk analysis, financial reporting, auditing, taxes, and other significant topics will be covered in class.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;Ethical Values: Gyanmanjari Innovative University places a strong emphasis on the value of ethics in the fields of accounting and finance. The curriculum seeks to inculcate in pupils a strong sense of professional ethics and integrity, enabling them to make moral judgements in their future jobs.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;contact with Industry: By hosting guest lectures, workshops, seminars, and internships, the institution promotes industry contact. These encounters provide students hands-on experience with real-world accounting and financial practises and aid in their better comprehension of market trends and needs.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;Gyanmanjari Innovative University understands the significance of holistic development. The programme emphasises developing students&amp;#39; communication, critical thinking, leadership, and collaboration abilities in addition to their technical knowledge so they may succeed in a variety of professional settings.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;The university encourages research and innovation in the fields of accounting and finance. Students are encouraged to conduct research projects, take part in academic contests, and enhance knowledge in their specific fields&lt;/p&gt;', '&lt;p&gt;The vision of Gyanmanjari Innovative University&amp;#39;s B.Com (Hons) programme in Finance &amp;amp; Accounting is to provide a dynamic learning environment that equips students to succeed as professionals in the finance and accounting industries. In order to prepare students for successful employment in the financial, banking, auditing, and allied areas, our programme strives to foster a thorough grasp of financial management, investment techniques, and accounting concepts.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;Our programme aims to provide students with the information, skills, and ethical principles required to succeed in a fast changing financial environment via a mix of demanding academic coursework and real-world experience learning. We want students to have a thorough grasp of financial theories, analytical methods, and regulatory frameworks so they can make wise judgements and help organisations thrive and endure.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;Our faculty, which is made up of seasoned teachers and business experts, is committed to provide high-quality instruction that places an emphasis on creativity, problem-solving, and critical thinking. In order to improve students&amp;#39; analytical and decision-making skills, we encourage an interdisciplinary approach to learning that incorporates technology and real-world case studies.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;Beyond technical proficiency, we understand the need of honing crucial soft skills like leadership, collaboration, and communication. In order to support holistic development and improve their employability, our programme encourages students to take part in extracurricular activities, industrial internships, and networking events.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;Our B.Com (Hons) programme in Finance &amp;amp; Accounting has the vision of being a transformational educational experience that prepares graduates to be professionals who can adapt to changing market conditions and make significant contributions to the financial industry. Our goal is to create morally upright and socially conscious financial professionals who respect the highest standards of ethics.&lt;/p&gt;', 1, 0, '2024-03-15 03:18:56', '2024-03-15 03:18:56', NULL, NULL),
(77, '', '', '123', '&lt;ul&gt;\r\n	&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px&quot;&gt;The mission of the faculty of the GMSC, is given by the goals outlined below.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px&quot;&gt;To provide high quality instruction that develops in an integrative manner, conceptual understanding, analytical skills, and enthusiasm for learning and inquiry in the applied &amp;amp; pure sciences.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px&quot;&gt;Teach fundamental principles and unifying concepts in the sciences, humanities &amp;amp; maths through a curriculum requiring exposure to multiple sub-disciplines of education.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px&quot;&gt;Teach students to function as a scientist, through exposure to the scientific process used in hypothesis, experimentation, observation and analysis, including course work and teaching laboratories incorporating experimental or discovery-based approaches, as well as reading and analysis of scientific research literature.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px&quot;&gt;To provide an atmosphere of excellence that advances the GMSC contribution to acquire knowledge for B.Sc. Students&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;', '&lt;ul&gt;\r\n	&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px&quot;&gt;We believe that true excellence in education requires a commitment to equity and social justice Thus we strive to prepare&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px&quot;&gt;Creative&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px&quot;&gt;Culturally competent&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px&quot;&gt;Critically reflective&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px&quot;&gt;Graduates who possess deep knowledge in their field of study and work collaboratively to achieve high quality education for all.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;', 1, 0, '2024-03-15 09:06:53', '2024-03-15 09:06:53', NULL, NULL),
(78, '', '', '363', '&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Calibri&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;sans-serif&amp;quot;&quot;&gt;The mission of the M.Pharma program (Two years) is to advance the field of pharmaceutical sciences by providing high-quality education and training to graduate students. We are committed to fostering critical thinking, research skills, and professional ethics. Our program aims to develop leaders who will contribute to the innovation and development of safe, effective, and accessible medicines, thereby improving healthcare outcomes and enhancing the well-being of society. We strive to create an environment that encourages lifelong learning, collaboration, and the pursuit of excellence in pharmacy practice and research.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;', '&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Calibri&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;sans-serif&amp;quot;&quot;&gt;To be a leading center of excellence in pharmaceutical education, research, and innovation, fostering the development of highly skilled professionals in Pharmaceutics and Pharmaceutical Quality Assurance. Our vision is to equip students with cutting-edge knowledge, practical skills, and a commitment to ethical practices, empowering them to contribute significantly to the advancement of the pharmaceutical industry and the health of society.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;', 1, 0, '2024-08-28 08:51:52', '2024-08-28 08:51:52', NULL, NULL),
(79, '', '', '290', '&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;The department is committed to provide high quality education to the students by constantly striving to improve the teaching-learning methods, delivering good academic programmes and responding to fast evolving scientific &amp;amp; technological challenges while inculcating right values with environmental consciousness.&lt;/p&gt;', '&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;Develop professionally competent Mechanical Engineers to meet the needs of industry &amp;amp; society by promoting excellence in teaching, learning and research.&lt;/p&gt;', 1, 0, '2024-09-05 07:01:54', '2024-09-05 07:01:54', NULL, NULL),
(80, '', '', '212,213,239,252,259', '&lt;p&gt;To be one of the renowned Electronics and Telecommunication Engineering programs that impart quality education by promoting professionalism, values, and ethics, leading to a progressive career in industry and academia globally.&lt;/p&gt;', '&lt;p&gt;To boost employability, entrepreneurship, and higher studies through value-added activities.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;To inculcate a research attitude and professional ethics to address the needs of the industry.&lt;/p&gt;', 1, 0, '2025-05-14 07:54:31', '2024-11-27 08:33:15', NULL, NULL),
(81, '', '', '8,38,48,118,200,201', '&lt;p&gt;To provide high quality instruction that develops in an integrative manner, conceptual understanding, analytical skills, and enthusiasm for learning and inquiry in the applied &amp;amp; pure sciences.&lt;br /&gt;\r\nTeach fundamental principles and unifying concepts in the sciences, humanities &amp;amp; maths through a curriculum requiring exposure to multiple sub-disciplines of education.&lt;br /&gt;\r\nTeach students to function as a scientist, through exposure to the scientific process used in hypothesis, experimentation, observation and analysis, including course work and teaching laboratories incorporating experimental or discovery-based approaches, as well as reading and analysis of scientific research literature.&lt;br /&gt;\r\nTo provide an atmosphere of excellence that advances the GMSC contribution to acquire knowledge for B.Sc. Students&lt;/p&gt;', '&lt;p&gt;We believe that true excellence in education requires a commitment to equity and social justice Thus we strive to prepare Creative Culturally competent Critically reflective Graduates who possess deep knowledge in their field of study and work collaboratively to achieve high quality education for all.&lt;/p&gt;', 1, 0, '2024-12-27 08:59:09', '2024-12-27 08:59:09', NULL, NULL),
(82, '', '', '365', '&lt;p&gt;The Mission of Gyanmanjari Institute of LAW is to prepare lawyers to handle legal matters at global level, promote legal and ethical values, foster rule of law, promote legal awareness in the community. To achieve political, social and economic justice. To impart quality legal education in the changing socio-economic scenario with strong emphasis on human values ​​and social responsibility so that &amp;ldquo;justice for all becomes a reality&amp;rdquo;. To prepare the lawyers of tomorrow to handle legal matters not only restricted to national boundaries but also at global level, by developing legal skills in core areas like commercial laws, intellectual property rights, cyber laws and business laws.&lt;/p&gt;', '&lt;p&gt;The Institute of Law was established with a vision to impart quality legal education with a view to preparing world-class professionals, academicians and scholars in the field of law. It generally includes imparting legal education, promotion of legal values ​​and development of legal skills. The aim is to increase legal awareness in the community and promote the cause of social justice by providing legal assistance to the section of the society. We strive to provide students with a well-rounded legal education.&lt;/p&gt;', 1, 0, '2025-01-22 04:45:17', '2025-01-22 04:41:36', NULL, NULL),
(83, '', '', '610', '&lt;ul&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;\r\n	&lt;p&gt;To provide a curriculum that integrates academic theory with practical applications, covering areas such as airport operations, aviation law, air traffic control, airline management, and logistics.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n	&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;\r\n	&lt;p&gt;To focus on the development of communication, analytical thinking, leadership, and decision-making skills required in the aviation industry.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n	&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;\r\n	&lt;p&gt;To expose students to real-world scenarios through field visits to airports, internships with airlines or aviation companies, guest lectures by industry experts, and case-based learning.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n	&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;\r\n	&lt;p&gt;To encourage innovation and entrepreneurship by nurturing students who aspire to start ventures in aviation, cargo services, airport consultancy, or related fields.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n	&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;\r\n	&lt;p&gt;To offer education that bridges global standards with Indian aviation sector needs, preparing students for both domestic and international careers.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n	&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;\r\n	&lt;p&gt;To inculcate professional ethics, social responsibility, and commitment to sustainability, which are crucial in the highly regulated and safety-focused aviation environment.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n	&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;\r\n	&lt;p&gt;To enable students to be job-ready from the outset with strong support for placements, certifications, and soft skill development.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n	&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;', '&lt;ul&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;\r\n	&lt;p&gt;To &lt;strong&gt;create globally competent professionals&lt;/strong&gt; in the field of aviation and airport management by providing &lt;strong&gt;industry-relevant education&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;practical exposure&lt;/strong&gt;, and a strong foundation in &lt;strong&gt;leadership, ethics, and innovation&lt;/strong&gt;. The program envisions producing graduates who are not only &lt;strong&gt;employable&lt;/strong&gt; in the aviation sector but are also equipped to take on &lt;strong&gt;entrepreneurial roles&lt;/strong&gt;, lead &lt;strong&gt;sustainable development&lt;/strong&gt;, and contribute meaningfully to the &lt;strong&gt;advancement of aviation and transportation infrastructure&lt;/strong&gt; in India and globally.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n	&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;\r\n	&lt;p&gt;To be a center of excellence in aviation and airport management studies.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n	&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;\r\n	&lt;p&gt;To equip students with critical thinking, managerial skills, and technical knowledge specific to the aviation industry.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n	&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;\r\n	&lt;p&gt;To align the curriculum with the dynamic needs of the global aviation market.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n	&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;\r\n	&lt;p&gt;To foster ethical and socially responsible future aviation leaders.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n	&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;', 1, 0, '2025-04-15 08:59:24', '2025-04-15 08:59:24', NULL, NULL),
(84, '', '', '604', '&lt;ul&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;To provide skill based environment that helps students to improve problem solving skill.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;To provide spotlight to students to the recent tools and technologies in the area of computer hardware and software.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;To prepare students as per current industrial requirement through Institute-Industry Interaction (III).&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;To support research based projects and different activities in the rising areas of technology convergence.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;', '&lt;ul&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;We envision our students have skilled engineers not only in the field of science and technology, but also in every field to build strong and developed nation.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;', 1, 0, '2025-05-17 09:53:24', '2025-05-17 09:53:24', NULL, NULL),
(85, '', '', '575', '&lt;ul&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;To provide skill based environment that helps students to improve problem solving skill.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;To provide spotlight to students to the recent tools and technologies in the area of computer hardware and software.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;To prepare students as per current industrial requirement through Institute-Industry Interaction (III).&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;To support research based projects and different activities in the rising areas of technology convergence.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;', '&lt;ul&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;We envision our students have skilled engineers not only in the field of science and technology, but also in every field to build strong and developed nation.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;', 1, 0, '2025-06-11 08:49:27', '2025-06-11 08:49:27', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `tbl_mission_vision` (`id`, `faculty_id`, `level_id`, `program_id`, `mission`, `vision`, `is_active`, `is_delete`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `created_by`, `updated_by`) VALUES
(86, '', '', '29,562,563,565', '&lt;ul&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;To provide high-quality instruction that develops, in an integrative manner, conceptual understanding, problem-solving abilities, analytical thinking, and enthusiasm for learning and innovation in the field of computer science and engineering.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;To prepare students to function effectively as computer engineers and innovators by providing exposure to the engineering design process, including problem analysis, algorithm development, software and hardware implementation, testing, and evaluation, supported by practical coursework, coding labs, and project-based learning.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;To encourage students to explore research and emerging technologies through hands-on experimentation, collaborative projects, and critical analysis of research literature in computer science and engineering.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;To provide an environment of academic excellence that fosters creativity, teamwork, leadership, and lifelong learning, thereby enhancing the contribution of the CSE faculty to the advancement of knowledge and innovation for B.Tech Computer Science &amp;amp; Engineering students.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;', '&lt;p&gt;Our vision is to become a center of excellence in Computer Science &amp;amp; Engineering education, research, and innovation.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;ul&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Creative innovators who design advanced solutions to real-world technological challenges.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Culturally competent engineers who can work effectively in diverse and global environments.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Critically reflective thinkers who analyze emerging technologies and their societal impact.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;', 1, 0, '2025-12-24 06:12:08', '2025-09-10 08:26:37', NULL, NULL),
(87, '', '', '127', '&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;Our Mission is to bridge the gap between academics and industry through a practice-oriented, experiential learning approach. By emphasizing application-based assessments, industry exposure, and entrepreneurial development, our program fosters critical thinking, leadership, and innovation. It aims to produce globally competent, responsible professionals and establish ourselves as a leading institute in management and entrepreneurship education, research, and policy advocacy, grounded in strong values and principles.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;', '&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;Becoming a leading hub for practical, industry-focused management education that cultivates innovative, industry-ready professionals and entrepreneurs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;', 1, 0, '2025-09-23 07:51:02', '2025-09-23 07:51:02', NULL, NULL),
(88, '', '', '127', '&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;Our Mission is to bridge the gap between academics and industry through a practice-oriented, experiential learning approach. By emphasizing application-based assessments, industry exposure, and entrepreneurial development, our program fosters critical thinking, leadership, and innovation. It aims to produce globally competent, responsible professionals and establish ourselves as a leading institute in management and entrepreneurship education, research, and policy advocacy, grounded in strong values and principles.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;', '&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;Becoming a leading hub for practical, industry-focused management education that cultivates innovative, industry-ready professionals and entrepreneurs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;', 1, 0, '2025-09-23 07:51:02', '2025-09-23 07:51:02', NULL, NULL);
