(57, 'G83', 0, 4, 2, 'M.Com Banking &amp; Insurance', 'post-graduation-m-com-banking-amp-insurance', '', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Commerce study is one of the most popular courses amongGraduates and post graduate. Those who want to gain in-depth knowledge in commerce stream can study B.Com and M.Com. Commerce courses are designed to provide knowledge in specific subjects. It is an advanced level of systematic study that is focused on Banking and insurance.A Banking, Finance, and Insurance course would typically focus on the principles and practices of the financial industry, such as banking, investing, insurance, and risk management. These classes are intended to give students a firm foundation in financial principles and practices. Students study various financial markets, such as stock markets, bond markets, commodity markets, and currency markets. They investigate how these markets function, particularly the trading and price systems.</span></span></p>\r\n', 'Develop advanced skills in banking operations, financial risk, and insurance management with our specialized M.Com program.', 'M.Com banking, M.Com insurance, PG banking course, financial services, commerce PG, Institute of Commerce, best PG commerce program Gujarat', '', 'M.Com in Banking & Insurance – Institute of Commerce', 'N/A', 'Mcom (In Hon. Subjects)', '4', 30, '2', 34500, 19900, 17250, 17600, 20250, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 6000, 6000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 1, 0, '2023-03-09 07:30:33', '2025-06-18 12:05:19', 0, 0);
