(114, 'G191', 0, 15, 1, 'Hotel Management &amp; Catering Technology', 'under-graduation-hotel-management-amp-catering-technology', 'GMIU offers the best hotel management program, providing students with a comprehensive education, experienced faculty, and state-of-the-art facilities. The curriculum covers essential skills such as hotel operations, revenue management, marketing, and customer service, while hands-on learning opportunities through internships and real-world projects provide practical application of knowledge. The college also offers a range of extracurricular activities, modern classrooms, fully equipped labs, and a state-of-the-art hospitality training center, as well as partnerships with leading hotels and hospitality companies for internships, job placements, and mentorship programs. With a focus on industry-relevant knowledge and practical application, GMIU is the ideal choice for anyone seeking a successful career in hotel management.\r\n\r\n	change duration of Hotel Management & Catering Technology (4 years)\r\n	remove Hotel Management Hon. in Reception Operations & Services\r\n	remove Hotel Management Hon. in Tourism & Hotel Management\r\n	remove Hotel Management Hon. in Hospitality Management\r\n', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">GMIU offers the best hotel management program, providing students with a comprehensive education, experienced faculty, and state-of-the-art facilities. The curriculum covers essential skills such as hotel operations, revenue management, marketing, and customer service, while hands-on learning opportunities through internships and real-world projects provide practical application of knowledge. The college also offers a range of extracurricular activities, modern classrooms, fully equipped labs, and a state-of-the-art hospitality training center, as well as partnerships with leading hotels and hospitality companies for internships, job placements, and mentorship programs. With a focus on industry-relevant knowledge and practical application, GMIU is the ideal choice for anyone seeking a successful career in hotel management.  change duration of Hotel Management &amp; Catering Technology (4 years)  remove Hotel Management Hon. in Reception Operations &amp; Services  remove Hotel Management Hon. in Tourism &amp; Hotel Management  remove Hotel Management Hon. in Hospitality Management</span></p>\r\n', 'Learn hospitality management, food production, event planning, and catering techniques with our UG hotel management program.', 'hotel management degree, catering technology, hospitality studies, event planning course, UG hotel management, tourism management, top hotel management college in Gujarat', '', 'Bachelor’s in Hotel Management & Catering Technology – Institute of Hotel Management', '', 'HM&CT', '15', 60, '4', 66150, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 45000, 0, 0, 0, 10000, 6000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 1, 0, '2023-03-09 07:35:03', '2025-06-18 12:05:19', 0, 0),
(115, 'G192', 0, 15, 5, 'Hotel Management &amp; Catering Technology', 'diploma-hotel-management-amp-catering-technology', '', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">A Hotel Management and Catering Technology course is designed to provide individuals with the skills and knowledge needed to thrive in the hospitality industry. Participants learn various aspects of hotel management, including front office operations, housekeeping, food and beverage management, and event planning. The curriculum often incorporates practical training in culinary arts, customer service, and hotel administration. This course is ideal for those aspiring to pursue careers in hotel management, catering services, or related hospitality sectors. Graduates from Hotel Management and Catering Technology courses are well-equipped to work in hotels, resorts, restaurants, and catering businesses, contributing to the seamless operation and success of these establishments. The program emphasizes a combination of practical skills, industry knowledge, and customer service, preparing individuals for dynamic roles in the vibrant and ever-evolving field of hospitality.</span></p>\r\n', 'Begin your hospitality career with a diploma in hotel management and catering, including hands-on training in service, food, and guest management.', 'hotel management diploma, catering diploma, hospitality training, food service course, tourism diploma, hotel studies Gujarat', '', 'Diploma in Hotel Management & Catering Technology – Institute of Hotel Management', '', 'HM&CT', '15', 60, '3', 39900, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 42500, 0, 0, 0, 6000, 6000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 1, 0, '2023-03-09 07:35:03', '2025-06-18 12:05:19', 0, 0),
(116, 'G30', 0, 1, 2, 'Construction and Project management', 'post-graduation-construction-and-project-management', '', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\">GMIU offers a two-year full-time post-graduate program leading to Master of Technology (M. Tech) in Construction and Project Management. This program aims to train engineers and architects to become competent professionals in the field of construction engineering and project management. Construction Project Management is a subsidiary branch of civil engineering which comprises of knowledge about management of time, money and all other resources being used on a construction project. Construction managers play a crucial role in the development of built environment and infrastructure by ensuring efficient and timely implementation of construction projects. This branch prepares students to be able to take on various challenges of construction site with ability to complete the project within stipulated time and under the specified budget constraints. Students of civil engineering with an aim to become construction manager or willing to run their own construction project should pursue this course.</span></span></p>\r\n', 'Master construction planning, cost estimation, and project execution strategies with our postgraduate program in project management.', 'construction project management, M.Tech construction, PG civil engineering, infrastructure planning, construction technology, construction PG course', 'Discover GMIU\'s industry visit program, providing students with hands-on experiences and valuable industry insights to enhance their educational journey.', 'M.Tech in Construction and Project Management – Institute of Engineering & Technology', 'N/A', 'c&pm', '1', 18, '2', 105000, 55150, 52500, 52850, 55500, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 10000, 6000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 1, 0, '2023-03-13 06:54:36', '2025-06-26 09:12:03', 0, 0),
(117, 'G32', 0, 1, 2, 'Machine Design', 'post-graduation-machine-design', '', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">The Master in Technology in Machine Design is a 2-year professional degree programme with intake of 18 seats in the Mechanical Engineering Department. Design of any mechanical equipment requires a fundamental knowledge of strength of materials and vibration behaviour. Students here, learn about design and analysis of mechanical components through experiments and simulations. This specialization is a gateway for Robotics. </span><span style=\"color:#000000\">The core courses in Machine Design specialization include Advance Solid Mechanics, Mechanical Vibration, Finite Element Methods, Advanced Engineering Mathematics. Further students can opt to choose elective classes such as Fracture Fatigue and failure analysis, Rotor Dynamics, Mechatronics, etc. The past Machine Design specialization students were able to get placed in companies such as Mercedes Benz, Siemens, Caterpillar, Tata Motors, etc.</span></span></span></p>\r\n', 'Explore machine components, CAD tools, and design methodologies in our specialized PG program in Machine Design.', 'machine design, M.Tech mechanical design, CAD mechanical engineering, PG mechanical engineering, design engineering Gujarat', 'Explore the industry visit for the Machine Design at GMIU, offering practical exposure to real-world experiences in the INSTITUTE OF ENGINEERING & TECHNOLOGY field of study.', 'M.Tech in Machine Design – Institute of Engineering & Technology', 'N/A', 'md', '1', 18, '2', 105000, 55150, 52500, 52850, 55500, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 10000, 6000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 1, 0, '2023-03-13 06:56:32', '2025-06-26 09:12:03', 0, 0),
(118, 'G25', 0, 1, 5, 'Chemical Engineering', 'diploma-chemical-engineering', '', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Chemical engineering is a branch of engineering that deals with the design, development, and operation of chemical processes and the production of useful materials and products. A diploma in chemical engineering is a technical degree program that prepares students with practical skills and knowledge in the field of chemical engineering. The diploma program typically takes 2-3 years to complete and covers topics such as chemical process technology, chemical engineering design, process control and instrumentation, thermodynamics, and reaction engineering. The program also includes practical training through laboratory work and industrial visits. Graduates of a diploma in chemical engineering program can find employment in various industries such as chemical manufacturing, petroleum and gas processing, pharmaceuticals, food processing, and environmental engineering. They can work as process engineers, production engineers, plant managers, research and development engineers, and environmental engineers. A diploma in chemical engineering can also serve as a pathway to further studies such as a bachelor&#39;s or master&#39;s degree in chemical engineering or related fields.</span></p>\r\n', 'Discover our Chemical Engineering program, offering a range of courses, bachelor\'s degrees, and certificate programs. Join our chemical engineering university to explore environmental engineering and gain the knowledge needed for a successful career in chemical processes.', 'chemical engineering, chemical engineering degree, university certificate programs, chemical engineering course, environmental engineering, bachelor degree programs, chemical engineering programs, engineering curriculum, chemical engineering curriculum, bachelor degree in engineering, chemical engineering university, chemical engineering bachelor degree, top chemical engineering colleges, chemical engineering education, chemical process engineering', 'Join GMIU’s industry visit program for real-world exposure and hands-on learning, equipping students with essential career skills and insights from industry leaders.', 'Diploma in Chemical Engineering – Institute of Engineering & Technology', 'N/A', 'CHE', '1', 30, '3', 58000, 31300, 29000, 29350, 29000, 29350, 32000, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 6000, 6000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 1, 0, '2023-03-13 07:00:37', '2025-06-26 09:12:03', 0, 0),
(119, 'G40', 0, 2, 1, 'Bachelor Of Pharmacy', 'under-graduation-bachelor-of-pharmacy', 'Pharmacy is the science and practice of discovery, manufacture, preparation, distribution, review and monitoring of drugs, with the aim of ensuring safe, effective and rational use of allopathic, herbal, ayurvedic, cosmetics, nutraceuticals, biological vaccines etc. The Indian pharmaceutical industry is one of the fastest growing segments of the Indian economy as most drugs are now manufactured by pharmaceutical industries only. Pharmacy course is a course which is recognized for private and government jobs, self-employment by industrial development as well as various courses for higher studies in Indian and foreign universities. Additionally, students can appear for competitive and eligibility exams to become a registered pharmacist in countries like USA, Canada, Australia, New Zealand and European union etc. A college provides pharmacy course must be approved by the Pharmacy Council of India, New Delhi. Students passing from the approved college are only eligible for registration of pharmacists.', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Pharmacy is the science and practice of discovery, manufacture, preparation, distribution, review and monitoring of drugs, with the aim of ensuring safe, effective and rational use of allopathic, herbal, ayurvedic, cosmetics, nutraceuticals, biological vaccines etc. The Indian pharmaceutical industry is one of the fastest growing segments of the Indian economy as most drugs are now manufactured by pharmaceutical industries only. Pharmacy course is a course which is recognized for private and government jobs, self-employment by industrial development as well as various courses for higher studies in Indian and foreign universities. Additionally, students can appear for competitive and eligibility exams to become a registered pharmacist in countries like USA, Canada, Australia, New Zealand and European union etc. A college provides pharmacy course must be approved by the Pharmacy Council of India, New Delhi. Students passing from the approved college are only eligible for registration of pharmacists.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Bachelor of Pharmacy (B. Pharm) is an undergraduate degree course in the field of Pharmacy. The B.Pharm is one of the popular job oriented course among the science students after class 12th. In this course the students study about the drugs and medicines, Pharmaceutical Engineering, Medicinal Chemistry etc. This course provides a large no. of job opportunities in both the public and private sector.A Bachelor of Pharmacy Course makes you able to enter the Pharmacy sector in Medical and Health Care Industry. One who pursues this degree studies core subjects including Pharmaceuticals, Pharmacology, Pharmaceutical Chemistry and Pharmacognosy. Bachelor of Pharmacy (B.Pharm) is an undergraduate degree program in the field of Pharmacy. The students those are interested in the paramedical field can choose this course after the completion of class 12th (PCM/B).</span></p>\r\n', 'Explore top pharmacy courses, undergraduate degree programs, and the best B. Pharmacy colleges in Bhavnagar, Gujarat, and nearby cities. Apply online for university degrees and pharmacy studies.', 'pharmacy course, undergraduate degree, university course, pharmacy study, bachelor degree programs, undergraduate program, bachelor degree courses, undergraduate degree programs, university apply online, degree online, education university, best pharmacy college, best pharmacy college in Bhavnagar, best pharmacy college in Gujarat, best pharmacy college near me, best pharmacy college in my city, best B. Pharmacy college in Bhavnagar, best B. Pharmacy college in Gujarat, best B. Pharmacy college near me, best B. Pharmacy college in my city, top pharmacy college, top pharmacy college in Bhavnagar, top pharmacy college in Gujarat, top pharmacy college near me, top pharmacy college in my city, top B. Pharmacy college in Bhavnagar, top B. Pharmacy college in Gujarat, top B. Pharmacy college near me, top B. Pharmacy college in my city', 'Explore GMIU’s industry visit program, where students gain real-world insights and hands-on experience, enhancing their skills for successful careers under expert guidance.', 'B. Pharmacy (Undergraduate) - Gyanmanjari Innovative University | GMIU', 'N/A', 'B.PHARM', '2', 100, '4', 85000, 46400, 44000, 44350, 44000, 44350, 44000, 44350, 47000, 0, 0, 70000, 0, 10000, 6000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 1, 0, '2023-03-14 09:08:40', '2025-06-26 09:12:03', 0, 0),
(120, '', 0, 3, 1, 'BSc Chemistry', 'under-graduation-bsc-chemistry', 'Chemistry is the scientific study of matter and the transformations it can undergo. It involves the examination of the structure, properties, and composition of matter, as well as the changes it can undergo during chemical reactions. Chemist studies the fundamental building blocks of matter, including atoms and molecules, and how they interact with each other to create the world around us. They also study chemical reactions and the energy changes that occur during these reactions. Chemistry plays a vital role in many aspects of daily life, from the food we eat and the medicines we take to the materials we use to build our homes and the technologies we use to communicate and travel. There are several subfields of chemistry, including organic chemistry, inorganic chemistry, physical chemistry, analytical chemistry, and biochemistry. Each of these subfields focuses on a different aspect of chemistry and has its own specialized techniques and tools for studying matter.', 'Chemistry is the scientific study of matter and the transformations it can undergo. It involves the examination of the structure, properties, and composition of matter, as well as the changes it can undergo during chemical reactions. Chemist studies the fundamental building blocks of matter, including atoms and molecules, and how they interact with each other to create the world around us. They also study chemical reactions and the energy changes that occur during these reactions. Chemistry plays a vital role in many aspects of daily life, from the food we eat and the medicines we take to the materials we use to build our homes and the technologies we use to communicate and travel. There are several subfields of chemistry, including organic chemistry, inorganic chemistry, physical chemistry, analytical chemistry, and biochemistry. Each of these subfields focuses on a different aspect of chemistry and has its own specialized techniques and tools for studying matter.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '3', 0, '4', 35400, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 11000, 10000, 6000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 0, 1, '2023-03-14 09:33:38', '2025-06-09 04:38:06', 0, 0);
