(132, 'G56/G57', 0, 3, 1, 'BSc IT (Cyber Security/AI and Data Science)', 'under-graduation-b-sc-it', '', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">In Gyanmanjari Innovative University one can study computer science in existing trending courses and honor degree in UG and PG level as per new education policy (NEP-2020) with important issues like skill and innovation in subjects like cyber security, Data science, cloud technology. The course here has been prepared with the guidance of industry experts with more focus on the current industry demand and practical exposure. Along with studies, various conferences, competitions and programs are being organized to help students develop life skills and become more competent national and international job seekers and givers. The students of the institute who have been placed in various famous industries like bharatpay, TCL and IBM and the experts periodically conduct expert sessions and industrial visits, internships are being done so that the students can make their best career by understanding the current needs. Qualities like startup and entrepreneurship and trending courses like In subjects like IOT, data science, education is being developed by developing various leaning approaches and education systems in which students advance in the direction of extraordinary rather than ordinary courses by developing a deep and proper understanding of the field of technology. With excellent infrastructural facilities, personal mentorship, club activities and excellent faculty, students will thrive in the challenging environment of Computer Science.</span></p>\r\n', 'Gain dual expertise in cybersecurity and AI/data science with this B.Sc IT program. Learn ethical hacking, machine learning, and data analytics.', 'B.Sc IT, cyber security course, AI degree, data science UG, ethical hacking, machine learning BSc, IT dual specialization, science UG Gujarat', 'Enhance your skills with GMIU\'s industry visit program, of