(305, '', 0, 4, 2, 'M. Com in Labour-Management', 'post-graduation-m-com-in-labour-management', '', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">A master&#39;s degree in labour studies is a two-year professional programme that focuses on current concerns in labour welfare and management. It&rsquo;s an advanced course that aims to address the expanding complexities of modern industrial work by giving practical training, particularly in the areas of labour welfare, personnel management, and industrial relations.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">The course covers a wide range of topics that will assist students in effectively handling and managing H.R. Development, Internal Relations, and Labor Welfare. The Master of Labor Studies programme focuses on Industrial-Organizational Behaviour and Labor Welfare, Personnel Management. The course includes assignments at government agencies and institutions such as the Labour Welfare Board, Labour Court, and the Civic Administration.</span></p>\r\n', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 30, '2', 32500, 19900, 17250, 17600, 20250, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 6000, 6000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 0, 0, '2024-04-03 08:35:09', '2025-06-09 04:38:06', 0, 0),
