(761, 3, 1, 38, 'IDEAS', '<p>Take informed actions after identifying the assumptions that frame ourthinking and actions, checking out the degree to which these assumptions are accurate andvalid, and looking at our ideas and decisions (intellectual, organizational, and personal) fromdifferent perspectives.Critically evaluate practices, policies and theories by following scientific approach to knowledge development .</p>\r\n', 1, 0, '2024-12-27 08:47:41', '2024-12-27 08:47:41', NULL, NULL),
