(765, 3, 1, 38, 'CAPABILITY', '<p>Ability to embrace moral/ ethical values in conducting one&rsquo;s life, possess knowledge of the values and beliefs of multiple cultures and a global perspectives; and capability to effectively engage in a multicultural society and interact respectfully with diverse groups .</p>\r\n', 1, 0, '2024-12-27 08:51:41', '2024-12-27 08:51:41', NULL, NULL),
