(784, 3, 1, 200, 'SENSIBILITY', '<p>A sense of inquiry and capability for asking relevant/ appropriate questions, problematizing, synthesizing and articulating; Ability to recognize cause- and- effect relationships, define problems, formulate hypotheses, interpret and draw conclusions from data, ability to plan, execute and report the results of an experiment or investigation. Ability to apply one&rsquo;s learning to real life situations</p>\r\n', 1, 0, '2024-12-27 09:28:34', '2024-12-27 09:28:34', NULL, NULL),
(785, 3, 1, 200, 'AWARENESS', '<p>Create an awareness of the impact of chemistry on the environment, society, and development outside the scientific community.</p>\r\n', 1, 0, '2024-12-27 09:29:07', '2024-12-27 09:29:07', NULL, NULL),
