(789, 1, 1, 8, 'ENVIRONMENTAL SUSTAINABILITY', '<p>Environment and sustainability Understand the impact of the professional engineering solutions in societal and environmental contexts, and demonstrate the knowledge of, and need for sustainable development.</p>\r\n', 1, 0, '2024-12-27 09:42:45', '2024-12-27 09:42:45', NULL, NULL),
(790, 26, 1, 365, 'Career Opportunities', '<p>Graduates can work in Private Law Firms, Corporate Legal Departments, Government Agencies and NGOs. They can also work as Legal Advisors, Legal Consultants, legal analyts and more.&nbsp;</p>\r\n', 1, 0, '2025-01-23 06:59:19', '2025-01-23 06:59:19', NULL, NULL),
(791, 26, 1, 365, 'Research Skills', '<p>Graduets can develop research aptitude and apply their legal knowledge to solve legal Problems.&nbsp;</p>\r\n', 1, 0, '2025-01-23 07:35:10', '2025-01-23 07:35:10', NULL, NULL),
(792, 26, 1, 365, 'Ethical Awareness', '<p>Law Graduats can Understand the Ethical, Social, Political, and Economic Context of the legal System.&nbsp;</p>\r\n', 1, 0, '2025-01-23 07:37:29', '2025-01-23 07:37:29', NULL, NULL),
(793, 5, 1, 310, 'Program Outcome', '<ul>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">Graduates&nbsp; will develop a comprehensive understanding of <strong>Social Media Marketing</strong> and its pivotal role in modern digital communication. They will gain insights into the significance of social media as a strategic tool for businesses, brands, and personal branding, enabling them to harness its potential for audience engagement, brand awareness, and lead generation.</li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">Students will be well-versed in the <strong>legal and ethical considerations</strong> associated with social media usage, including compliance with data protection laws, intellectual property rights, ethical marketing practices, and responsible digital communication. They will learn to navigate legal frameworks and ethical dilemmas, ensuring that their social media strategies align with professional standards and regulatory requirements.</li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">Through structured learning, students will acquire proficiency in <strong>social media strategy development</strong>, equipping them with the skills to create, implement, and optimize tailored marketing strategies. They will analyze audience behavior, conduct competitor research, and develop content calendars to ensure effective engagement and sustained brand presence.</li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">The syllabus will enhance students&#39; expertise in <strong>content creation and management</strong>, enabling them to craft compelling, engaging, and relevant content across various social media platforms. They will explore different content formats such as text, images, videos, infographics, and interactive media, ensuring alignment with brand objectives and audience preferences.</li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">By utilizing <strong>content creation tools</strong>, students will gain hands-on experience with industry-standard applications and platforms such as Canva, Adobe Spark, and AI-driven content generators. They will learn to leverage these tools for designing visually appealing posts, videos, and graphics that resonate with their target audience.</li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">Additionally, students will develop proficiency in <strong>social media advertising and campaign management</strong>, including an in-depth understanding of paid advertising strategies. They will explore various advertising models, including <strong>cost-per-click (CPC), cost-per-impression (CPM), and conversion-based ad structures</strong>, enabling them to design cost-effective and high-performing ad campaigns.</li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">The curriculum will provide a deep dive into <strong>ad platforms and their features</strong>, including Facebook Ads, Instagram Ads, LinkedIn Ads, Google Display Network, and emerging advertising tools. Students will understand audience targeting mechanisms, bidding strategies, and performance tracking through analytics tools, ensuring data-driven decision-making for campaign success.</li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">Overall, this program will equip students with <strong>industry-relevant skills</strong> in social media marketing, preparing them for careers as <strong>digital marketers, content strategists, social media managers, brand consultants, and advertising specialists</strong>. They will emerge with the ability to craft result-oriented social media campaigns, drive online engagement, and contribute to the growth and digital transformation of businesses in various sectors.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n', 1, 0, '2025-02-05 08:42:18', '2025-02-05 08:42:18', NULL, NULL),
(794, 1, 9, 245, 'Problem analysis', '<p>Identify, formulate, review research literature, and analyze complex engineering problems reaching substantiated conclusions using first principles of mathematics, natural sciences, and engineering sciences.</p>\r\n', 1, 0, '2025-02-28 06:16:33', '2025-02-28 06:16:33', NULL, NULL),
(795, 1, 9, 5, 'Problem analysis', '<p>Identify, formulate, review research literature, and analyze complex engineering problems reaching substantiated conclusions using first principles of mathematics, natural sciences, and engineering sciences.</p>\r\n', 1, 0, '2025-02-28 06:28:22', '2025-02-28 06:28:22', NULL, NULL),
(796, 5, 1, 298, 'Program Outcome', '<ul>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">The Human Resource Management (HRM) course equips students with a comprehensive understanding of key HR functions, including recruitment, selection, performance management, compensation, training, and labor relations. Students will develop the ability to apply HR principles effectively in various organizational settings.</li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">Through this course, students will learn to align HR strategies with business objectives, ensuring that human capital contributes to overall organizational success. They will also gain insights into workforce planning, employee engagement, and leadership development, fostering a productive and motivated work environment.</li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">A strong emphasis is placed on legal and ethical considerations in HRM. Students will understand labor laws, workplace diversity, and ethical HR practices, enabling them to create fair and compliant policies. They will also explore employee relations, conflict resolution, and strategies to maintain a positive organizational culture.</li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">HR analytics and data-driven decision-making are integral parts of this course. Students will learn to use HR metrics, technology, and modern HR systems to analyze workforce trends and improve HR functions. Additionally, they will develop critical thinking and problem-solving skills essential for addressing HR challenges in a dynamic business environment.</li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">By the end of the course, students will be prepared to take on HR roles with confidence, equipped with the knowledge and skills necessary to manage human resources effectively. They will also cultivate a mindset of continuous learning, ensuring their adaptability in an ever-evolving HR landscape.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n', 1, 0, '2025-03-18 03:55:26', '2025-03-18 03:55:26', NULL, NULL),
(797, 1, 9, 245, 'Problem analysis', '<p>Identify, formulate, review research literature, and analyze complex engineering problems reaching substantiated conclusions using first principles of mathematics, natural sciences, and engineering sciences.</p>\r\n', 1, 0, '2025-04-18 08:32:12', '2025-04-18 08:32:12', NULL, NULL),
