(1, 1, '1', '4', '2023', '2023-10-19', 'demo', '<p>demo</p>\r\n', '2023-10-06-36-staff.png', '2023-10-06-41-staff.png', 0, 1, '2023-10-06 09:13:42', '2023-10-06 09:13:42', 0, 0),
(2, 1, '1', '4', '2023', '2023-09-30', 'ANDROID APPLICATION MODULE-1', '<p><strong>&nbsp;&quot;ANDROID APPLICATION MODULE-1&quot;</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>In the era of smartphone, Computer * IT students need to upgrade with new technologies available in markets. So we introduce ANDROID as Skill Development Program. This Module includes Java Concepts, Introduction to Android, Application Structure, Basic UI Design, Preferences, Intents &amp; UI design for learning for students.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n', '2023-10-13-57-android.png', '2023-10-13-34-report1.pdf', 1, 0, '2023-10-13 10:46:06', '2023-10-13 10:46:06', 0, 0),
(3, 1, '1', '4', '2023', '2023-10-21', 'Android Application Module -2', '<p><strong>&quot;Android Application Module- 2&quot;</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>In the era of smartphone, Computer * IT students need to upgrade with new technologies available in markets. So we introduce ANDROID as Skill Development Program. This Module includes Content Providers, Adapters and Widgets, Notifications, Threads &amp; Advanced concepts of Android.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n', '2023-10-13-14-android2.png', '2023-10-13-33-report2.pdf', 1, 0, '2023-10-13 11:17:50', '2023-10-13 11:17:50', 0, 0),
(4, 1, '5', '25', '2023', '2023-10-21', 'PHP Module -1 (PHP Basics)', '<p><strong>&quot;PHP Module-1 (PHP Basics)&quot;</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>PHP (recursive acronym for PHP: Hypertext Preprocessor) is a widely-used open source general-purpose scripting language that is especially suited for web development and can be embedded into HTML. This module includes basics of PHP.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n', '2023-10-14-26-php1.png', '2024-01-15-27-2024-01-12-97-PHP.docx', 1, 0, '2023-10-14 05:03:09', '2023-10-14 05:03:09', 0, 0),
(5, 8, '1', '89', '2023', '2023-10-07', 'Web Development', '<p>Skills and Knowledge are the driving forces of economic growth and<br />\r\nsocial development of country. The main and important objective of<br />\r\nexecuting/conducting Skill Development Program is to contribute to the<br />\r\ndevelopment of Students skills various trades/skills, enable them to up lift<br />\r\ntheir economic status.<br />\r\nProfessional Skill development program especially focuses on developing<br />\r\nthe soft skills essential for the students to have a progressive career</p>\r\n', '2023-12-14-14-F1.jpg', '2023-12-14-25-Skil_devlopment_BCA1(G)_07_10_2023.docx.pdf', 1, 0, '2023-12-14 08:47:52', '2023-12-14 08:47:52', 0, 0),
(6, 1, '1', '4', '2023', '2023-09-02', 'Python', '<p><strong>Python has a simple syntax similar to the English language</strong>. Python has syntax that allows developers to write programs with fewer lines than some other programming languages. Python runs on an interpreter system, meaning that code can be executed as soon as it is written. This means that prototyping can be very quick.</p>\r\n', '2024-01-02-77-python.png', '2024-01-02-87-python.pdf', 0, 1, '2024-01-02 05:54:15', '2024-01-02 05:54:15', 0, 0),
(7, 1, '5', '4', '2023', '2023-10-21', 'PHP Module -1 (PHP Basics)', '<p><strong>&quot;PHP Module-1 (PHP Basics)&quot;</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>PHP (recursive acronym for PHP: Hypertext Preprocessor) is a widely-used open source general-purpose scripting language that is especially suited for web development and can be embedded into HTML. This module includes basics of PHP.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n', '2024-01-05-98-download.png', '2024-01-05-17-SDP for 3rd diploma.pdf', 0, 1, '2024-01-05 06:20:31', '2024-01-05 06:20:31', 0, 0),
(8, 1, '5', '4', '2023', '2023-10-21', 'PHP Module -1 (PHP Basics)', '<p><strong>&quot;PHP Module-1 (PHP Basics)&quot;</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>PHP (recursive acronym for PHP: Hypertext Preprocessor) is a widely-used open source general-purpose scripting language that is especially suited for web development and can be embedded into HTML. This module includes basics of PHP.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n', '2024-01-05-18-download.png', '2024-01-05-11-SDP for 3rd diploma.pdf', 0, 1, '2024-01-05 09:26:14', '2024-01-05 09:26:14', 0, 0),
(9, 1, '1', '4', '2023', '2023-08-09', 'python', '<p>Arrange SDP of B tech genius batch on dated 19/8/2023. Then main topics are why python use in market, market value of python, install python, syntax of python programming, print hello message,<br />\r\ncondition and loop.</p>\r\n', '2024-01-05-36-python.png', '2024-01-05-33-sdp.pdf', 1, 0, '2024-01-05 10:09:14', '2024-01-05 10:09:14', 0, 0),
(10, 2, '1', '119', '2023', '2023-09-25', 'Rangoli Competition on World Pharamcist Day', '<p>On occasion of World Pharmacist Day, Gyanmanjari Pharamcy College, Bhavnagar organized rangoli competition at Aditya auditorium on 25<sup>rd</sup>&nbsp;September 2023 with an intention to create awareness on role of Pharmacist and his/her importance in public health services and motivate the students.</p>\r\n', '2024-01-12-80-WhatsApp Image 2023-09-26 at 3.12.08 PM.jpeg', '2024-01-12-71-pharmacist day 2k23_231221_150525.pdf', 1, 0, '2024-01-12 03:54:55', '2024-01-12 03:54:55', 0, 0),
(11, 1, '5', '6', '2024', '2024-01-12', 'test', '<p>test&nbsp;</p>\r\n', '2024-01-12-20-2023-10-06-45-IOS1.webp', '2024-01-12-24-New Microsoft Word Document.docx', 0, 1, '2024-01-12 05:47:56', '2024-01-12 05:47:56', 0, 0),
(12, 1, '1', '6', '2023', '2023-01-02', 'ANDROID APPLICATION MODULE - 1', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\">In the era of smartphone, Computer * IT students need to upgrade with new technologies available in markets. So we introduce ANDROID as Skill Development Program. This Module includes Java Concepts, Introduction to Android, Application Structure, Basic UI Design, Preferences, Intents &amp; UI design for learning for students.</p>\r\n', '2024-01-12-31-2023-10-13-57-android.webp', '2024-01-12-63-2023-10-13-34-report1.pdf', 1, 0, '2024-01-12 15:57:54', '2024-01-12 15:57:54', 0, 0),
(13, 1, '1', '6', '2023', '2023-06-05', 'Android Application Module - 2', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\">In the era of smartphone, Computer * IT students need to upgrade with new technologies available in markets. So we introduce ANDROID as Skill Development Program. This Module includes Content Providers, Adapters and Widgets, Notifications, Threads &amp; Advanced concepts of Android.</p>\r\n', '2024-01-12-79-2023-10-13-14-android2.webp', '2024-01-12-94-2023-10-13-33-report2.pdf', 1, 0, '2024-01-12 15:59:24', '2024-01-12 15:59:24', 0, 0),
(14, 1, '1', '6', '2022', '2022-01-03', 'PHP - Module 1', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\">PHP (Hypertext Preprocessor) is a server-side scripting language commonly used for web development. It enables dynamic content generation, database interactions, and supports various frameworks. PHP code is embedded within HTML, facilitating seamless integration with web pages, and it is known for its simplicity and wide community support in building dynamic websites.</p>\r\n', '2024-01-12-79-download.jpg', '2024-01-12-97-PHP Module 1.pdf', 1, 0, '2024-01-12 16:03:23', '2024-01-12 16:03:23', 0, 0),
(15, 1, '1', '6', '2022', '2022-06-06', 'PHP - Module 2', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\">PHP, an advanced server-side scripting language, excels in building dynamic and scalable web applications. Its modern features include support for namespaces, traits, and anonymous classes, fostering modular code structures. Coupled with robust frameworks like Laravel, it facilitates secure authentication, RESTful APIs, and efficient ORM, ensuring high-performance, maintainable, and feature-rich applications.</p>\r\n', '2024-01-12-26-download.png', '2024-01-12-12-PHP Module 2.pdf', 1, 0, '2024-01-12 16:05:59', '2024-01-12 16:05:59', 0, 0),
(16, 1, '1', '6', '2023', '2023-01-02', 'PHP - Module 3', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\">WordPress, a powerful content management system (CMS), empowers users to create and manage websites effortlessly. Renowned for its user-friendly interface and extensive plugin ecosystem, WordPress accommodates diverse needs. It supports themes for design flexibility, making it the leading choice for bloggers, businesses, and developers seeking a scalable and customizable web solution.</p>\r\n', '2024-01-12-26-download (1).png', '2024-01-12-38-PHP Module 3.pdf', 1, 0, '2024-01-12 16:08:21', '2024-01-12 16:08:21', 0, 0),
(17, 1, '1', '6', '2023', '2023-06-05', 'PHP - Module 4', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\">CodeIgniter, a lightweight PHP framework, accelerates web application development with a minimal footprint. Known for its speed and simplicity, it emphasizes MVC architecture, providing robust features like database abstraction and built-in security tools. CodeIgniter fosters rapid development, making it a preferred choice for developers seeking efficiency and flexibility in creating scalable web applications.</p>\r\n', '2024-01-12-13-download (1).jpg', '2024-01-12-95-PHP Module 4.pdf', 1, 0, '2024-01-12 16:10:33', '2024-01-12 16:10:33', 0, 0),
(18, 1, '1', '6', '2023', '2023-01-02', 'PHP - Module 5', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\">Laravel, a sophisticated PHP framework, revolutionizes web development with an elegant syntax and powerful features. Embracing the MVC pattern, it facilitates code organization and scalability. Laravel offers a rich ecosystem, including an ORM, Blade templating engine, and artisan command-line tools, making it a preferred choice for crafting modern, secure, and efficient web applications.</p>\r\n', '2024-01-12-56-images.jpg', '2024-01-12-76-PHP Module 5.pdf', 1, 0, '2024-01-12 16:12:54', '2024-01-12 16:12:54', 0, 0),
(19, 1, '5', '25', '2023', '2023-09-21', 'Skill Development Program', '<p>Skill Development Program is a technical activity in which the students are taught some extra technical activities apart from their regular academic subjects</p>\r\n', '2024-01-13-33-WhatsApp Image 2024-01-13 at 3.00.47 PM.jpeg', '2024-01-13-28-SDP for 3rd diploma.docx', 1, 0, '2024-01-13 09:45:32', '2024-01-13 09:45:32', 0, 0),
(20, 1, '1', '2', '2023', '2023-10-10', 'Workshop on Integration of fusion 360 with Design of Machine Elements subject', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><span style=\"color:#020202\">This course provides the fundamentals of all the tools of Fusion 360 to create 3 dimensional model with mechanisms.</span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"fo', '2024-01-13-78-IMG-20231010-WA0032.jpg', '2024-01-13-63-Report for Onine SDP on Fusion 360 - DME.docx', 1, 0, '2024-01-13 11:56:06', '2024-01-13 11:56:06', 0, 0),
(21, 1, '5', '22', '2023', '2023-10-10', 'Workshop on Integration of fusion 360 with Design of Machine Elements subject.', '<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">This course provides the fundamentals of all the tools of Fusion 360 to create 3 dimensional model with mechanisms.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Some Exercise have also been given to students to prepare some models by using fusion 360 which are the real models of the Elements from Machine Design Subject.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">After completion of the course, students have been able to design their product from idea to protot', '2024-01-13-12-IMG-20231010-WA0032.jpg', '2024-01-13-57-Report for Onine SDP on Fusion 360 - DME.docx', 1, 0, '2024-01-13 11:57:49', '2024-01-13 11:57:49', 0, 0),
(22, 1, '9', '243', '2023', '2023-10-10', 'Workshop on Integration of fusion 360 with Design of Machine Elements subject', '<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">This course provides the fundamentals of all the tools of Fusion 360 to create 3 dimensional model with mechanisms.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Some Exercise have also been given to students to prepare some models by using fusion 360 which are the real models of the Elements from Machine Design Subject.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">After completion of the course, students have been able to design their product from idea to protot', '2024-01-13-80-IMG-20231010-WA0032.jpg', '2024-01-13-64-Report for Onine SDP on Fusion 360 - DME.docx', 1, 0, '2024-01-13 11:58:37', '2024-01-13 11:58:37', 0, 0),
(23, 1, '12', '254', '2023', '2023-10-10', 'Workshop on Integration of fusion 360 with Design of Machine Elements subject', '<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">This course provides the fundamentals of all the tools of Fusion 360 to create 3 dimensional model with mechanisms.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Some Exercise have also been given to students to prepare some models by using fusion 360 which are the real models of the Elements from Machine Design Subject.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">After completion of the course, students have been able to design their product from idea to protot', '2024-01-13-32-IMG-20231010-WA0032.jpg', '2024-01-13-49-Report for Onine SDP on Fusion 360 - DME.docx', 1, 0, '2024-01-13 11:59:25', '2024-01-13 11:59:25', 0, 0),
(24, 1, '5', '23', '2023', '2023-08-19', 'HTML - CSS Module 1', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\">This diploma-level course introduces students to the fundamental principles of HTML and CSS for web development. Covering basic and intermediate topics, participants will gain hands-on experience in creating well-structured web pages, responsive designs, and engaging user interfaces. Practical projects and assessments ensure a thorough understanding of essential web development skills.</p>\r\n', '2024-01-14-35-WhatsApp Image 2023-08-19 at 10.26.20 AM.jpg', '2024-01-14-10-HTML - CSS Module 1.pdf', 1, 0, '2024-01-14 08:43:53', '2024-01-14 08:43:53', 0, 0),
(25, 6, '1', '74', '2023', '2023-07-20', 'Student Orientation Program', '', '2024-01-16-45-Screenshot 2024-01-16 152656.png', '2024-01-16-85-Screenshot 2024-01-16 152656.png', 1, 0, '2024-01-16 09:57:16', '2024-01-16 09:57:16', 0, 0),
(26, 3, '1', '38', '2023', '2023-08-23', 'SDP on MSDS', '<h1 style=\"margin-left:29px; text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"color:black\">Skill development programs have been done in B.Sc</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:black\">semsters on 23/08/2023 and about 50-60 students were present in this SDP.</span> </span></span></h1>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n', '2024-01-16-12-Capture.PNG', '2024-01-16-59-SDP on MSDS.pdf', 1, 0, '2024-01-16 10:27:39', '2024-01-16 10:27:39', 0, 0),
(27, 3, '1', '40', '2023', '2023-08-23', 'SDP on MSDS', '<p style=\"margin-left:29px; text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:black\">Skill development programs have been done in B.Sc.</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:black\">semsters on 23/08/2023 and about 50-60 students were present in this SDP.</span> </span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:29px; text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n', '2024-01-16-60-Capture.PNG', '2024-01-16-16-SDP on MSDS.pdf', 1, 0, '2024-01-16 10:29:27', '2024-01-16 10:29:27', 0, 0),
(28, 3, '2', '48', '2023', '2023-08-23', 'Professional guidance &amp; development', '<div style=\"margin-left:29px; margin-top:8px; text-align:left; text-indent:-.3in\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"color:black\">Professional career guidance&nbsp; lecture have been taken in M.Sc on 23/08/2023 about 60 students were present in this lecture.</span></span></span></div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"margin-left:29px; margin-top:8px; text-align:left; text-indent:-.3in\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n', '2024-01-16-59-msc micro.PNG', '2024-01-16-29-professional guidance.pdf', 1, 0, '2024-01-16 10:31:17', '2024-01-16 10:31:17', 0, 0),
(29, 3, '2', '49', '2023', '2023-08-23', 'Professional guidance &amp; development', '<div style=\"margin-left:29px; margin-top:8px; text-align:left; text-indent:-.3in\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"color:black\">Professional career guidance&nbsp; lecture have been taken in M.Sc on 23/08/2023 about 60 students were present in this lecture.</span></span></span></div>\r\n', '2024-01-16-88-msc micro.PNG', '2024-01-16-22-professional guidance.pdf', 1, 0, '2024-01-16 10:33:51', '2024-01-16 10:33:51', 0, 0),
(30, 3, '1', '38', '2023', '2023-08-24', 'Managerial Skill Enhancement', '<p><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"background-color:white\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\"><span style=\"color:#222222\">Managerial skills can be defined as certain abilities that a manager/executive should possess in order to fulfill specific tasks in an organization.From the very beginning of the development of management thought, both management practitioners and researchers have emphasized different skills for man', '2024-01-16-75-e1.PNG', '2024-01-16-35-Managerial skill enhancement activity.pdf', 1, 0, '2024-01-16 11:04:24', '2024-01-16 11:04:24', 0, 0),
