(48, 1, '5', '24', '2023', '2023-10-14', 'Parent Teacher Meeting', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">The Department of Electrical Engineering had organized the parent- teacher meeting for diploma engineering students. It was organized on October 14, 2023 (Saturday). This meeting proved to be very helpful to parents as well as students along with the professors to interact with the parents thereby keep the track record of the st', '2024-01-17-78-1.jpg', '2024-01-17-49-PTM_report_DIP (1).pdf', 1, 0, '2024-01-17 06:49:15', '2024-01-17 06:49:15', 0, 0),
(49, 1, '5', '24', '2023', '2023-10-19', 'Poster Presentation', '<p style=\"list-style-type:none\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><strong><span dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt\"><span style=\"color:#212121\">Event Title</span></span></strong><span dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt\"><span style=\"color:#212121\">: </span></span><span dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt\"><span style=\"color:#212121\">Posto- E-scrap war</span></span></span></p>\r\n', '2024-01-17-98-3.jpg', '2024-01-17-68-EVENTS (1).pdf', 1, 0, '2024-01-17 06:59:10', '2024-01-17 06:59:10', 0, 0),
(50, 1, '5', '24', '2023', '2023-10-19', 'Brainstorming', '<p><span dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">The event was basically a brainstorming session in which participants were divided into teams.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">Problems will be given to the&nbsp; team and they have to give a solution . List of problems ( 2 or 3 informed in advance )</s', '2024-01-17-48-5.jpg', '2024-01-17-18-EVENTS (1).pdf', 1, 0, '2024-01-17 07:00:40', '2024-01-17 07:00:40', 0, 0),
(51, 1, '1', '2', '2022', '2022-10-10', 'MODULE 1: AUTOCAD FOUNDATION', '<ul>\r\n	<li>The objective of this short term course is to understand the functionality of the AutoCAD software, itsusefulness in Engineering Drawing and real life object designing whereby students will get a direction to shape out his own imagination.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n', '2024-01-17-89-m11.png', '2024-01-17-69-m1autocad_foundation.pdf', 1, 0, '2024-01-17 07:16:24', '2024-01-17 07:16:24', 0, 0),
(52, 1, '1', '2', '2022', '2022-10-10', 'MODULE 2: AUTOCAD 2D ADVANCE', '<ul>\r\n	<li>The objective of this short term course is to understand the functionality of the AutoCAD software, itsusefulness in Engineering Drawing and real life object designing whereby students will get a direction to shape out his own imagination.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n', '2024-01-17-85-m11.png', '2024-01-17-96-m2autocad_2dadvance.pdf', 1, 0, '2024-01-17 07:18:54', '2024-01-17 07:18:54', 0, 0),
(53, 1, '1', '2', '2022', '2022-10-10', 'MODULE 3: AUTOCAD 3D FOUNDATION', '<ul>\r\n	<li>The objective of this short term course is to understand the functionality of the AutoCAD software, itsusefulness in Engineering Drawing and real life object designing whereby students will get a direction to shape out his own imagination. At present and in future it will be desirable additional qualifications for good opening in industry.Modern CAD skills to place you ahead of the competition in this fast-growing industry.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n', '2024-01-17-66-m31.png', '2024-01-17-22-m3autocad_3dfoundation.pdf', 1, 0, '2024-01-17 07:20:06', '2024-01-17 07:20:06', 0, 0),
(54, 1, '1', '2', '2022', '2022-10-10', 'MODULE 4: AUTOCAD 3D ADVANCE', '<ul>\r\n	<li>To understand the functionality of the AutoCAD software, its usefulness in Engineering Drawing and real life object designing whereby students will get a direction to shape out his own imagination. Course Includes Rendor Effect, Visual Effects, Text, Use of Camera,Print Setup, Practice of 3d Drawing.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n', '2024-01-17-93-m41.png', '2024-01-17-55-m4autocad_3dadvance.pdf', 1, 0, '2024-01-17 07:20:44', '2024-01-17 07:20:44', 0, 0),
(55, 1, '1', '2', '2023', '2023-03-21', 'BLENDER', '<ul>\r\n	<li>This course includers Blender Interface, Modelling in Blender, understand various modifiers and their use and rendering of design or video.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n', '2024-01-17-29-blender.jpg', '2024-01-17-12-Blender_SDP course content.pdf', 1, 0, '2024-01-17 07:21:42', '2024-01-17 07:21:42', 0, 0),
(56, 1, '1', '2', '2023', '2023-08-21', 'CNC PROGRAMMING', '<p>The objective of this short term course is to understand the functionality of the CNC, its usefulness in Manufacturing and real part producing whereby students will get a direction to make any product using CNC by programming. Student can able to know the function of CNC and can be aware about various types of tool and work holding devices like jig and fixtures.&nbsp;Students can be aware about various kinds of CNC cutters.&nbsp;</p>\r\n', '2024-01-17-37-cnc.jpg', '2024-01-17-37-CNC_SDP course content.pdf', 1, 0, '2024-01-17 07:23:40', '2024-01-17 07:23:40', 0, 0),
(57, 1, '1', '2', '2023', '2023-09-27', 'GEOMETRIC DIMENSIONING AND TOLERANCES', '<ul>\r\n	<li>Course objective is to learn basic principles and building blocks of GD&amp;T and to appreciate the merits of GD&amp;T and how it complements conventional Tolerancing methods. Also to be able to read, specify and interpret GD&amp;T language.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n', '2024-01-17-15-GEO.jpg', '2024-01-17-90-Geometric Dimensioning and Tolerances_SDP course content.pdf', 1, 0, '2024-01-17 07:24:29', '2024-01-17 07:24:29', 0, 0),
(58, 1, '1', '2', '2023', '2023-10-09', 'INTERNET OF THINGS', '<ul>\r\n	<li>Objective of this SDP is to understand fundamentals of IoT and Home Automation and to learn about various application of IoT in Automation, Safety or other day to day requirement, to obtain certain sensor values from any distant location for various applications.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n', '2024-01-17-83-iot.jpg', '2024-01-17-80-IoT_SDP course content_.pdf', 1, 0, '2024-01-17 07:25:36', '2024-01-17 07:25:36', 0, 0),
(59, 1, '1', '2', '2023', '2023-10-23', 'MATLAB', '<ul>\r\n	<li>Objective of this SDP is to understand fundamentals of MATLAB and its usefulness in engineering programming &amp; simulation through mathematical matrices. It can serve as the platform for all yout technical computing needs. It integrates mathematical computing, visualization and a powerful technical language.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n', '2024-01-17-21-matlab.jpg', '2024-01-17-77-MATLAB_SDP course content_.pdf', 1, 0, '2024-01-17 07:27:35', '2024-01-17 07:27:35', 0, 0),
(60, 1, '1', '2', '2022', '2022-10-10', 'NDT - NON DESTRUCTIVE TESTING', '<ul>\r\n	<li>Objective of this SDP is to understand different methods of NDTs. ie. die panetration testing, magnetic particle testing etc. Its usefulness im the field of quality control of the industrial product which can be analyzed without rupture of material.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n', '2024-01-17-77-ndt.jpg', '2024-01-17-52-NDT_SDP course content.pdf', 1, 0, '2024-01-17 07:28:48', '2024-01-17 07:28:48', 0, 0),
(61, 1, '1', '2', '2023', '2023-10-16', 'WELDING TECHNOLOGY', '<ul>\r\n	<li>learn about various welding technology like arc welding, TIG welding, MIG welding, submerged arc welding also to know about various parameters in welding technology. In this course you can learn various positions of welding and various defects in welding technology.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n', '2024-01-17-74-welding.jpg', '2024-01-17-37-Welding_SDP course content.pdf', 1, 0, '2024-01-17 07:30:47', '2024-01-17 07:30:47', 0, 0),
(62, 1, '1', '2', '2023', '2023-03-20', 'ADVANCED ENGINEERING DRAWING TECHNOLOGY', '<ul>\r\n	<li>reference document is the drawing of components/assemblies to be manufactured. In this context, it is of utmost priority to prepare, read and interpret these drawings correctly for production of components and assemblies accurately and precisely. The industrial practices of drafting are also important for the students to make them aware of drafting practices, symbols, codes, norms and standards generally used in industries.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n', '2024-01-17-27-advancedrawing.jpg', '2024-01-17-80-Advance Engineering Drawing_TSEP course content_.pdf', 1, 0, '2024-01-17 07:31:50', '2024-01-17 07:31:50', 0, 0),
(63, 1, '5', '22', '2022', '2022-10-10', 'MODULE 1: AUTOCAD FOUNDATION', '<ul>\r\n	<li>The objective of this short term course is to understand the functionality of the AutoCAD software, itsusefulness in Engineering Drawing and real life object designing whereby students will get a direction to shape out his own imagination.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n', '2024-01-17-18-m11.png', '2024-01-17-69-m1autocad_foundation.pdf', 1, 0, '2024-01-17 07:34:01', '2024-01-17 07:34:01', 0, 0),
