(124, 1, '1', '5', '2023', '2023-09-30', 'ANDROID APPLICATION MODULE-1', '<p><strong>&nbsp;&quot;ANDROID APPLICATION MODULE-1&quot;</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>In the era of smartphone, Computer * IT students need to upgrade with new technologies available in markets. So we introduce ANDROID as Skill Development Program. This Module includes Java Concepts, Introduction to Android, Application Structure, Basic UI Design, Preferences, Intents &amp; UI design for learning for students.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n', '2024-03-07-14-sdp.png', '2024-03-07-48-2023-10-13-34-report1.pdf', 1, 0, '2024-03-07 08:02:56', '2024-03-07 08:02:56', 0, 0),
(125, 1, '1', '5', '2023', '2023-10-21', 'Android Application Module -2', '<p><strong>&quot;Android Application Module- 2&quot;</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>In the era of smartphone, Computer * IT students need to upgrade with new technologies available in markets. So we introduce ANDROID as Skill Development Program. This Module includes Content Providers, Adapters and Widgets, Notifications, Threads &amp; Advanced concepts of Android.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n', '2024-03-07-38-sdp2.png', '2024-03-07-53-2023-10-13-33-report2.pdf', 1, 0, '2024-03-07 08:06:08', '2024-03-07 08:06:08', 0, 0),
