(133, 1, '1', '3', '2023', '2023-02-19', 'STRESS RELIEF ACTIVITY', '<p>This activity proved to be very helpful to students regarding maintaining of stress along with the studies in the academics. Students were motivitated to balance the studies along with the academics in their regular life. Various indoor activites were carried out and students are involved in each of activities. Effective stress management helps you break the hold stress has on your life, so you can be happier, healthier, and more productive.</p>\r\n', '2024-12-03-24-stress relif.webp', '2024-12-03-74-2024-03-12-83-Stress relief activity Electrical Even Sem.pdf', 1, 0, '2024-12-03 09:43:08', '2024-12-03 09:43:08', 0, 0),
