(142, 1, '1', '3', '2024', '2024-12-23', 'Sponsored Workshop on “Electric Vehicle', '<p><br />\r\nA WORKSHOP is conducted for EV awareness workshops in five different cities as part of the &ldquo;GO ELECTRIC&rdquo; Campaign, in collaboration with the Gujarat Energy Development Agency (GEDA). Contentcovered Introduction to EVs, EV types, comparison of EVs with ICE vehicles, Charging Techniques, Policy Understanding, Financial Calculations and Consumer Benefits</p>\r\n', '2025-01-07-85-Capture ev2.JPG', '2025-01-07-18-electric vehicle workshop  REPORT (1).pdf', 1, 0, '2025-01-07 05:23:54', '2025-01-07 05:23:54', 0, 0),
