(151, 1, '1', '290', '2024', '2024-09-07', 'MODULE 1: AUTOCAD FOUNDATION', '<p>The objective of this short term course is to understand the functionality of the AutoCAD software, itsusefulness in Engineering Drawing and real life object designing whereby students will get a direction to shape out his own imagination.</p>\r\n', '2025-01-25-64-m11.png', '2025-01-25-26-m1autocad_foundation.pdf', 1, 0, '2025-01-25 09:21:23', '2025-01-25 09:21:23', 0, 0),
(152, 1, '1', '290', '2024', '2024-09-07', 'MODULE 2: AUTOCAD 2D ADVANCE', '<p>The objective of this short term course is to understand the functionality of the AutoCAD software, itsusefulness in Engineering Drawing and real life object designing whereby students will get a direction to shape out his own imagination.</p>\r\n', '2025-01-25-72-m11.png', '2025-01-25-84-m2autocad_2dadvance.pdf', 1, 0, '2025-01-25 09:22:18', '2025-01-25 09:22:18', 0, 0),
(153, 1, '1', '290', '2024', '2024-09-07', 'MODULE 3: AUTOCAD 3D FOUNDATION', '<p>The objective of this short term course is to understand the functionality of the AutoCAD software, itsusefulness in Engineering Drawing and real life object designing whereby students will get a direction to shape out his own imagination. At present and in future it will be desirable additional qualifications for good opening in industry.Modern CAD skills to place you ahead of the competition in this fast-growing industry.</p>\r\n', '2025-01-25-64-m31.png', '2025-01-25-49-m3autocad_3dfoundation.pdf', 1, 0, '2025-01-25 09:23:28', '2025-01-25 09:23:28', 0, 0),
(154, 1, '1', '290', '2024', '2024-09-07', 'MODULE 4: AUTOCAD 3D ADVANCE', '<p>To understand the functionality of the AutoCAD software, its usefulness in Engineering Drawing and real life object designing whereby students will get a direction to shape out his own imagination. Course Includes Rendor Effect, Visual Effects, Text, Use of Camera,Print Setup, Practice of 3d Drawing.</p>\r\n', '2025-01-25-21-m41.png', '2025-01-25-61-m4autocad_3dadvance.pdf', 1, 0, '2025-01-25 09:24:31', '2025-01-25 09:24:31', 0, 0),
(155, 1, '1', '290', '2024', '2024-09-14', 'BLENDER', '<p>This course includers Blender Interface, Modelling in Blender, understand various modifiers and their use and rendering of design or video.</p>\r\n', '2025-01-25-94-blender.jpg', '2025-01-25-88-Blender_SDP course content.pdf', 1, 0, '2025-01-25 09:28:00', '2025-01-25 09:28:00', 0, 0),
(156, 1, '1', '290', '2024', '2024-09-21', 'MATLAB', '<p>Objective of this SDP is to understand fundamentals of MATLAB and its usefulness in engineering programming &amp; simulation through mathematical matrices. It can serve as the platform for all yout technical computing needs. It integrates mathematical computing, visualization and a powerful technical language.</p>\r\n', '2025-01-25-28-matlab.jpg', '2025-01-25-97-MATLAB_SDP course content_.pdf', 1, 0, '2025-01-25 09:33:50', '2025-01-25 09:33:50', 0, 0),
(157, 8, '1', '89', '2025', '2025-01-25', 'Web Development using Wordpress', '<p>A Skill Development Program is designed to enhance the abilities, knowledge, and competencies of<br />\r\nindividuals, particularly in the workforce or educational contexts. These programs can focus on<br />\r\nvarious aspects such as technical skills, soft skills, leadership, or industry-specific expertise. The goal<br />\r\nis to improve employability, productivity, and personal growth.</p>\r\n', '2025-01-31-82-a7757952-8adb-4f7f-9b8c-ceef476b8a44.jpeg', '2025-01-31-93-SDP.pdf', 1, 0, '2025-01-31 11:16:54', '2025-01-31 11:16:54', 0, 0),
(158, 1, '5', '25', '2025', '2025-02-04', 'Search Engine Optimization &amp; Website Audit Report', '<p>The Student Development Program (SDP) on SEO &amp; Website Audit Report for the 6th Diploma Genius Class aimed to equip students with practical knowledge of Search Engine Optimization (SEO) techniques and the importance of website auditing in digital marketing. The session focused on enhancing students&#39; understanding of on-page and off-page SEO, technical SEO, keyword research, backlink analysis, and website performance evaluation. By learning these essential skills, students gained insig', '2025-02-06-80-6th diploma.JPG', '2025-02-06-50-SDP Session 6th Diploma Genius.pdf', 1, 0, '2025-02-06 07:24:44', '2025-02-06 07:24:44', 0, 0),
(159, 1, '5', '25', '2025', '2025-02-08', 'Search Engine Optimization &amp; On Page SEO', '<p>In the SDP (Student Development Programme) session for 6th Diploma Genius Class A, I provided insights into essential On-Page SEO techniques to enhance website visibility and search engine rankings. The session covered key concepts such as Alt tags for images, the importance of hyperlinks, identifying and fixing 404 error links, structuring content using H1 to H6 headings, and optimizing Meta Titles &amp; Meta Descriptions for better search performance. This knowledge equips students with pra', '2025-02-24-87-SEO.PNG', '2025-02-24-100-08-Feb-2025 SDP Session 6th Diploma Genius Class A.pdf', 1, 0, '2025-02-24 05:39:04', '2025-02-24 05:39:04', 0, 0),
(160, 1, '5', '25', '2025', '2025-02-04', 'Search Engine Optimization &amp; Website Audit Report', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">The Student Development Program (SDP) on SEO &amp; Website Audit Report for the 6th Diploma Genius Class aimed to equip students with practical knowledge of Search Engine Optimization (SEO) techniques and the importance of website auditing in digital marketing. The session focused ', '2025-02-24-17-SEO.PNG', '2025-02-24-53-SD session.pdf', 1, 0, '2025-02-24 05:56:12', '2025-02-24 05:56:12', 0, 0),
