(164, 1, '5', '23', '2025', '2025-02-18', 'International Relation Cell', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\">Mr. Japan Mavani is a highly motivated and visionary academician serving as a Lecturer in the Department of Information Technology at Gyanmanjari Innovative University. With a rich blend of technical knowledge, academic experience, and student-centered mentoring, Mr. Mavani has made significant contributions to curriculum development, textbook authorship, and co-curricular planning within the department. He has been instrumental in designing syllabi that align with ', '2025-05-10-88-18-02-2025_4th-Diploma_Leeds-beckett-University-wtout-attendance_page-0005.jpg', '2025-05-10-29-18-02-2025_4th-Diploma_Leeds-beckett-University-wtout-attendance.pdf', 1, 0, '2025-05-10 10:34:33', '2025-05-10 10:34:33', 0, 0),
