(184, 1, '1', '3', '2025', '2025-09-01', '“Transforming Teaching: Flipped Classroom Experience””', '<p>Introduction<br />\r\nFlipped Classroom is an innovative teaching methodology that reverses the<br />\r\ntraditional learning environment. In this approach, students review instructional<br />\r\ncontent at home (through videos, reading materials, or presentations) and engage in<br />\r\ninteractive, problem-solving, and discussion-based activities in the classroom. This<br />\r\nmethod encourages active learning, critical thinking, and student engagement.<br />\r\nOutcomes<br />\r\n&bull; Students demonst', '2025-11-27-15-20250901_24614pmByGPSMapCamera.jpg', '2025-11-27-54-26. Flipped class_Diploma_(EE)_(3 & 5)_(16-09-2025).pdf', 1, 0, '2025-11-27 06:47:55', '2025-11-27 06:47:55', 0, 0),
(185, 1, '1', '212', '2025', '2025-09-29', '“Transforming Teaching: Flipped Classroom Experience””', '<p>Introduction<br />\r\nFlipped Classroom is an innovative teaching methodology that reverses the<br />\r\ntraditional learning environment. In this approach, students review instructional<br />\r\ncontent at home (through videos, reading materials, or presentations) and engage in<br />\r\ninteractive, problem-solving, and discussion-based activities in the classroom. This<br />\r\nmethod encourages active learning, critical thinking, and student engagement.<br />\r\nOutcomes<br />\r\n&bull; Students demonst', '2025-11-27-78-WhatsApp Image 2025-09-30 at 1.56.28 PM.jpeg', '2025-11-27-75-26. Flipped class_Diploma_(EE)_(3 & 5)_(16-09-2025).pdf', 1, 0, '2025-11-27 06:51:01', '2025-11-27 06:51:01', 0, 0),
(186, 1, '5', '24', '2025', '2025-09-30', 'Aptitude Test', '<p>Under the Training and Placement Activities (TPA), an Aptitude Test was successfully conducted for Diploma and Degree students of Electrical and EC on 30th September 2025. The objective of this activity was to enhance the students&rsquo; logical reasoning, problem-solving skills, and readiness for campus recruitment and competitive examinations.</p>\r\n', '2025-11-27-19-A2.jpg', '2025-11-27-27-Aptitude Test. Diploma.pdf', 1, 0, '2025-11-27 06:51:18', '2025-11-27 06:51:18', 0, 0),
(187, 1, '5', '24', '2025', '2025-09-01', '“Transforming Teaching: Flipped Classroom Experience”', '<p>Introduction<br />\r\nFlipped Classroom is an innovative teaching methodology that reverses the<br />\r\ntraditional learning environment. In this approach, students review instructional<br />\r\ncontent at home (through videos, reading materials, or presentations) and engage in<br />\r\ninteractive, problem-solving, and discussion-based activities in the classroom. This<br />\r\nmethod encourages active learning, critical thinking, and student engagement.<br />\r\nOutcomes<br />\r\n&bull; Students demonst', '2025-11-27-90-20250927_114248AMByGPSMapCamera.jpg', '2025-11-27-90-26. Flipped class_Diploma_(EE)_(3 & 5)_(16-09-2025).pdf', 1, 0, '2025-11-27 06:53:33', '2025-11-27 06:53:33', 0, 0),
(188, 1, '5', '213', '2025', '2025-09-30', 'Aptitude Test', '<h1><strong>Outcomes</strong></h1>\r\n\r\n<p>&bull;<span style=\"font-size:14px\"> Students gained exposure to aptitude-based problem-solving.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&bull; It helped students identify their strengths and areas for improvement.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&bull; Enhanced awareness of placement selection processes and competitive exam patterns.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&bull; Prepared&nbsp; students for upcoming campus recrui', '2025-11-27-43-A1.jpg', '2025-11-27-77-Aptitude Test. (1).pdf', 1, 0, '2025-11-27 06:54:15', '2025-11-27 06:54:15', 0, 0),
