(197, 1, '5', '24', '2025', '2025-08-18', 'Group Discussion', '<h1>Objective</h1>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif\">The Department of Electrical and EC Engineering organized a Group Discussion (GD) activity for diploma and degree students. The aim of this activity was to enhance students&rsquo; communication skills, teamwork, critical thinking, and confidence. Group discussion is one of the most effective tools for evaluating students&rsquo; personality, leadership quality, an', '2025-11-27-89-D2.jpg', '2025-11-27-32-11. (5) Group Discussion _Diploma(EE)_(1st 3rd & 5th)_(18-08-25).pdf', 1, 0, '2025-11-27 07:56:40', '2025-11-27 07:56:40', 0, 0),
