(199, 1, '1', '3', '2025', '2025-08-18', 'Group Discussion', '<h1>Objective</h1>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif\">The Department of Electrical and EC Engineering organized a Group Discussion (GD) activity for diploma and degree students. The aim of this activity was to enhance students&rsquo; communication skills, teamwork, critical thinking, and confidence. Group discussion is one of the most effective tools for evaluating students&rsquo; personality, leadership quality, and ability to express views ', '2025-11-27-36-D1.jpg', '2025-11-27-35-11. (5) Group Discussion _Degree(EE)_(3rd & 5th)_(18-08-25).pdf', 1, 0, '2025-11-27 08:01:27', '2025-11-27 08:01:27', 0, 0),
(200, 1, '1', '212', '2025', '2025-08-18', 'Objective The Department of Electrical and EC Engineering organized a Group Discussion (GD) activity', '<h1 style=\"text-align:justify\">Objective<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:11px\">The Department of Electrical and EC Engineering organized a Group Discussion (GD) activity for Diploma and Degree students. The aim of this activity was to enhance students&rsquo; communication skills, teamwork, critical thinking, and confidence. Group Discussion is one of the most effective tools for evaluating students&rsquo; personality, leadership quality, and ability to express views clearly in a group.</span></h1>', '2025-11-27-85-D1.jpg', '2025-11-27-61-11. (5) Group Discussion _Degree(EE)_(3rd & 5th)_(18-08-25).pdf', 1, 0, '2025-11-27 08:04:02', '2025-11-27 08:04:02', 0, 0),
(201, 26, '1', '365', '2025', '2025-10-10', 'RESUME BUILDING AND LINKEDIN PROFILE CREATION WORKSHOP', '', '2025-11-27-16-WORKSHOPE 2.jpeg', '2025-11-27-80-RESUME BUILDING AND LINKED IN PROFILE CREATION PROGRAM (1).docx', 1, 0, '2025-11-27 08:38:28', '2025-11-27 08:38:28', 0, 0),
(202, 1, '5', '24', '2025', '2025-07-25', 'Internship / Industrial Training', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><br />\r\nAs a part of the curriculum and practical skill enhancement program, diploma and degree students of Sem 3 and Sem 5 undertook two weeks of internship/industrial training during the month of July at various industries and organizations. The training aimed to expose students to real-world industrial environments and operational systems related to Electrical and electronics engineering.</p>\r\n', '2025-11-27-91-I2.jpg', '2025-11-27-19-14. Internship _ Industrial Training.pdf', 1, 0, '2025-11-27 09:16:37', '2025-11-27 09:16:37', 0, 0),
(203, 1, '5', '213', '2025', '2025-07-25', 'Internship / Industrial Training', '<p>As a part of the curriculum and practical skill enhancement program, Diploma and Degree students of Sem 3 and Sem 5 undertook two weeks of Internship / Industrial Training during the month of July at various industries and organizations. The training aimed to expose students to real-world industrial environments and operational systems related to Electrical and Electronics Engineering.</p>\r\n', '2025-11-27-21-I2.jpg', '2025-11-27-51-14. Internship _ Industrial Training.pdf', 1, 0, '2025-11-27 09:26:55', '2025-11-27 09:26:55', 0, 0),
(204, 1, '1', '3', '2025', '2025-07-25', 'Internship/ Industrial training', '<p>As a part of the curriculum and practical skill enhancement program, diploma and degree students of Sem 3 and Sem 5 undertook two weeks of internship/industrial training during the month of July at various industries and organizations. The training aimed to expose students to real-world industrial environments and operational systems related to electrical and electronics engineering.<br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n', '2025-11-27-39-I1.jpg', '2025-11-27-73-14. Internship _ Industrial Training.pdf', 1, 0, '2025-11-27 09:30:58', '2025-11-27 09:30:58', 0, 0),
(205, 1, '1', '212', '2025', '2025-07-25', 'Internship / Industrial Training', '<p>As a part of the curriculum and practical skill enhancement program, diploma and degree students of Sem 3 and Sem 5 undertook two weeks of internship/industrial training during the month of July at various industries and organizations. The training aimed to expose students to real-world industrial environments and operational systems related to electrical and electronics engineering.<br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n', '2025-11-27-21-I1.jpg', '2025-11-27-44-14. Internship _ Industrial Training.pdf', 1, 0, '2025-11-27 09:32:39', '2025-11-27 09:32:39', 0, 0),
(206, 1, '1', '3', '2025', '2025-07-18', 'Bridge Course Activity', '<p>The Bridge Course or Student Induction Program was conducted for 4 weeks at Gyanmanjari Innovative University from June 25, 2025, to July 18, 2025, for the students of B.Tech in Electrical Engineering and B.Tech in Electronics and Communication Engineering. This program plays a vital role in helping students transition smoothly from school to a professional engineering college environment. While entering higher education is an exciting journey, it also brings new responsibilities and academic', '2025-11-27-55-1750853603529.jpg', '2025-11-27-15-Bridge Course-B.Tech Electrical Report.pdf', 1, 0, '2025-11-27 09:43:04', '2025-11-27 09:43:04', 0, 0),
(207, 1, '1', '212', '2025', '2025-07-18', 'Bridge Course Activity', '<p>The Bridge Course or Student Induction Program was conducted for 4 weeks at Gyanmanjari Innovative University from June 25, 2025, to July 18, 2025, for the students of B.Tech in Electrical Engineering and B.Tech in Electronics and Communication Engineering. This program plays a vital role in helping students transition smoothly from school to a professional engineering college environment. While entering higher education is an exciting journey, it also brings new responsibilities and academic', '2025-11-27-37-1750853603578.jpg', '2025-11-27-56-Bridge Course-B.Tech Electrical Report.pdf', 1, 0, '2025-11-27 09:44:27', '2025-11-27 09:44:27', 0, 0),
(209, 1, '5', '24', '2025', '2025-07-11', 'Bridge Course Activity', '<p>The Bridge Course or Student Induction Program was conducted for 4 weeks at Gyanmanjari Innovative University from June 13, 2025, to July 11, 2025, specifically for the students of Diploma in Electrical Engineering and Diploma in Electronics and Communication Engineering. This Bridge Course plays a crucial role in ensuring a smooth transition from school to diploma-level technical education. While stepping into college is an exciting milestone for every student, it also brings along new chall', '2025-11-27-26-1750853603529.jpg', '2025-11-27-29-Bridge Course- Diploma Electrical Report.pdf', 1, 0, '2025-11-27 09:47:14', '2025-11-27 09:47:14', 0, 0),
(210, 1, '5', '213', '2025', '2025-07-11', 'Bridge Course Activity', '<p>The Bridge Course or Student Induction Program was conducted for 4 weeks at Gyanmanjari Innovative University from June 13, 2025, to July 11, 2025, specifically for the students of Diploma in Electrical Engineering and Diploma in Electronics and Communication Engineering. This Bridge Course plays a crucial role in ensuring a smooth transition from school to diploma-level technical education. While stepping into college is an exciting milestone for every student, it also brings along new chall', '2025-11-27-66-1750853603578.jpg', '2025-11-27-35-Bridge Course- Diploma Electrical Report.pdf', 1, 0, '2025-11-27 09:48:31', '2025-11-27 09:48:31', 0, 0),
(211, 1, '1', '3', '2025', '2025-09-15', 'Engineer’s Day Celebration_2025', '<p>The Department of Electrical and Electronics &amp; Communication Engineering at Gyanmanjari Innovative University celebrated Engineer&rsquo;s Day on 15th September, 2025 with great enthusiasm. The celebration was organized to honor the legacy and contributions of engineers in shaping society and to encourage students to showcase their innovative ideas and technical skills. As part of the activity, a Poster &amp; PPT presentation competition was conducted on the topics &ldquo;Renewable Energy ', '2025-11-27-39-IMG_20250915_120439.jpg', '2025-11-27-27-Celebration Engineer\'s Day.pdf', 1, 0, '2025-11-27 10:27:54', '2025-11-27 10:27:54', 0, 0),
(212, 1, '1', '212', '2025', '2025-07-15', 'Engineer’s Day Celebration_2025', '<p>Engineer&rsquo;s Day Celebration_2025 The Department of Electrical and Electronics &amp; Communication Engineering at Gyanmanjari Innovative University celebrated Engineer&rsquo;s Day on 15th September, 2025 with great enthusiasm. The celebration was organized to honor the legacy and contributions of engineers in shaping society and to encourage students to showcase their innovative ideas and technical skills. As part of the activity, a Poster &amp; PPT presentation competition was conducted ', '2025-11-27-61-IMG_20250915_120439.jpg', '2025-11-27-21-Celebration Engineer\'s Day.pdf', 1, 0, '2025-11-27 10:29:15', '2025-11-27 10:29:15', 0, 0),
(213, 1, '5', '24', '2025', '2025-09-15', 'Engineer’s Day Celebration_2025', '<p>The Department of Electrical and Electronics &amp; Communication Engineering at Gyanmanjari Innovative University celebrated Engineer&rsquo;s Day on 15th September, 2025 with great enthusiasm. The celebration was organized to honor the legacy and contributions of engineers in shaping society and to encourage students to showcase their innovative ideas and technical skills. As part of the activity, a Poster &amp; PPT presentation competition was conducted on the topics &ldquo;Renewable Energy ', '2025-11-27-42-20250915_102436AMByGPSMapCamera.jpg', '2025-11-27-100-Celebration Engineer\'s Day.pdf', 1, 0, '2025-11-27 10:31:00', '2025-11-27 10:31:00', 0, 0),
(214, 1, '5', '213', '2025', '2025-09-15', 'Engineer’s Day Celebration_2025', '<p>The Department of Electrical and Electronics &amp; Communication Engineering at Gyanmanjari Innovative University celebrated Engineer&rsquo;s Day on 15th September, 2025 with great enthusiasm. The celebration was organized to honor the legacy and contributions of engineers in shaping society and to encourage students to showcase their innovative ideas and technical skills. As part of the activity, a Poster &amp; PPT presentation competition was conducted on the topics &ldquo;Renewable Energy ', '2025-11-27-57-20250915_102436AMByGPSMapCamera.jpg', '2025-11-27-69-Celebration Engineer\'s Day.pdf', 1, 0, '2025-11-27 10:32:02', '2025-11-27 10:32:02', 0, 0),
(215, 1, '1', '1', '2025', '2025-10-10', 'Mock Interview', '<p>Mock interviews are conducted to help students prepare for real placement and job interview situations. These sessions simulate actual interview settings, allowing students to practice communication, problem-solving, and presentation skills. Feedback from experts helps them identify strengths and areas for improvement. Mock interviews boost confidence and equip students with the readiness needed to succeed in professional interviews.</p>\r\n', '2025-12-12-91-IMG_20251010_133635863_HDR (1).jpg', '2025-12-12-45-Associate (student chapter) Report B. TECH. ALL.pdf', 1, 0, '2025-12-12 10:04:29', '2025-12-12 10:04:29', 0, 0),
(216, 1, '5', '21', '2025', '2025-10-10', 'Mock Interview', '<p>Mock interviews are arranged to give students a realistic preview of actual job interviews. Through these practice sessions, students learn how to present themselves, answer questions effectively, and handle interview pressure. Professionals provide constructive feedback to help students improve their performance. These mock sessions build confidence and better prepare students for real recruitment processes.</p>\r\n', '2025-12-12-99-IMG_20251010_120910639_HDR.jpg', '2025-12-12-18-Expert talk Report DIPLOMA  ALL.pdf', 1, 0, '2025-12-12 10:10:18', '2025-12-12 10:10:18', 0, 0),
(217, 4, '1', '53', '2025', '2025-10-07', 'LinkedIn Profile Creation', '<p><strong>About LinkedIn Profile Session:</strong><br />\r\nThe LinkedIn Profile Session was organized to help students understand the importance ofbuilding a strong professional identity on digital platforms. The session guided students on how to create an impressive Linkedln profile by highlighting their academic achievements, skills, internships, and career interests. It also covered practical tips on networking, connecting with industry professionals, and using Linkedin effectively for career', '2025-12-15-22-5ae80b0a-924b-4566-99eb-8fe4f6408aba.jpg', '2025-12-15-45-LINKEDIN  BCOM 3.pdf', 1, 0, '2025-12-15 05:02:22', '2025-12-15 05:02:22', 0, 0),
(218, 4, '1', '54', '2025', '2025-10-07', 'LinkedIn Profile Creation', '<p><strong>About LinkedIn Profile Session:</strong><br />\r\nThe LinkedIn Profile Session was organized to help students understand the importance ofbuilding a strong professional identity on digital platforms. The session guided students on how to create an impressive Linkedln profile by highlighting their academic achievements, skills, internships, and career interests. It also covered practical tips on networking, connecting with industry professionals, and using Linkedin effectively for career', '2025-12-15-12-5ae80b0a-924b-4566-99eb-8fe4f6408aba.jpg', '2025-12-15-23-LINKEDIN  BCOM 3.pdf', 1, 0, '2025-12-15 05:04:07', '2025-12-15 05:04:07', 0, 0),
