INSERT INTO `tbl_ssports` (`id`, `report_type`, `description`, `report_title`, `report_thumbnail`, `report`, `date`, `is_active`, `is_delete`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `created_by`, `updated_by`) VALUES
(1, 'Sports', '<p>demo</p>\r\n', 'sports report', NULL, '2024-09-23-18-2024-03-06-36-Different NSS Activities performed in year of 2022-2023.pdf', '2024-12-12', 0, 1, '2024-09-23 05:59:09', '2024-09-23 06:33:00', NULL, NULL),
(2, 'Culture', '<p>demo</p>\r\n', 'culture', NULL, '2024-09-23-76-LL.B.pdf', '2023-12-05', 0, 1, '2024-09-23 05:59:45', '2024-09-23 06:25:59', NULL, NULL),
(3, 'Sports', '<p>sssss</p>\r\n', 'spp', NULL, '2024-09-23-90-LL.B.pdf', '2023-01-02', 0, 1, '2024-09-23 06:10:59', '2024-09-23 06:33:07', NULL, NULL),
(4, 'Culture', '<p>2024</p>\r\n', '2024', NULL, '2024-09-23-49-LL.B.pdf', '2024-09-05', 0, 1, '2024-09-23 06:11:47', '2024-09-23 06:25:54', NULL, NULL),
(5, 'Sports', '<p>The Box Cricket Tournament was a highly successful event at Gyanmanjari Innovative University (GMIU), offering students a dynamic platform to display their cricketing abilities while strengthening bonds within the university. The event featured a strong turnout, with enthusiastic student participation. Teams competed fiercely yet maintained a high level of sportsmanship and collaboration throughout.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Among the competing teams, Team Warriors 11 emerged as the well-deserved champions, showcasing exceptional skill, teamwork, and commitment during the tournament. Their victory was a highlight, but all teams demonstrated commendable effort, contributing to the tournament&rsquo;s positive energy and competitive spirit.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The tournament was more than just a competition; it fostered friendships, unity, and teamwork, emphasizing the importance of collaboration and mutual respect. It also highlighted the university&rsquo;s growing sports culture and commitment to creating inclusive events that encourage active student participation.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>This event underscores GMIU&#39;s dedication to promoting healthy competition and sportsmanship, setting a strong foundation for future sporting events. With this success, the university is motivated to continue organizing such activities, nurturing talent, and further fostering a sense of community among students.</p>\r\n', 'Box Cricket tournament', NULL, '2024-10-21-60-Box Cricket Tournament Report.pdf', '2024-10-21', 1, 0, '2024-10-21 07:09:30', '2024-10-21 07:09:30', NULL, NULL),
(6, 'Sports', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"><span style=\"color:#040c28\">The Football Tournament held on October 26, 2024, on the university&#39;s outdoor football ground brought together students from various departments to showcase their skills, teamwork, and sportsmanship. Organized by Prof. Twinkle J. Bhatt, the event aimed to promote values such as teamwork, respect, and perseverance, providing participants with an opportunity to develop both their athletic abilities and interpersonal skills.</span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"><span style=\"color:#040c28\">From the first whistle, the atmosphere was electrifying, with students cheering enthusiastically from the sidelines, adding to the event&#39;s excitement. Players displayed remarkable agility, strategy, and determination in their gameplay, keeping the crowd fully engaged. The competitive spirit was palpable, yet the players maintained a strong sense of sportsmanship, showing mutual respect throughout the matches.</span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"><span style=\"color:#040c28\">The tournament culminated in a thrilling final between <strong>The Lions</strong> and <strong>Super Strikers</strong>, with <strong>The Lions</strong> emerging as the winners after a close and intense game. Both teams demonstrated exceptional skill and effort, making it a memorable experience for all attendees</span></span></span></p>\r\n', 'Football Tournament', NULL, '2024-10-29-35-Football tournament Report.pdf', '2024-10-29', 1, 0, '2024-10-29 06:51:30', '2024-10-29 06:51:30', NULL, NULL),
(7, 'Sports', '<p><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\"><span style=\"background-color:white\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"><span style=\"color:#474747\">Badminton is&nbsp;</span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"><span style=\"color:#040c28\">a game played by two or four players on a rectangular court with a high net across the middle</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"><span style=\"color:#474747\">.<span style=\"background-color:white\"> The players try to score points by hitting a small object called a shuttlecock across the net using a racket.</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n', 'Badminton Tournament For Girls', NULL, NULL, '2024-08-04', 0, 1, '2024-10-29 07:03:32', '2026-02-12 08:29:34', NULL, NULL),
(8, 'Sports', '<p>The Kho-Kho Tournament, held at the GMIU Sports Ground on 27th September 2024, was an exhilarating and memorable event that showcased teamwork, strategy, and sportsmanship. A total of 87 students from various departments participated, forming seven competitive teams. The tournament aimed to promote physical fitness, foster camaraderie, and enhance leadership skills while celebrating the traditional Indian sport of Kho-Kho.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The matches were intense and engaging, with players demonstrating agility, speed, and coordination, much to the delight of the cheering spectators. After a day of fierce competition, <em>The Lions</em> emerged as the winners, while <em>Titan Warriors</em> secured the runner-up position. The event concluded with a lively prize distribution ceremony, where the winners were awarded trophies amidst resounding applause.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>This well-organized tournament not only celebrated athleticism but also emphasized the values of perseverance, communication, and respect. It highlighted the cultural significance of traditional sports like Kho-Kho and reinforced the importance of physical activities in building resilience and community.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The success of the event, coordinated by Coach Mr. Rahul Baraiya and Prof. Harkishan Gohil, was widely appreciated by faculty and students alike, making it a proud moment for GMIU.</p>\r\n', 'GMIU Kho-Kho Tournament 2024', NULL, '2024-11-28-37-Kho Kho Report.pdf', '2024-11-27', 1, 0, '2024-11-28 06:08:17', '2024-11-28 06:08:17', NULL, NULL),
(9, 'Sports', '<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">The Volleyball Tournament held on <strong>23 August 2025</strong> to 29 August 2025 was a spectacular and energizing event that witnessed remarkable participation from students across all departments, with 14 enthusiastic teams competing for the championship title. This thrilling competition featured intense robin round matches, where all 14 teams battled fiercely to secure their positions. The atmosphere was electric as players demonstrated exceptional serving techniques, powerful spikes, strategic blocks, and seamless teamwork. After rigorous robin round competition, three outstanding teams emerged to compete in the semi-finals: <strong>The Boys</strong>, <strong>Flying Falcons</strong>, and <strong>Volley Strikers</strong>. The semi-final stage proved to be a true test of endurance and skill. Through closely contested matches filled with dramatic rallies and spectacular saves, <strong>The Boys</strong> and <strong>Flying Falcons</strong> showcased superior coordination and tactical brilliance, earning their spots in the grand finale. Both teams displayed remarkable sportsmanship and competitive spirit throughout their journey. The championship final between <strong>The Boys</strong> and <strong>Flying Falcons</strong> was an absolute masterpiece of volleyball artistry. In a thrilling encounter that kept spectators on the edge of their seats, <strong>Flying Falcons</strong> demonstrated exceptional teamwork, precision, and mental fortitude, ultimately triumphing with a commanding <strong>3-0 victory</strong>. The tournament concluded with tremendous celebration and appreciation for all participants. </span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Congratulations to <strong>Flying Falcons</strong> for their <strong>magnificent championship victory!</strong></span></span></p>\r\n', 'Volley ball Central Level', NULL, '2025-09-02-81-Volley ball Report 2025 central level.docx', '2025-08-23', 1, 0, '2025-09-02 09:51:40', '2025-09-02 09:51:40', NULL, NULL),
(10, 'Sports', '<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">The Intra-Departmental Box-Cricket Tournament held on 26 August 2025 was a spectacular and highenergy event that brought together students from all semesters in a thrilling display of talent, teamwork, and sportsmanship. With 07 enthusiastic teams stepping up to the crease, the tournament became a vibrant celebration of competitive spirit. The Final stage was a true highlight, testing the nerves and skills of every player. After fiercely contested matches, The Boys OF ALPHA SQUAD AND KRISHNA TEAM emerged victorious, thanks to their exceptional coordination, smart gameplay, and unwavering determination. Both teams demonstrated commendable sportsmanship and consistency throughout the tournament. The event concluded with cheers, celebrations, and heartfelt appreciation for all the players, organizers, and supporters who made the tournament a grand success.&nbsp;Congratulations to TEAM KRISHNA for their outstanding TOURNAMENT WIN! Here&#39;s to many more such thrilling tournaments in the future!</span></p>\r\n', 'BOX CRICKET INTRA DEPARTMENT TOURNAMENT', NULL, '2025-09-02-81-2025 INTRA DEPARTMENTAL BOX CRICKET TOURNAMENT - Copy.pdf', '2025-08-26', 1, 0, '2025-09-02 09:53:56', '2025-09-02 09:53:56', NULL, NULL),
(11, 'Sports', '<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">The Intra-Departmental Box-Cricket Tournament of&nbsp;<strong>Science department</strong>&nbsp;held on&nbsp;<strong>28 August 2025</strong>&nbsp;was a spectacular and highenergy event that brought together students from all semesters in a thrilling display of talent, teamwork, and sportsmanship. With 04 enthusiastic teams stepping up to the crease, the tournament became a vibrant celebration of competitive spirit. The Final stage was a true highlight, testing the nerves and skills of every player. After fiercely contested matches,&nbsp;<strong>The teams 8-Leveling Vs Lion&rsquo;s</strong>&nbsp;emerged victorious, thanks to their exceptional coordination, smart gameplay, and unwavering determination. Both teams demonstrated commendable sportsmanship and consistency throughout the tournament. The event concluded with cheers, celebrations, and heartfelt appreciation for all the players, organizers, and supporters who made the tournament a grand success.&nbsp;<strong>Congraculations team 8-leveling</strong>&nbsp;for your great victory.</span></p>\r\n', 'SCIENCE Department box cricket tournament', NULL, '2025-09-02-33-cricket tournament report (1).pdf', '2025-08-09', 1, 0, '2025-09-02 09:57:32', '2025-09-02 09:57:32', NULL, NULL),
(12, 'Sports', '<p><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">The Volleyball Tournament held on <strong>23 August 2025</strong> to 29 August 2025 was a spectacular and energizing event that witnessed remarkable participation from students across all departments, with 14 enthusiastic teams competing for the championship title. This thrilling competition featured intense robin round matches, where all 14 teams battled fiercely to secure their positions. The atmosphere was electric as players demonstrated exceptional serving techniques, powerful spikes, strategic blocks, and seamless teamwork. After rigorous robin round competition, three outstanding teams emerged to compete in the semi-finals: <strong>The Boys</strong>, <strong>Flying Falcons</strong>, and <strong>Volley Strikers</strong>. The semi-final stage proved to be a true test of endurance and skill. Through closely contested matches filled with dramatic rallies and spectacular saves, <strong>The Boys</strong> and <strong>Flying Falcons</strong> showcased superior coordination and tactical brilliance, earning their spots in the grand finale. Both teams displayed remarkable sportsmanship and competitive spirit throughout their journey. The championship final between <strong>The Boys</strong> and <strong>Flying Falcons</strong> was an absolute masterpiece of volleyball artistry. In a thrilling encounter that kept spectators on the edge of their seats, <strong>Flying Falcons</strong> demonstrated exceptional teamwork, precision, and mental fortitude, ultimately triumphing with a commanding <strong>3-0 victory</strong>. The tournament concluded with tremendous celebration and appreciation for all participants. </span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Congratulations to <strong>Flying Falcons</strong> for their <strong>magnificent championship victory!</strong></span></span></p>\r\n', 'Central level volley ball tournament', NULL, '2025-09-02-54-Volley ball Report 2025 central level.docx', '2025-08-23', 1, 0, '2025-09-02 10:00:02', '2025-09-02 10:00:02', NULL, NULL),
(13, 'Sports', '<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif\">The Badminton Tournament held on 29/08/2025, was a highly anticipated event that brought together students from all departments at OTS. The event was scheduled to begin at 03:00 PM, attracting a total of 12 participants who showcased their skills and enthusiasm for the sport. The primary motive behind organizing the event was to provide participants with the opportunity to learn, demonstrate teamwork, and foster respect for one another. These qualities are essential not only in sports but also in various aspects of personal and professional life. &bull; The tournament itself was designed to be engaging and competitive, with players competing in singles category. Badminton, a fast-paced and dynamic sport, requires participants to be quick on their feet and have excellent hand-eye coordination. The goal of the event was not just to crown winners but to highlight the importance of sportsmanship and cooperation among the players. The friendly atmosphere encouraged participants to challenge themselves while also learning valuable life lessons such as handling victories with humility and accepting defeats gracefully. &bull; Prof. Suraj D. Gohil, the event coordinator, played a key role in ensuring that the tournament ran smoothly. Under her guidance, the event was organized with precision, offering a wellstructured environment for the players to compete in. The tournament was held in the OTS, which provided an excellent venue with ample space for all the matches. The participants were grouped in a manner that allowed for fair competition, and the matches were conducted with utmost respect for the rules of the game.</span></span></p>\r\n', 'Badminton Report 2025', NULL, '2025-09-03-71-Badmintan.pdf', '2025-08-29', 1, 0, '2025-09-03 07:40:52', '2025-09-03 07:40:52', NULL, NULL),
(14, 'Sports', '<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif\">The Intra-Departmental Box-Cricket Tournament held on 10 September 2025 for Premium was an energetic and engaging event that showcased the spirit of teamwork, competition, and enthusiasm among Premium Students. With 05 dynamic teams participating, the tournament witnessed exciting matches filled with talent and determination.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br />\r\nThe Final stage was the most thrilling moment of the day, featuring a tough contest between B. Tech 1st Year and B. Tech 3rd Year teams. After an intense battle, the B. Tech 1st Year team emerged as the champions, displaying excellent coordination, sharp strategies, and true sportsmanship throughout the tournament.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br />\r\nThe event concluded with cheers, joy, and appreciation for the efforts of all players, organizers, and supporters who contributed to making the tournament a grand success.&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n', 'Box cricket tournament for Premium batch', NULL, '2025-09-11-43-2025 INTRA Primium BOX CRICKET TOURNAMENT -.pdf', '2025-09-10', 1, 0, '2025-09-11 09:01:42', '2025-09-11 09:01:42', NULL, NULL),
(15, 'Sports', '<p><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">The primary purpose of organizing the Vocational Course on Fitness and Wellness was to provide students with practical, skill-based knowledge in the field of physical fitness, health management, and overall wellness. The program aimed to enhance employability skills, promote a healthy lifestyle, and create awareness about fitness as a professional career option.</span></span></p>\r\n', 'Vocational Course For Fitness &amp; Wellness.', NULL, '2025-12-22-54-vocational Course report.docx', '2025-12-18', 1, 0, '2025-12-22 05:51:16', '2025-12-22 05:51:16', NULL, NULL);
