(30, 4, '5', '2', '64', 'Ratna Vyas', 'rvvyas@gmiu.edu.in', '9909140561', 'RV', 'Assistant Professor', '2023-04-01', 'GF-37', '10', '<p><strong>Ratna Vyas</strong>&nbsp;is working as&nbsp;<strong>Assistant Professor</strong>&nbsp;- at the Faculty of Management at Gyanmanjari Innovative University&nbsp;<strong>(GMIU).&nbsp;</strong>Prior to Joining GMIU, She was working as an Assistant Professor in the Faculty of Management&nbsp;CHARUSAT University, Changa. She is pursuing her Ph.D. at Sardar Patel University, Vallabh Vidyanagar.&nbsp; She is also associated with ICAI and CED as Consulting Trainer.</p>\r\n', '2023-06-21-57-IMG-20220526-WA0026 (1).jpg', 'gmiu@123?', NULL, 0, 1, '2023-06-21 12:23:56', '2024-07-27 05:23:30', NULL, NULL),
