(71, 8, '1', '1,5', '2,14,22,117,153,243,254,290', 'Jani Deepakkumar S', 'dsjani@gmiu.edu.in', '9276825457', 'DSJ', 'Assistant Professor', '2021-11-14', 'GF 38', '11 Years', '<p>I am <strong>Deepak Kumar Jani</strong>, Pursuing PhD in Mechanical- Renewable energy. I have nine years of teaching and two-year research experience. My subject area of interest are thermal engineering, automobile engineering, Mechanical measurement, Engineering Drawing, Fluid mechanics etc. I have filed a patent on&nbsp;<strong>Hybridization of green energy for power production</strong>.I have published 22 research papers and three books. I am glad to be part of GMIU and would like to present some of my expertise in a simplistic way with the learners. Apart from academics and research, I like wandering in nature, capturing nature and creating awareness about nature among people.Let&rsquo;s connect through&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/jani-deepak-b0558748/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">LinkedIn</a>.</p>\r\n', '2023-11-01-61-Deepak-Kumar-Jani.webp', '9276825457', NULL, 1, 0, '2023-11-01 07:56:17', '2025-02-28 07:08:30', NULL, NULL),
