(2063, 4, NULL, NULL, '69', 'Dr Mandeep Majmudar', 'mjmajmudar@gmiu.edu.in', '7574949494', 'MJM', 'Head Of Department', '2023-06-01', 'SF-43', '12 Years', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Dr. Mandeep J Majmudar</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> is an accomplished </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Assistant Professor</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> in the </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Management Department</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> at </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Gyanmanjari Innovative University</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, bringing a unique blend of academic expertise and extensive experience from the corporate world. With a Phd in Management from MK Bhavnagar University, Dr. M J Majmudar has a solid foundation in Marketing. Prior to joining academia, he has amassed invaluable industry experience through successful roles at various reputed companies. Driven by a passion for bridging the gap between theory and practice, Dr. M J Majmudar leverages his rich corporate background to inspire students and infuse real-world insights into the classroom. His commitment to excellence in teaching makes Dr. M J Majmudar an invaluable asset to t