(2261, 4, NULL, NULL, '60,63,64,66,67,68,69,70,616,191,205,219,297,298,299,300,310', 'Ms. Jagruti A. Pandya', 'ngsutariya@gmiu.edu.in', '9727590930', 'JAP', 'Academic Coordinator (Management &amp; Commerce), Assistant Professor', '2024-07-01', 'SF-43', '15', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><strong>Jagruti Pandya</strong> is an accomplished <strong>Assistant Professor</strong> in the <strong>Management Department</strong> at <strong>Gyanmanjari Innovative University</strong>, bringing over <strong>15 years </strong>of extensive experience in academia. Currently pursuing a PhD in Management, she has built a solid foundation in Marketing, which she integrates seamlessly into her teaching.&nbsp;Her passion for research complements her teaching, as she actively contributes to academic journals and conferences, further enriching the learning experience for her students. Jagruti is committed to mentoring future leaders in the field, guiding students in developing critical thinking and practical skills necessary for success in the business world.&nbsp;Her unwavering commitment to excellence in education and her ability to inspire students make Jagruti Pandya an invaluable asset to the academic community at Gyanmanjari Innovative University.</p>\r\n', '2024-10-29-66-JAP.jpg', NULL, NULL, 0, 1, '2024-10-29 03:45:08', '2026-01-21 04:37:21', NULL, NULL),
