(2280, 4, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Prof. Rushi D. Acharya', 'rdacharya@gmiu.edu.in', '90166', 'RDA', 'Lecturer', '2024-07-29', 'GF-37', '6 Months', '<p>Hello, I am Lecturer Rushi D. Acharya ( B.E Information Technology ). I am Certified Information Security and Ethical Hacker. I am Teaching for 6 months now and have a genuine passion for my subjects. I have expertise in Cyber Security, Software Engineering, Computer Network.</p>\r\n', '2024-12-05-23-rda.png', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2024-12-05 07:22:17', '2025-06-16 11:00:47', NULL, NULL),
