(2479, 4, NULL, NULL, '2,22,243,254', 'PRAJESH DAVE', 'pvdave@gmiu.edu.in', '9737520857', 'PVD', 'Lecturer', '2023-09-19', 'GF-38', '06 Years', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><strong>Mr. PRAJESH DAVE</strong> is a committed and experienced lecturer in the field of Mechanical Engineering, known for his ability to seamlessly integrate academic knowledge with real-world industrial practices. With a professional background in project management within the oil and gas industry, he brings valuable insights from large-scale engineering operations and international project execution. His industry experience enhances his teaching, allowing him to provide students with a practical perspective on engineering concepts and their applications. Mr. Dave is passionate about mentoring the next generation of engineers, fostering innovation, and promoting a strong foundation in both technical skills and professional ethics. His dedication to academic excellence and industry relevance makes him a respected educator and a valuable asset to the engineering community.</p>\r\n', '2025-05-06-33-Photo.jpg', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2025-05-06 08:49:20', '2025-05-06 08:52:36', NULL, NULL),
