(2501, 4, NULL, NULL, '4,5,25,232,246,257,565,575,604,606,607,608,613,620', 'Prof. Khusharth B. Oza', 'kboza@gmiu.edu.in', '6354186262', 'KBO', 'Lecturer', '2025-02-24', 'FF-38', '0 years', '<p>Skilled in C,Java,HTML,CSS, PHP ,MySQL and Python. I am a passionate&nbsp;learner and a good team worker.</p>\r\n', '2025-07-23-60-KBO.jpg', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2025-06-17 09:22:29', '2025-12-24 08:20:06', NULL, NULL),
(2502, 4, NULL, NULL, '4,5,13,25,232,233,257,565,575,606,607,608,613,620', 'Prof. Darshanbhai J. Gadhadara', 'djgadhadara@gmiu.edu.in', '9875010257', 'DJG', 'Lecturer', '2025-05-07', 'FF24', '0 Years', '<p>Hi, I&#39;m Darshan, a passionate full-stack web developer with a solid grasp of manual testing. I&rsquo;ve built real-world projects like a QR Code Feedback System, Hostel Management System, and eCommerce platforms. I enjoy developing scalable web applications using HTML, CSS, JavaScript, PHP, MySQL, and Core Java, with a focus on clean UI and efficient backend solutions.</p>\r\n', '2025-07-23-20-DJG.jpg', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2025-06-17 09:29:38', '2025-12-24 08:20:42', NULL, NULL),
(2503, 4, NULL, NULL, '4,5,25,30,232,246,257,565,575,604,606,607,608,613,620', 'Prof.Aadithya V. Nair', 'avnair@gmiu.edu.in', '6353902136', 'AVN', 'Lecturer', '2025-05-01', 'FF03', '0 years', '<p>Hi, I&#39;m Aadithya &mdash; a passionate learner with a strong foundation in full-stack web development. Over the past several months, I&rsquo;ve worked on real-world projects including QR code-based feedback systems, restaurant order and booking systems, and eCommerce platforms. I specialize in building efficient, scalable web applications using Laravel, MySQL, jQuery, and AJAX, and I enjoy solving backend challenges and crafting clean user experiences.Passionate about both tech and teaching, I thrive on continuous learning and enjoy sharing knowledge to create meaningful impact.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n', '2025-07-23-53-AVN.jpg', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2025-06-17 09:36:02', '2025-12-24 08:24:05', NULL, NULL),
(2504, 4, NULL, NULL, '4,5,25,233,245,246,257,565,575,605,606,607,608,613,620', 'Prof.Dharmarajsinh K. Jadeja', 'dkjadeja@gmiu.edu.in', '8160472534', 'DKJ', 'Lecturer', '2025-05-01', 'FF-26', '0 years', '<p>I&rsquo;m Dharmarajsinh Jadeja, a Computer Engineering graduate with a solid grip on Flutter and a passion for web and Android development using Java. I&rsquo;ve built real-world projects like a Body Fitness App and a Library Management System, blending clean code with practical, user-focused solutions. Proficient in Dart, Java, HTML, CSS, JavaScript, and PHP, I&rsquo;m always eager to learn, grow, and thrive in the ever-evolving tech landscape.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n', '2025-07-23-25-DKJ.jpg', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2025-06-17 09:39:30', '2025-12-24 08:24:31', NULL, NULL),
(2505, 4, NULL, NULL, '4,5,25,30,246,562,563,565,575,605,606,607,608,613,620', 'Prof.Ayush Patel', 'apatel@gmiu.edu.in', '8780119669', 'AVP', 'Lecturer', '2025-05-15', 'FF-24', '0 Years', '<p>A tech-driven educator with a Bachelor&rsquo;s in Information Technology, I currently serve as a Teaching Assistant, where I support practical labs, mentor students, and simplify complex technical topics. I specialize in web development using HTML, CSS, JavaScript, and PHP, and am expanding my skills into data engineering. I&rsquo;m passionate about bridging the gap between theory and real-world application, and committed to continuous learning and growth in the tech field.</p>\r\n', '2025-07-23-34-AVP.jpg', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2025-06-17 09:42:28', '2025-12-24 08:24:57', NULL, NULL),
(2506, 4, NULL, NULL, '6,7,23,234,235,247,248,255', 'Prof. Harshil M. Trivedi', 'hmtrivedi@gmiu.edu.in', '8999363635', 'HMT', 'Lecturer', '2025-05-15', 'Admin Area', '1 Year', '<p>Indormation and Technology&nbsp;</p>\r\n', '2025-06-17-65-IMG_3417.jpeg', NULL, NULL, 0, 1, '2025-06-17 10:37:57', '2025-12-24 04:20:43', NULL, NULL);
