(2507, 4, NULL, NULL, '4,5,25,30,33,232,233,562,563,565,575,604,605,606,607,608,613,620', 'Dr. Mansi Chintan Shanishwara', 'mcshanishwara@gmiu.edu.in', '9904242221', 'MCS', 'Assistant Professor', '2010-06-20', 'GF37', '15 years', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\">With over 15 years of dedicated teaching experience in Computer Science,<br />\r\nshe brings a strong academic and professional background to the field.<br />\r\nSkilled in Data Structures, Artificial Intelligence, Blockchain, C, C++, Java,<br />\r\nDBMS, Python and related technologies. She holds a Ph.D. from a UGC-<br />\r\napproved, NAAC A+ accredited CHARUSAT university. She secured 2nd rank<br />\r\nin M.C.A. and 4th rank in B.C.A. at the Bhavnagar University. Her academic<br />\r\ncontributions include two published books and ten research papers in<br />\r\nnational and international forums. She is also a certified NABET School<br />\r\nAccreditation Assessor, contributing to quality assurance in education.</p>\r\n', '2025-07-23-47-mansimaam.PNG', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2025-06-18 07:22:18', '2025-11-10 09:51:11', NULL, NULL),
(2508, 4, NULL, NULL, '8,118,236,258,308', 'Prof. Chintan Pandya', 'chpandya@gmiu.edu.in', '9265161001', 'CHP', 'Assistant Professor', '2025-01-16', 'FF-02', '1', '', '2025-06-18-37-Chintan Pandya.jpg', NULL, NULL, 0, 1, '2025-06-18 11:33:44', '2025-11-24 09:17:01', NULL, NULL),
(2509, 4, NULL, NULL, '6,7,23,234,235,247,248,255', 'Prof. Krupali B. Solanki', 'kbsolanki@gmiu.edu.in', '0', 'KBS', 'Lecturer', '2025-06-08', 'GF-37', '1 Year', '<p>I am Prof. Krupali Solanki, with nearly two years of industry experience. I am passionate about web development, particularly in PHP and Laravel, and possess strong skills in frontend development. I hold a Bachelor&#39;s degree in Information Technology (B.E. IT).</p>\r\n', '2025-06-19-41-1749640059780.jpg', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2025-06-19 05:48:55', '2025-07-05 06:18:19', NULL, NULL),
(2510, 4, NULL, NULL, '6,7,23,234,235,247,248', 'Prof. Jay D. Parmar', 'jdparmar@gmiu.edu.in', '9328300372', 'JDP', 'Lecturer', '2025-06-02', 'Admin Area', '1 Year', '<p>Information Technology</p>\r\n', '2025-06-20-42-IMG_7254 copy.jpg', NULL, NULL, 0, 1, '2025-06-20 06:00:25', '2025-12-24 04:20:17', NULL, NULL),
(2511, 4, NULL, NULL, '4,5,25,30,232,233,246,565,575,604,605,607,608,620', 'Prof. Hiral A. Parmar', 'haparmar@gmiu.edu.in', '8849289328', 'HAP', 'ASSISTANT PROFESSOR', '2025-06-02', 'GF-37', '3 years', '<p>I am a professor with specialization in .NET, Python, Angular, C++, and SQL,&nbsp;MongoDb. With a strong background in software development, I bring both academic and industry experience to the classroom. Prior to joining academia, I worked as a Web Developer, where I was involved in designing and developing full-stack web applications using modern technologies.</p>\r\n', '2025-06-20-94-Hiral.jpg', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2025-06-20 10:49:34', '2025-12-24 08:25:38', NULL, NULL),
(2512, 4, NULL, NULL, '6,7,23,234,235,247', 'Prof. Anjani U. Astik', 'auanjani@gmiu.edu.in', '0', 'AUA', 'Lecturer', '2025-06-02', 'FF-28', '1 Year', '<p>Information Technology&nbsp;</p>\r\n', '2025-06-23-96-Adobe Scan 20 Jun 2025_1.jpg', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2025-06-23 07:52:13', '2025-07-05 06:17:28', NULL, NULL),
(2513, 4, NULL, NULL, '4,5,13,25,30,232,233,245,246,257,565,575,607,608,613,620', 'Prof. Priyanka M. Bhatt', 'pmbhatt@gmiu.edu.in', '9408256550', 'PMB', 'Teaching Assistant', '2025-06-06', 'GF37', '0 years', '', '2025-07-23-86-priynkamaam.PNG', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2025-06-23 09:03:13', '2025-12-24 08:26:32', NULL, NULL),
(2514, 4, NULL, NULL, '6,7,23,234,235,247,248,255', 'Prof. Tarjanee M. Vyas', 'tmvyas@gmiu.edu.in', '0', 'TMV', 'Lecturer', '2025-06-16', 'Admin Area', '1 Year', '<p>Information and Technology&nbsp;</p>\r\n', '2025-06-25-26-photo_page-0001.jpg', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2025-06-25 09:02:56', '2025-07-05 06:19:00', NULL, NULL),
(2515, 4, NULL, NULL, '4,5,13,25,29,30,33,232,233,245,246,575,606,607,608,613,620', 'Dr. Dhananjay Trivedi', 'dbtrivedi@gmiu.edu.in', '9873594493', 'DJT', 'ASSISTANT PROFESSOR', '2025-06-16', 'GF-37', '6 Years', '<div>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"color:black\">I am Dr. Dhananjay Trivedi, an interdisciplinary scholar with a strong foundation in both technology and Indian philosophy. I hold a B.Tech. in Electronics and Communication Engineering and later pursued my passion for philosophical inquiry, earning a Ph.D. in Philosophy with a specialization in Hindu Studies, particularly focusing on Yoga-Dharma. I have also qualified the UGC-NET in both Philosophy and Hindu Studies.</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"color:black\">Currently, I serve as an Assistant Professor, teaching Ethics and Indian Knowledge Systems (IKS), and actively contribute to research at the intersection of classical Indian wisdom and contemporary challenges. My academic interests include Yoga philosophy, Consciousness studies, and the ethical dimensions of Artificial Intelligence. I have authored books and research papers on topics such as duḥkha (suffering), education &amp; consciousness, and the relevance of Indian philosophical systems in the modern world.</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"color:black\">Bridging my technical background and philosophical training, I strive to explore how ancient Indian knowledge systems can inform and enrich present-day discourse in education, ethics, and technology.</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n', '2025-07-23-49-Dhananjay.png', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2025-06-27 10:48:41', '2025-11-10 10:02:31', NULL, NULL),
(2516, 4, NULL, NULL, '6,7,23,234,235,247,248,255', 'Prof. Devang J. Bhatt', 'djbhatt@gmiu.edu.in', '9499548563', 'DJB', 'Lecturer', '2025-01-23', 'SF-21', '1 Year', '<p><strong>Prof. Devang J. Bhatt</strong><br />\r\n<strong>B.E. in Computer Engineering</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>I am Prof. Devang J. Bhatt, a passionate and dedicated academic at the beginning of my professional journey in the field of computer engineering. I hold a Bachelor&#39;s degree in Computer Engineering and have recently stepped into academia, with <strong>1 year of teaching experience</strong>.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>During this time, I have had the opportunity to teach key subjects such as <strong>operating systems</strong>, <strong>web development</strong>, <strong>advanced database management systems</strong>, and <strong>artificial intelligence.</strong>&nbsp;These experiences have not only deepened my subject knowledge but also strengthened my enthusiasm for teaching and mentoring students.</p>\r\n', '2025-06-29-30-myimg.jpg', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2025-06-29 06:46:16', '2025-07-05 06:21:59', NULL, NULL),
(2517, 4, NULL, NULL, '89,90,132,133,134,135,179,195,196,614', 'Prof. Vivek Baraiya', 'vdbaraiya@gmiu.edu.in', '9054690029', 'VDB', 'ASSISTANT PROFESSOR', '2025-06-14', 'FF-38', '1 Year', '<p>I have good knowlege in WEB DESIGNING, SQL, JAVA and COMPUTER NETWORKS.&nbsp;</p>\r\n', '2025-06-30-16-WhatsApp Image 2025-06-30 at 3.04.47 PM.jpeg', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2025-06-30 09:42:00', '2025-06-30 09:48:47', NULL, NULL),
