(2577, 4, NULL, NULL, '74,78', 'Jatin Varu', 'jnvaru@gmiu.edu.in', '6353761900', 'JNV', 'Teaching Assistant', '2025-07-15', 'TF-37', '1 Year', '<p>My self Jatin Varu&nbsp;<br />\r\nMy academic background is I complete my under graduation from Samaldas Arts college (MKBU) with English language and literature. I completed my Masters from Department of English (MKBU) with English Literature and language.</p>\r\n', '2025-09-06-59-IMG-20250217-WA0014 - JATIN VARU.jpg', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2025-09-06 05:48:53', '2025-09-06 06:49:28', NULL, NULL),
(2578, 4, NULL, NULL, '74,78', 'Paridhi V. Patel', 'pvpatel@gmiu.edu.in', '9426002530', 'PVP', 'Teaching assistant', '2025-01-01', 'TF 37', '2 Years', '<p>I am very good at communication skills and I am a dedicated and motivated teaching assistant with hands-on experience in providing academic support to students&nbsp;</p>\r\n', '2025-09-06-77-PVP.png', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2025-09-06 05:59:47', '2025-09-06 06:48:48', NULL, NULL),
(2579, 4, NULL, NULL, '73,83', 'Jani Mahendrakumar Kishorbhai', 'mkjani@gmiu.edu.in', '9428059403', 'MKJ', 'Teaching assistant', '2025-06-02', 'TF 37', '1 Year', '<p>My self Mahendrabhai Jani, i graduated with subject of Political Science from MKBU year 2021 and completed my Master with Political Science from MKBU year 2023 and completed my B.ed from Suarashtra University in year of 2025</p>\r\n', '2025-09-06-56-MKJ.png', NULL, NULL, 0, 1, '2025-09-06 06:07:02', '2025-12-17 10:39:19', NULL, NULL),
(2580, 4, NULL, NULL, '73,83', 'Drashti Maheshbhai Makwana', 'dmmakwana@gmiu.edu.in', '9898970432', 'DMM', 'Teaching Assistant', '2025-02-06', 'TF 37', '1 Year', '<p>I am Drashti Makwana, a recent Post Graduate in Political Science.I&rsquo;m passionate about Public Administration. As a Fresher, I am eager to apply my academic knowledge in practical teaching and contribute to a dynamic learning environment.</p>\r\n', '2025-09-06-20-DMM.png', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2025-09-06 06:11:14', '2025-09-06 06:51:39', NULL, NULL),
(2581, 4, NULL, NULL, '74,78', 'Riya Bhatt', 'rmbhatt@gmiu.edu.in', '9313170615', 'RMB', 'Teaching assistant', '2025-06-03', 'TF 37', '1 Year', '<p>Dedicated to GMIU with active involvement in all academic and institutional initiatives. I am committed to fostering growth, teamwork, and meaningful learning experiences. Always available to guide and support students in their academic journey.</p>\r\n', '2025-09-06-54-RIYA.png', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2025-09-06 06:20:35', '2025-09-06 06:48:22', NULL, NULL),
(2582, 4, NULL, NULL, '76,80', 'Rajvi Navinchnchandra Kakkad', 'rnkakkad@gmiu.edu.in', '6351265440', 'RNK', 'Teaching assistant', '2025-06-02', 'TF 37', '9 Years', '<p>My self Rajvi Kakkad. I have persuade B.A.(Sociology) , M.A. (Sociology) &amp; MSW, Diploma in Labor Laws (2014-2015)<br />\r\nI was assistant professor in Swami Sahajanand college of commerce and management, Bhavnagar for 6 Years(2015-2021)<br />\r\nAfter that I joined PNR society as a project coordinator in Slow Learner Project, Bhavnagar for 3 years(2021-2024)<br />\r\nAt present i am working as a Teaching Assistant in GMIU, Department of Arts -&nbsp;<br />\r\n(Sub .Sociology).&nbsp;</p>\r\n', '2025-09-06-43-RNK.png', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2025-09-06 06:26:18', '2025-09-06 06:51:18', NULL, NULL),
(2583, 4, NULL, NULL, '74', 'Upadhyay Jhanvi Manishbhai', 'jmupadhyay@gmiu.edu.in', '6359384289', 'JMU', 'Teaching Assistant', '2025-08-01', 'TF 37', '1 Year', '<p>I have completed her **B.A. in Economics** and also holds a **Diploma from the Central Sanskrit University**.<br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n', '2025-09-06-14-jmu.png', NULL, NULL, 0, 1, '2025-09-06 06:30:21', '2025-12-17 10:39:42', NULL, NULL),
(2584, 4, NULL, NULL, '2,22,243,254', 'Prof. Anjali R. Nair', 'arnair@gmiu.edu.in', '8401342429', 'ARN', 'Assistant Professor', '2025-07-01', 'GF-38', '06', '<p>Prof. Anjali R. Nair is an Assistant Professor in Mechanical Engineering with over six years of teaching experience. She holds a Master&rsquo;s degree in Thermal Engineering from Gujarat Maritime Institute University, and a Bachelor&rsquo;s degree in Mechanical Engineering. With a strong academic foundation and a passion for knowledge dissemination, she has contributed to both school- and college-level education, beginning her career as a teacher before transitioning into higher education.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Since November 2022, Prof. Nair has been serving as an Assistant Professor at GMIU, where she specializes in Thermal Engineering and related domains. She is dedicated to nurturing future engineers by blending theoretical learning with practical applications, encouraging innovation, and instilling professional ethics in her students. Her commitment to academic excellence, combined with her approachable teaching style, makes her a valued mentor and faculty member.</p>\r\n', '2025-09-08-29-IMG20221121222453-01.jpeg', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2025-09-08 08:14:28', '2025-09-08 08:14:49', NULL, NULL),
