(2592, 4, NULL, NULL, '1,15,21,101,116,139,155,190,242,253,312', 'Prof. Sujan Sama', 'srsama@gmiu.edu.in', '7046551855', 'SRS', 'Assistant Professor', '2025-08-11', 'GF 38', '1 years', '<p>Self-motivated and results-driven Civil Engineer with a passion for sustainable development, planning, and proibilem-solving. Seeking a challenging role where I can utilize my technical skills in water resources and AutoCAD, whille contributing to quality work in fast-paced and team-oriented environments. I am an individual who excels in both independent and collaborative tasks and is committed to continuous learning and professional growth.</p>\r\n', '2025-10-03-31-IMG_9532.jpeg', NULL, NULL, 0, 1, '2025-10-03 06:16:56', '2025-12-23 05:50:37', NULL, NULL),
