(2637, 4, NULL, NULL, '1,21', 'Sujan R. Sama', 'srsama@gmiu.edu.in', '7046551855', 'SRS', 'Assistant Professor', '2025-08-08', 'GF 38', '1.5  year', '<p>Sujan Sama is a Civil Engineering faculty member with specialization in Water Resources Engineering. She holds both Bachelor&rsquo;s and Master&rsquo;s degrees from Gujarat Technological University with First Class with Distinction. Her areas of interest include water distribution network design, WaterGEMS modeling, AutoCAD planning, and sustainable water management. She is actively involved in teaching, mentoring, and applied engineering practices.</p>\r\n', '2026-01-31-47-IMG_9532.jpeg', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-01-31 08:29:04', '2026-01-31 08:32:40', NULL, NULL),
