(21, 'Ramona Schindler', 'ramona.s@pelephant.com', 'Contact Person For Math', 'Dear Educators,rnrnI am the founder of ModusOperandi, an app that corrects handwritten math solutions (this is a completely different concept from Photomath).rnhttps://modusoperandiapp.page.link/g-signup.rnCurrently, I am looking for schools and teachers for the initial rollout who would like to test the app.rnCould you please provide me with the contact details of the appropriate person (e.g., math department coordinator) at your school?rnrnI look forward to hearing from you.rnWarm regards,rnRamona', '2024-03-18 05:20:42', '2024-03-18 05:20:42', 1, 0),
