(24, 'Nidhi Andharia', 'nidhiandharia@gmail.com', 'Inquiry about PhD Course Details and Fee Structure', 'I am writing to inquire about the details of the PhD program offered at your university, including information about the curriculum, fee structure, and mode of studies.rnrnCould you please provide me with the following details:rnrnCurriculum: Could you please outline the courses and research opportunities available in the PhD program? Additionally, I am interested in learning more about any specialization options or interdisciplinary opportunities.rnrnFee Structure: What is the fee structure for the PhD program? Are there any scholarships, grants, or financial aid options available for prospective students?rnrnMode of Studies: Could you please clarify whether the PhD program is offered on a full-time or part-time basis? Are there any flexible learning options or distance learning opportunities available?rnrnI am eager to learn more about the PhD program at your esteemed university and would greatly appreciate any information you can provide', '2024-04-26 05:33:52', '2024-04-26 05:33:52', 1, 0),
