(26, 'Ramona Schindler', 'ramona.s@pelephant.com', 'Contact Person For Math', 'Dear educators,rnrnI am the founder of ModusOperandi #TeacherInPocket, an app that verifies handwritten math solutions (completely different concept than PhotoMath). We would like to offer the premium version of ModusOperandi to your institute completely free. No strings attached; it is entirely free to use with all the premium features and no ads.rnrnYou can find it at https://modusoperandiapp.page.link/g-signup.rnrnCould you please provide contact information for an appropriate person, such as your school\'s mathematics department coordinator?rnrnWe\'ve also launched a &quot;Free-to-use&quot; ModusOperandi extension for ChatGPT, which you can find at: https://chatgpt.com/g/g-f5Sfjswqd-modusoperandi-math-verifier.rnrnWe look forward to your reply.rnrnSincerely,rnrnRamona', '2024-05-17 04:50:49', '2024-05-17 04:50:49', 1, 0),
