(29, 'Gunit B', 'gunit@injob.ai', 'InJob.AI for students.', 'Hi,rnrnWe are developing a new platform that automatically applies for jobs. We thought your students and graduates might be interested in this possibility.rnrnAt the same time, we are looking for testers and first users to help us improve the platform every single day. We would be happy if you could share the link www.injob.ai along with the promo code &quot;FREESTUDENTLAUNCH&quot; with your students.rnrnWith this code, they will receive one month of free access. Right now, as we are in the testing phase, we are not charging anything.rnrnIf you could also provide us with the best contact to reach out to with this message, it would be really helpful. For example, the Student Coordinator or Alumni Group.rnrnThank you!rnrnGunit', '2024-05-30 04:58:52', '2024-05-30 04:58:52', 1, 0),
