(36, 'SYUDENTD OF GMIU COLLAGE MAHUVA', '123@gmail.com', 'complaint of diploma collage mahuva', 'respected sir/madamrni am student of your collage which is in mahuva. study in diploma. i want to tell you that in our collage there is lack of teachers. Present teacher and not explaining well. i am requesting you please take urgent action on this matter.rnit become  good for us..', '2024-09-11 21:42:48', '2024-09-11 21:42:48', 1, 0),
(37, 'SYUDENTD OF GMIU COLLAGE MAHUVA', 'personal@gmail.com', 'complaint of diploma collage mahuva', 'Dear sirrnI hope this message finds you well. I am writing to express my concerns about the quality of instruction in Diploma Department in Mahuva, particularly regarding the knowledge and teaching methods of some instructors. I believe these issues are affecting the overall learning experience and academic progress of students.rnrnSpecifically, I have observed the following:rnrnInsufficient Subject Knowledge: There have been instances where instructors have demonstrated a lack of in-depth understanding of the subject matter. This has led to incorrect or incomplete explanations during lectures, which impedes our ability to grasp the material fully.rnrnIneffective Explanations: Many concepts are not explained clearly or thoroughly, leaving students confused and unsure about the core principles. The explanations often lack detail and do not address common misunderstandings, making it difficult for students to apply the knowledge effectively.rnrnLimited Engagement: The teaching methods employed by some instructors seem to lack engagement and fail to stimulate critical thinking. There is a noticeable absence of interactive elements or practical examples that could help in better understanding the material.rnrnLack of Support: When students seek clarification or additional help, responses are often inadequate or delayed. This lack of support further exacerbates the difficulties faced in understanding and applying the course content.rnrnI have attempted to raise these concerns directly with the instructors involved but have not observed significant changes or improvements. As a result, I am reaching out to the administration to request a review of these issues and consider measures to enhance the quality of instruction.rnrnI believe that addressing these concerns will significantly improve the academic experience for students and ensure that the university maintains its standards of excellence in teaching.rnrnThank you for your attention to this matter. I am available for further discussion if needed and hope for a positive resolution.', '2024-09-13 23:54:29', '2024-09-13 23:54:29', 1, 0),
