y 48 hours of refund policy (but I understand!).\r\n\r\nRegards,\r\n\r\nGlen Babineau\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nUNSUBSCRIBE: https://www.increasetraffic.shop/unsubscribe/?d=gmiu.edu.in  \r\nAddress: 4225 Eagle Drive\r\nSouthfield, MI 48075\r\n', '2025-04-06 21:15:45', '2025-04-06 21:15:45', 1, 0),
