(237, 'Nihal Joshi', 'nihaljoshi.dev@gmail.com', 'Website Design & UX Improvement Suggestion for GMIU', 'Hello GMIU Team,\r\n\r\nI was browsing your website while exploring various university platforms and felt that, while the academic information is strong, the overall design and user experience seem dated compared to what today’s students expect.\r\n\r\nI’m working independently on a modern redesign concept focused on improving clarity, student experience, and overall visual quality without altering your existing content.\r\n\r\nIf this is something you’d be open to, I’d be happy to briefly share my thoughts or a concept and get your feedback.\r\n\r\nThank you for your time.\r\nNihal Joshi\r\n+91 9429184250\r\nnihaljoshi.dev@gmail.com', '2026-01-10 14:18:52', '2026-01-10 14:18:52', 1, 0),
