(81, 3, '2', '136', 'Bio informatics', '<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Workshop was conducted by Dr. Medha Pandya.<br />\r\nAn informative and thoughts provoking workshop on &ldquo;Bioinformatics&rdquo; held on 7th July, 2023 at Gyanmanjari Science College, Bhavnagar. About 60 students benefited.</p>\r\n', '2023-07-07', '2023', 1, 0, '2024-02-21 19:53:09', '2024-02-21 19:53:09', NULL, NULL),
(82, 1, '5', '22', 'Design Competetion', '<p>On 10th october, 2023 GMIU mechanical department has organized a design competetion for Diploma and Degree students of mechanical engineering. Prof. Kamlesh K. Chauhan has planned this event very nicely and it has been started with introduction speech by HOD of Mechanical department Prof. Deepak S. Jani. The students has learned to develop 3d models and assembly drawing of mechanical components on computer softwares like Autocad, Solidworks, NX, etc. with the guidence of Prof. Kamlesh K. Chauhan and Prof. Chetan J. Parmar. Later, students have given task to identify, draw and explain specific industial components/products at the end of the event. All students were appreciated with certificates for their active participation and winners &amp; runnerup have been awarded.</p>\r\n', '2023-10-10', '2023', 1, 0, '2024-02-22 09:01:08', '2024-02-22 09:01:08', NULL, NULL),
(83, 1, '1', '2', 'Design Competetion', '<p>On 10th october, 2023 GMIU mechanical department has organized a design competetion for Diploma and Degree students of mechanical engineering. Prof. Kamlesh K. Chauhan has planned this event very nicely and it has been started with introduction speech by HOD of Mechanical department Prof. Deepak S. Jani. The students has learned to develop 3d models and assembly drawing of mechanical components on computer softwares like Autocad, Solidworks, NX, etc. with the guidence of Prof. Kamlesh K. Chauhan and Prof. Chetan J. Parmar. Later, students have given task to identify, draw and explain specific industial components/products at the end of the event. All students were appreciated with certificates for their active participation and winners &amp; runnerup have been awarded.</p>\r\n', '2023-10-10', '2023', 1, 0, '2024-02-22 09:01:46', '2024-02-22 09:01:46', NULL, NULL),
(84, 1, '1', '1', 'DEMO', '<p>ASASASASASASASAASASASA</p>\r\n', '2024-03-02', '2024', 0, 1, '2024-03-02 06:21:27', '2024-03-02 06:21:27', NULL, NULL),
(85, 1, '1', '5', 'python and Git Hub', '<p>Python is an interpreted, object-oriented, high-level programming language with dynamic semantics. Its high-level built in data structures, combined with dynamic typing and dynamic binding, make it very attractive for Rapid Application Development, as well as for use as a scripting or glue language to connect existing components together. Python&#39;s simple, easy to learn syntax emphasizes readability and therefore reduces the cost of program maintenance. Python supports modules and packages, which encourages program modularity and code reuse. The Python interpreter and the extensive standard library are available in source or binary form without charge for all major platforms, and can be freely distributed.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>GitHub is&nbsp;<strong>a code hosting platform for version control and collaboration</strong>. It lets you and others work together on projects from anywhere. This tutorial teaches you GitHub essentials like repositories, branches, commits, and pull requests.</p>\r\n', '2023-09-29', '2023', 1, 0, '2024-03-07 07:54:46', '2024-03-07 07:54:46', NULL, NULL),
(86, 1, '1', '5', 'Node JS and React JS', '<p> Workshop organized for the students of 5 th Degree of Computer Engineering on topic Node JS and React JS by Urvish Mulani (Founder and CEO of AZZIPTECH).<br />\r\n Students Of Computer Engineering has enjoy and Learn from this session and gain knowledge and improve himself about the basic fundamental of Node js and react js&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; technology and get more practical aspect of this technolology for developing web based projects.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> This workshop has turned out to be very significant in learning the concepts of Node JS, React JS, which they can implement in their projects.<br />\r\n This Workshop has helped students to develop the skills and to identify their interests in the real time market</p>\r\n', '2023-09-30', '2023', 1, 0, '2024-03-07 07:57:31', '2024-03-07 07:57:31', NULL, NULL),
(87, 1, '1,5', '4,25', 'test', '<p>test</p>\r\n', '2024-03-09', '2024', 0, 1, '2024-03-11 08:35:28', '2024-03-11 08:35:28', NULL, NULL),
(88, 1, '5', '24', 'Resume Framing', '<p>The Department of Electrical Engineering had organized the workshop on resume framing for diploma engineering students.</p>\r\n', '2024-02-28', '2024', 1, 0, '2024-03-12 05:32:26', '2024-03-12 05:32:26', NULL, NULL),
(89, 1, '1', '4', 'Sketch Bridge Course', '<p>Sketch Workshop&nbsp; Activity</p>\r\n', '2024-07-16', '2024', 1, 0, '2024-07-16 14:36:43', '2024-07-16 14:36:43', NULL, NULL),
(90, 1, '1', '6', 'Blockchain', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\">Blockchain is a decentralized digital ledger that securely records transactions across multiple computers, making the data immutable and transparent. It operates without a central authority, using cryptographic techniques to ensure the integrity and security of the information.</p>\r\n', '2024-08-07', '2024', 1, 0, '2024-08-11 10:10:29', '2024-08-11 10:10:29', NULL, NULL),
(91, 1, '5', '25', 'demo', '<p>demo</p>\r\n', '2024-12-02', '2024', 0, 1, '2024-12-03 08:46:46', '2024-12-03 08:46:46', NULL, 11),
(92, 1, '5', '25', 'Android Mobile App Development', '<p>Gyanmanajari Innovative University organized a workshop on <strong>&quot;Android Mobile App Development&quot;</strong> for <strong>3rd Semester Diploma in Computer Engineering</strong> students, conducted by expert <strong>Divyam Oza</strong>.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The primary objective of the workshop was to provide students with a foundational understanding of Android app development. the session covered key topics including Android architecture, UI design principles, and the activity lifecycle.By the end of the workshop, students gained hands-on experience in building a basic Android application, integrating APIs, and applying essential debugging and testing techniques. This practical exposure equipped students with the skills necessary to further explore mobile app development.</p>\r\n', '2024-09-04', '2024', 1, 0, '2024-12-03 08:56:33', '2024-12-03 08:56:33', NULL, NULL),
(93, 1, '1', '4,233,245', 'Blockchain Technology', '<p>The objective of this workshop was to provide 5th Degree CE and IT students with a<br />\r\ncomprehensive understanding of blockchain technology. Led by experts from Lampros Labs,<br />\r\nthe session aimed to bridge the gap between theoretical knowledge and practical application<br />\r\nby demonstrating blockchain concepts through coding and real-time outputs. The workshop<br />\r\nsought to enhance students&amp;#39; skills and knowledge, preparing them for future advancements in<br />\r\nblockchain technology.</p>\r\n', '2024-07-12', '2024', 1, 0, '2024-12-03 09:04:39', '2024-12-03 09:04:39', NULL, NULL),
(94, 3, '1', '617', 'este', '<p>grfdg</p>\r\n', '2024-12-10', '2024', 0, 1, '2024-12-03 09:05:10', '2024-12-03 09:05:10', NULL, 2),
(95, 1, '1', '3', 'Enhance Your Career Prospects', '<p>A workshop on &quot;Enhance Your Career Prospects&quot; was held on 27/09/2024 at GMIU Seminar Hall, bringing together professionals, academics, and students to discuss the Resume Framing and LinkedIn Profile making. The event aimed to provide a platform for knowledge exchange, networking, and collaboration among participants.&nbsp;</p>\r\n', '2024-09-27', '2024', 1, 0, '2024-12-03 09:05:49', '2024-12-03 09:05:49', NULL, NULL),
