(118, 26, '1', '365', 'Moot Court', '<p>Moot Court is the most important event for law students. This event will help students prepare for the actual court case. The most important thing is their uniform. All over Gujarat, Moot Court is mostly a 5th or 6th semester subject but at GMIU we started it in the first semester to ensure a good outcome for our students. They held a debate on the newly amended BHARTIYA NYAY SANHITA Act, 2023. They presented a murder case from 1979 and created an atmosphere like a normal court.</p>\r\n', '2024-05-12', '2024', 1, 0, '2025-01-24 02:02:50', '2025-01-24 02:02:50', NULL, NULL),
(119, 1, '1', '290', 'Half-Day Awareness Workshop on Electric Vehicles', '<p>An Awareness Workshop on Electric Vehicles (EVs) was conducted under the &quot;Go Electric&quot; campaign at the Gyanmanjari Institute of Technology, Bhavnagar, Gujarat on 23rd December, 2024. The workshop was sponsored by Gujarat Energy Research and Management Institute (GERMI) in association with Gujarat Energy Development Agency (GEDA). The event was offline. The workshop aimed to educate the public on the benefits and intricacies of electric vehicles. The session, conducted by Mr. Shaishavsinh Raj, Deputy Manager at GERMI, and Mr. Manan Pathak, Project Officer at GERMI, saw active participation from a diverse audience. This initiative, supported by GEDA, and the GERMI, was an integral part of the &quot;Go Electric&quot; movement aimed at promoting sustainable transportation solutions.</p>\r\n', '2024-12-23', '2024', 1, 0, '2025-01-25 09:39:28', '2025-01-25 09:39:28', NULL, NULL),
(120, 1, '5', '23', 'Communication Skill Enhancement Activity', '<p style=\"margin-left:5px; margin-right:6px\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Improving communication skills, particularly in a technical field like IT, is crucial for effective collaboration, problem-solving, and leadership. Here are some tips and strategies tailored for IT professionals to enhance their communication skills. The activity conduct by Prof. Pooja Bhuva she&rsquo;s help to students to improve their communication skill and confidence.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:5px; text-align:justify\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n', '2024-08-23', '2024', 1, 0, '2025-01-30 11:54:47', '2025-01-30 11:54:47', NULL, NULL),
(121, 8, '1', '89', 'Research Workshop', '<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">The objective of a research activity is to systematically investigate a topic to generate new knowledge, validate existing theories, solve problems, and develop innovative solutions. It aims to explore unknown aspects of a subject, provide evidence-based insights, and enhance understanding of complex phenomena. Research can also help in decision-making, policy formulation, and technological advancements by offering reliable data and analysis. Additionally, it plays a crucial role in addressing real-world challenges, improving existing processes, and fostering intellectual and scientific progress across various fields.</span></span></p>\r\n', '2025-02-07', '2025', 1, 0, '2025-02-08 07:18:25', '2025-02-08 07:18:25', NULL, NULL),
(122, 8, '1', '89', 'Optimizing Your E-Commerce Store  With Magento', '<p>The objective of the workshop conducted by Mr. Chirag Doshi (COO of Milople) was to&nbsp;provide participants with a comprehensive understanding of Magento and equip them with&nbsp;the necessary skills to develop, customize, and optimize eCommerce stores using this&nbsp;powerful platform.</p>\r\n', '2025-02-13', '2025', 1, 0, '2025-02-15 05:53:56', '2025-02-15 05:53:56', NULL, NULL),
