(136, 1, '9', '246', 'Android App Development Workshop', '<p>The Android App Development Workshop provided students with comprehensive insights into mobile application development. Mr. Divyam Oza, an expert in the field, guided participants through the essentials of Android development, including the app structure, UI design, activity lifecycle, data management, and API integration. The workshop featured real-time demonstrations and hands-on coding sessions, enabling students to develop and test Android applications effectively.</p>\r\n', '2025-02-15', '2025', 1, 0, '2025-03-28 09:47:32', '2025-03-28 09:47:32', NULL, NULL),
(137, 1, '1', '6', 'Android App Development Workshop', '<p>The Android App Development Workshop provided students with comprehensive insights into mobile application development. Mr. Divyam Oza, an expert in the field, guided participants through the essentials of Android development, including the app structure, UI design, activity lifecycle, data management, and API integration. The workshop featured real-time demonstrations and hands-on coding sessions, enabling students to develop and test Android applications effectively.</p>\r\n', '2025-02-15', '2025', 1, 0, '2025-03-28 09:48:23', '2025-03-28 09:48:23', NULL, NULL),
(138, 1, '1', '6', 'Mobile Application Development', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\">The primary objective of the expert talk on Mobile Application Development was to provide students with a comprehensive understanding of the fundamentals and latest trends in mobile app development. The session aimed to bridge the gap between academic learning and industry practices by introducing real-world applications, development tools, and frameworks commonly used in the field.</p>\r\n', '2025-04-02', '2025', 1, 0, '2025-04-04 06:12:34', '2025-04-04 06:12:34', NULL, NULL),
(139, 1, '5', '23', 'Graphic Designing', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\">The objective of the expert talk on &ldquo;Graphic Design Core Concept&rdquo;, conducted by Mr. Jay V. Siddhapura, was to introduce students to the foundational principles and real-world applications of graphic design. The session aimed to enhance the creative thinking and visual communication skills of Diploma IT 4th-semester students by:Real-world examples were shared to demonstrate the impact of design in branding, marketing, advertising, and user experience. Case studies, including creative advertising campaigns by brands like McDonald&#39;s and Apple, helped students understand how powerful visuals can influence consumer behavior.</p>\r\n', '2025-04-03', '2025', 1, 0, '2025-04-05 09:12:28', '2025-04-05 09:12:28', NULL, NULL),
(140, 1, '1', '9', 'Gram staining', '<p><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\',serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">The objective of the Gram staining activity is to differentiate bacterial species into two groups, Gram-positive and Gram-negative, based on the composition of their cell walls. This differential staining technique involves a series of steps including the application of crystal violet, iodine, alcohol decolorization, and counterstaining with safranin.</span></span></span></p>\r\n', '2025-01-31', '2025', 1, 0, '2025-05-06 11:33:22', '2025-05-06 11:33:22', NULL, NULL),
(141, 1, '5', '23', 'Android App Development with Modern UI &amp; Firebase', '<p>The objective of the workshop was to provide students with industry-relevant skills in mobile app development, with a particular focus on building intuitive, modern user interfaces and integrating them with Firebase for backend functionalities such as authentication, real-time databases, and cloud storage. Students were introduced to the principles of modern UI design, the importance of user experience, and strategies to ensure scalability, security, and performance optimization in mobile applications. For diploma students, this knowledge is highly valuable, offering them a competitive advantage in academic projects, hackathons, internships, and job opportunities.</p>\r\n', '2025-08-11', '2025', 1, 0, '2025-08-12 04:48:26', '2025-08-12 04:48:26', NULL, NULL),
(142, 1, '5', '23', 'Android App Development with Modern UI &amp; Firebase', '<p>The session followed a hands-on methodology, ensuring students were actively engaged throughout the process. Participants worked step-by-step, starting from Android project setup and UI layout design, progressing to Firebase integration, implementing authentication modules, and managing real-time data. Live demonstrations, interactive coding activities, and peer-to-peer collaboration encouraged problem-solving, idea exchange, and debugging skills. By the end of the workshop, students had developed functional Android app prototypes combining sleek front-end designs with dynamic backend features. This practical achievement highlighted the IT Department&rsquo;s commitment to producing industry-ready graduates and reinforced its role as a hub for innovation and skill development.</p>\r\n', '2025-08-12', '2025', 1, 0, '2025-08-12 06:24:26', '2025-08-12 06:24:26', NULL, NULL),
(143, 1, '1', '6', 'Offense Meets Defense', '<p>The Department of Information Technology, GMIU Bhavnagar, organized a hands-on workshop on <strong>&ldquo;Offense Meets Defense: Cyber Security with Kali Linux&rdquo;</strong> on 25th August 2025. Conducted by Mr. Smit Patel from Kavayah Cybersecurity Pvt. Ltd., the session provided students with practical exposure to ethical hacking, penetration testing, and defensive security techniques. Around 80 students actively participated, gaining insights into real-world cyber threats and learning to implement essential security measures using Kali Linux. The workshop successfully bridged theoretical knowledge with practical skills, inspiring students to explore cybersecurity as a career path.</p>\r\n', '2025-08-25', '2025', 1, 0, '2025-08-29 05:07:20', '2025-08-29 05:07:20', NULL, NULL),
(144, 8, '1', '89', 'EXPLORE CODING &amp; AI: FROM BASIC TO FUTURE OPPORTUNITIES', '<p>CONDUCTED BY: KILON MEHTA FOUNDER-APEX SOFTWARE HOUSE</p>\r\n\r\n<p>LOCATION:TF-32</p>\r\n', '2025-09-04', '2025', 1, 0, '2025-10-04 09:33:47', '2025-10-04 09:33:47', NULL, NULL),
(145, 8, '2', '90', 'EXPLORE CODING &amp; AI: FROM BASIC TO FUTURE OPPORTUNITIES', '<p>CONDUCTED BY: KILON MEHTA FOUNDER-APEX SOFTWARE HOUSE</p>\r\n\r\n<p>LOCATION:TF-32</p>\r\n', '2025-09-04', '2025', 1, 0, '2025-10-04 09:39:10', '2025-10-04 09:39:10', NULL, NULL),
(146, 1, '5', '564', 'Cloud Excellence Program', '<p>The Department of Information Technology at Gyanmanjari Innovative University organized a Special Session for Diploma Premium Program students titled &ldquo;<strong>Journey to the Cloud</strong>,&rdquo; which provided valuable insights into cloud computing concepts, architectures, and their real-world applications. Led by <strong>Mr. Hiren H. Bhatt</strong>, the session emphasized the importance of cloud technologies in modern IT infrastructure and inspired students to think innovatively about digital transformation. Through interactive discussions and practical examples, students gained a comprehensive understanding of cloud models such as IaaS, PaaS, and SaaS, and explored how cloud technologies drive business agility, scalability, and innovation.</p>\r\n', '2025-10-14', '2025', 1, 0, '2025-10-17 10:53:03', '2025-10-17 10:53:03', NULL, NULL),
(147, 1, '1', '3', 'Entrepreneurs Interaction', '<p style=\"margin-left:49px\"><span style=\"font-size:15.960000038146973pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\',serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Objective of Talk&nbsp;</strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:48px; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\',serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">World Entrepreneurs&rsquo; Day is celebrated globally on </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\',serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>21st August </strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\',serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">to honor innovation,&nbsp; leadership, and entrepreneurial spirit. Gyanmanjari University organized this event with the active participation of </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\',serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Degree students </strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\',serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">from various disciplines. The program aimed to promote awareness about entrepreneurship and encourage students to develop creative ideas and skills for becoming future leaders.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:72px; margin-right:134px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\',serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAABMAAAAOCAYAAADNGCeJAAAAYklEQVR4AexSuQ0AIQw73RDMwBiUjE3HEAzABjQ0uElnRS5AogA5jYmdR/m/je9+s4hpE4kMToaNGaAoJAY4GWYmC7zEZ+Zth/8d2VlDLXZnE7wM66xDwe6sgpdhZrLAS1wAAAD//+6o2RUAAAAGSURBVAMAHMUPHd9Xp/QAAAAASUVORK5CYII=\" style=\"height:18px; width:25px\" /></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\',serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">To create awareness about the importance of entrepreneurship in the modern economy. </span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:72px; margin-right:134px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\',serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAABMAAAAOCAYAAADNGCeJAAAAYklEQVR4AexSuQ0AIQw73RDMwBiUjE3HEAzABjQ0uElnRS5AogA5jYmdR/m/je9+s4hpE4kMToaNGaAoJAY4GWYmC7zEZ+Zth/8d2VlDLXZnE7wM66xDwe6sgpdhZrLAS1wAAAD//+6o2RUAAAAGSURBVAMAHMUPHd9Xp/QAAAAASUVORK5CYII=\" style=\"height:18px; width:25px\" /></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\',serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">To inspire students with real-life success stories of entrepreneurs.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:72px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\',serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAABMAAAAOCAYAAADNGCeJAAAAYklEQVR4AexSuQ0AIQw73RDMwBiUjE3HEAzABjQ0uElnRS5AogA5jYmdR/m/je9+s4hpE4kMToaNGaAoJAY4GWYmC7zEZ+Zth/8d2VlDLXZnE7wM66xDwe6sgpdhZrLAS1wAAAD//+6o2RUAAAAGSURBVAMAHMUPHd9Xp/QAAAAASUVORK5CYII=\" style=\"height:18px; width:25px\" /></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\',serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">To promote innovation, creativity, and a self-employment mindset among students.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:72px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\',serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAABMAAAAOCAYAAADNGCeJAAAAYklEQVR4AexSuQ0AIQw73RDMwBiUjE3HEAzABjQ0uElnRS5AogA5jYmdR/m/je9+s4hpE4kMToaNGaAoJAY4GWYmC7zEZ+Zth/8d2VlDLXZnE7wM66xDwe6sgpdhZrLAS1wAAAD//+6o2RUAAAAGSURBVAMAHMUPHd9Xp/QAAAAASUVORK5CYII=\" style=\"height:18px; width:25px\" /></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\',serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">To provide a platform for students to showcase their entrepreneurial ideas.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:49px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\',serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Guest Speaker:&nbsp;</strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:48px; margin-right:28px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\',serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">The program was graced by </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\',serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Dr. Vimal Jagad </strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\',serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">from </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\',serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Centre for Entrepreneurship Development (CED),&nbsp; Bhavnagar</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\',serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, who shared his valuable insights and experiences about entrepreneurship, innovation, and startup culture.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:72px\"><span style=\"font-size:15.960000038146973pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\',serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>About the Activity:&nbsp;</strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:72px; margin-right:13px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\',serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">The program began with a welcome speech by the faculty coordinator, highlighting the significance of World&nbsp; Entrepreneurs&rsquo; Day. Several activities were conducted, including:&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:73px; margin-right:21px\"><span style=\"font-size:9.960000038146973pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Noto Sans Symbols\',sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">&bull; </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\',serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Expert Talk / Guest Session: </strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\',serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Eminent entrepreneurs shared their journey, challenges, and strategies for success.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:73px; margin-right:61px\"><span style=\"font-size:9.960000038146973pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Noto Sans Symbols\',sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">&bull; </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\',serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Student Participation: </strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\',serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Degree students presented innovative business ideas, models, and start-up concepts.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:73px; margin-right:4px\"><span style=\"font-size:9.960000038146973pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Noto Sans Symbols\',sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">&bull; </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\',serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Interactive Session: </strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\',serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Students interacted with experts to clear doubts regarding funding, business planning,&nbsp; and execution.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:73px; margin-right:38px\"><span style=\"font-size:9.960000038146973pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Noto Sans Symbols\',sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">&bull; </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\',serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Entrepreneurship Quiz/Presentation: </strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\',serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">To engage students in learning entrepreneurial concepts in an&nbsp; interactive way.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:48px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\',serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">&nbsp;</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\',serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong><u>Outcome of the Program:&nbsp;</u></strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:73px; margin-right:116px\"><span style=\"font-size:9.960000038146973pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Noto Sans Symbols\',sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">&bull; </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\',serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Students gained knowledge about real-world entrepreneurial challenges and opportunities. </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:9.960000038146973pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Noto Sans Symbols\',sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">&bull; </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\',serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Enhanced confidence and motivation to think innovatively and independently.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:73px\"><span style=\"font-size:9.960000038146973pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Noto Sans Symbols\',sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">&bull; </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\',serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Exposure to the process of converting an idea into a startup or business venture.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:73px\"><span style=\"font-size:9.960000038146973pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Noto Sans Symbols\',sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">&bull; </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\',serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Strengthened the entrepreneurial ecosystem within the university.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:49px\"><span style=\"font-size:15.960000038146973pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\',serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Conclusion:&nbsp;</strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:72px; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\',serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">The celebration of World Entrepreneurs&rsquo; Day at Gyanmanjari University was a grand success. It inspired the&nbsp; Degree students to think beyond conventional career paths and to focus on innovation, leadership, and entrepreneurship. The event contributed significantly to building a strong foundation for future entrepreneurs among the students.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n', '2025-08-21', '2025', 1, 0, '2025-10-24 17:27:22', '2025-10-24 17:27:22', NULL, NULL),
(148, 1, '1', '212', 'Entrepreneurs Interaction', '<p style=\"margin-left:49px; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:16pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\',serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Objective of Talk&nbsp;</strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:48px; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\',serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">World Entrepreneurs&rsquo; Day is celebrated globally on </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\',serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>21st August </strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\',serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">to honor innovation,&nbsp; leadership, and entrepreneurial spirit. Gyanmanjari University organized this event with the active participation of </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\',serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Degree students </strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\',serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">from various disciplines. The program aimed to promote awareness about entrepreneurship and encourage students to develop creative ideas and skills for becoming future leaders.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:72px; margin-right:135px; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\',serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAABMAAAAOCAYAAADNGCeJAAAAYklEQVR4AexSuQ0AIQw73RDMwBiUjE3HEAzABjQ0uElnRS5AogA5jYmdR/m/je9+s4hpE4kMToaNGaAoJAY4GWYmC7zEZ+Zth/8d2VlDLXZnE7wM66xDwe6sgpdhZrLAS1wAAAD//+6o2RUAAAAGSURBVAMAHMUPHd9Xp/QAAAAASUVORK5CYII=\" style=\"height:19px; width:25px\" /></span></span></span><span style=\"